(1048187, 126184, 16648, '<td valign="top">The opera house is probably the best known landmark...i see it, but not much of it. In this Challenge, my eye is drawn to it, and then I question how/why the bridge is a landmark. Very nice exposure, color, etc.</td>', 'The opera house is probably the best known landmark...i see it, but not much of it. In this Challenge, my eye is drawn to it, and then I question how/why the bridge is a landmark. Very nice exposure, color, etc.', '2004-12-06 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
