(1048192, 126192, 16648, '<td valign="top">The rainbow is noce, but the pic is a bit underexpsed, the water is black - not pretty. the wite van in the bottom of the pic is distracting. A tighter crop mgiht have been better.</td>', 'The rainbow is noce, but the pic is a bit underexpsed, the water is black - not pretty. the wite van in the bottom of the pic is distracting. A tighter crop mgiht have been better.', '2004-12-06 01:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
