(1048200, 126214, 11518, '<td valign="top">Is that a person that I see through the broken window?  Nice B &amp; W tones.  Would perhaps have more impact if you had backed up a bit (if possible) to get the whole building with it`s surroundings.</td>', 'Is that a person that I see through the broken window?  Nice B & W tones.  Would perhaps have more impact if you had backed up a bit (if possible) to get the whole building with it`s surroundings.', '2004-12-06 01:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048204, 126294, 16648, '<td valign="top">The sun is pretty on the mountain top, but the sky is a putrid green shade. Also, the foreground is too dark to be seen, but not so dark as to recede from view - I ask myself why you left it there - what is in teh foreground you want me to see, and i see nothing. crop out the swampy river and burn the foregrounf, mask the sky and change it'';s hue to blue.</td>', 'The sun is pretty on the mountain top, but the sky is a putrid green shade. Also, the foreground is too dark to be seen, but not so dark as to recede from view - I ask myself why you left it there - what is in teh foreground you want me to see, and i see nothing. crop out the swampy river and burn the foregrounf, mask the sky and change it'';s hue to blue.', '2004-12-06 01:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048206, 124710, 4226, '<td valign="top">this image is overexposed, the bridge is blown out and you lose all details in the pillars. You might like to underexpose by about 0.5 or 1 stop for this image or take this one around sunset for better light</td>', 'this image is overexposed, the bridge is blown out and you lose all details in the pillars. You might like to underexpose by about 0.5 or 1 stop for this image or take this one around sunset for better light', '2004-12-06 01:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048207, 125284, 16648, '<td valign="top">I see alot of stuff inthe pic - not much of the subject thoug. It hasn''t fallen and looks like a wall? Are the traffic lights important to the message you are trying to communicate? if not, try another angle to elimnate them. Same for the red tractor, streetlight, etc.</td>', 'I see alot of stuff inthe pic - not much of the subject thoug. It hasn''t fallen and looks like a wall? Are the traffic lights important to the message you are trying to communicate? if not, try another angle to elimnate them. Same for the red tractor, streetlight, etc.', '2004-12-06 01:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048208, 125073, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wow looks like a Bobster lobster photo! ;)  Nice shot, very Lord-of-the-rings feel to it.</td>', 'Wow looks like a Bobster lobster photo! ;)  Nice shot, very Lord-of-the-rings feel to it.', '2004-12-06 01:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
