(1048210, 126192, 4226, '<td valign="top">great moment captured.</td>', 'great moment captured.', '2004-12-06 01:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048211, 126051, 11518, '<td valign="top">Ahhh the Reykjavik landmark... nicely done, B &amp; W works well here.</td>', 'Ahhh the Reykjavik landmark... nicely done, B & W works well here.', '2004-12-06 01:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048212, 126167, 16648, '<td valign="top">Pretty place, but not a compelling shot -very centered, the back of the bulding it looks like. Nothing to draw my eye or attention INTO the place. A  snapshot.</td>', 'Pretty place, but not a compelling shot -very centered, the back of the bulding it looks like. Nothing to draw my eye or attention INTO the place. A  snapshot.', '2004-12-06 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048214, 126041, 11518, '<td valign="top">NIce shot but waaay over-exposed for my taste.  Did you intend it to be overexposed?  I would have reduced the exposure by at least 2EV</td>', 'NIce shot but waaay over-exposed for my taste.  Did you intend it to be overexposed?  I would have reduced the exposure by at least 2EV', '2004-12-06 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048217, 125790, 16648, '<td valign="top">Looks like somcehting MC Escher might have dreamed up.</td>', 'Looks like somcehting MC Escher might have dreamed up.', '2004-12-06 01:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048218, 125969, 11518, '<td valign="top">The Sydney Opera house...one of the most photographed landmark in the world.  Well done, maybe waiting for dusk would have added some colours to the white roof.</td>', 'The Sydney Opera house...one of the most photographed landmark in the world.  Well done, maybe waiting for dusk would have added some colours to the white roof.', '2004-12-06 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048219, 125693, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very nice in some ways, but advanvced editing is allowed - the lights in the trees on the right side need darkened / cloned out. Pretty, a bit symetrical, a bot too snapshot like in composition for me.</td>', 'Very nice in some ways, but advanvced editing is allowed - the lights in the trees on the right side need darkened / cloned out. Pretty, a bit symetrical, a bot too snapshot like in composition for me.', '2004-12-06 01:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048222, 126240, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, how did you get the moon to be so big?  Is this s double exposure with a tele lens for the moon and a wide angle for the monument? 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot, how did you get the moon to be so big?  Is this s double exposure with a tele lens for the moon and a wide angle for the monument? 9', '2004-12-06 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048223, 126184, 11518, '<td valign="top">I would have included more of the Opera house, and reduce the exposure by 1EV</td>', 'I would have included more of the Opera house, and reduce the exposure by 1EV', '2004-12-06 01:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048225, 126283, 23458, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe it... two photos... of the same thing, with the same title.... this is the more interesting take though... (i have seen the exact same version of the other shot on this site... technically very good. 7.</td>', 'I can''t believe it... two photos... of the same thing, with the same title.... this is the more interesting take though... (i have seen the exact same version of the other shot on this site... technically very good. 7.', '2004-12-06 01:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048228, 126207, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a Reykjavik landmark.  B&amp; W makes it look very dramatic.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a Reykjavik landmark.  B& W makes it look very dramatic.', '2004-12-06 01:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048229, 125969, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like that you have attempted to come at it from a different angle... this looks a little washed out though. Maybe another time of day would work better.</td>', 'I like that you have attempted to come at it from a different angle... this looks a little washed out though. Maybe another time of day would work better.', '2004-12-06 01:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048230, 126202, 23458, '<td valign="top">hehehe... there are three photos of this thing here... why is he so popular ? :P. I like the colours - but a closer crop around the head would be better.</td>', 'hehehe... there are three photos of this thing here... why is he so popular ? :P. I like the colours - but a closer crop around the head would be better.', '2004-12-06 02:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048240, 126114, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image is virtually flawless - I love the lines of the road, the contrast between the clouds and the pollution. Composition is great and the editing is brilliant. 10. (hope you win). One thing.... the title sucks :)...too long winded (hey I had to criticise something).</td>', 'This image is virtually flawless - I love the lines of the road, the contrast between the clouds and the pollution. Composition is great and the editing is brilliant. 10. (hope you win). One thing.... the title sucks :)...too long winded (hey I had to criticise something).', '2004-12-06 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048244, 125933, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well I love the reflections here... and the exposure is perfect for this semi-night shot. Kudos for the attempt at a creative angle... but for some reason, with this shot, it doesn''t seem to work, but rather just makes me want to tilt my head to the side. 6.</td>', 'Well I love the reflections here... and the exposure is perfect for this semi-night shot. Kudos for the attempt at a creative angle... but for some reason, with this shot, it doesn''t seem to work, but rather just makes me want to tilt my head to the side. 6.', '2004-12-06 02:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048246, 125439, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting title... and great colours.. but honestly this seems a little flat and out of focus, you might be able to rescue it by bumping the contrast and maybe shapening.</td>', 'Interesting title... and great colours.. but honestly this seems a little flat and out of focus, you might be able to rescue it by bumping the contrast and maybe shapening.', '2004-12-06 02:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048249, 125861, 23458, '<td valign="top">Stunning, stunning, stunning... lowe the walkers in the foreground contrasting with the static building... beats the pants of the standard night shot with the moving car lights in the foreground. <br/> <br/>Great...9. you''re in with a great shot at the top three here.</td>', 'Stunning, stunning, stunning... lowe the walkers in the foreground contrasting with the static building... beats the pants of the standard night shot with the moving car lights in the foreground.  Great...9. you''re in with a great shot at the top three here.', '2004-12-06 02:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048252, 125957, 16648, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. The green cast makes it very sci-fi.</td>', 'Cool shot. The green cast makes it very sci-fi.', '2004-12-06 02:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048255, 125024, 16648, '<td valign="top">The buildings and lights in the foreground add nothing but distraction. you could have cloned them out or made them darker -or better yet, tried a different angle on the tower.</td>', 'The buildings and lights in the foreground add nothing but distraction. you could have cloned them out or made them darker -or better yet, tried a different angle on the tower.', '2004-12-06 02:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048256, 126018, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellently captured! im loving the cloudy feeling in the sky. 10</td>', 'excellently captured! im loving the cloudy feeling in the sky. 10', '2004-12-06 02:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048261, 125336, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors, and some interesting lines.  Its just missing some sort of context to give it that extra impact as a landmark.  6</td>', 'Very cool colors, and some interesting lines.  Its just missing some sort of context to give it that extra impact as a landmark.  6', '2004-12-06 02:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048268, 125969, 7151, '<td valign="top">Assuming this is the Sidney Opera House, you get an extra point for finding a view other than the obvious.  A little deepening of the blue in the sky might have made it stand out a littel better though.</td>', 'Assuming this is the Sidney Opera House, you get an extra point for finding a view other than the obvious.  A little deepening of the blue in the sky might have made it stand out a littel better though.', '2004-12-06 02:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048270, 126014, 7151, '<td valign="top">She''s looking a bit flat these days...</td>', 'She''s looking a bit flat these days...', '2004-12-06 02:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048271, 126289, 22384, '<td valign="top">The dusky greyscale and headlights give this an interesting film noire look. It is a very appealing image for me. I want to turn your lens toward the right a bit so I can  see more of the traffic and less of the skyline. Great job evoking a very specific mood.</td>', 'The dusky greyscale and headlights give this an interesting film noire look. It is a very appealing image for me. I want to turn your lens toward the right a bit so I can  see more of the traffic and less of the skyline. Great job evoking a very specific mood.', '2004-12-06 02:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048275, 125437, 22384, '<td valign="top">The lighting distracts from this image. I like the concept. The steeple and the white cross at the top are striking, so brilliantly white. Maybe shooting from a perspective of looking up with the cross at the apex of your image could be powerful. Just a thought.</td>', 'The lighting distracts from this image. I like the concept. The steeple and the white cross at the top are striking, so brilliantly white. Maybe shooting from a perspective of looking up with the cross at the apex of your image could be powerful. Just a thought.', '2004-12-06 02:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048279, 126188, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, nice range of golds in the light and shadow. The brightness of the light globe is distracting an pulls my eye as the focal point of this image. If that is what you intended, then the light globe should be bigger, if not then it should be diminished.<br/>I love the line and use of motif in this image. Many good things about this shot.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, nice range of golds in the light and shadow. The brightness of the light globe is distracting an pulls my eye as the focal point of this image. If that is what you intended, then the light globe should be bigger, if not then it should be diminished.I love the line and use of motif in this image. Many good things about this shot.', '2004-12-06 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048280, 125309, 22384, '<td valign="top">There are too many things competing for my attention in this photo. Also, the sky seems absent.</td>', 'There are too many things competing for my attention in this photo. Also, the sky seems absent.', '2004-12-06 03:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048281, 125619, 22384, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like artistic blur in a photo, but it works here. It gives this image a strangely surreal appeal. I like this shot.</td>', 'I usually don''t like artistic blur in a photo, but it works here. It gives this image a strangely surreal appeal. I like this shot.', '2004-12-06 03:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048282, 126049, 22384, '<td valign="top">I would crop in tighter on the clock. Its intense yellow and black (or dark green) color makes it unique and a powerful focal point. As it is, the leftside buildings are stealing from its power. The sky seems nonexistent.</td>', 'I would crop in tighter on the clock. Its intense yellow and black (or dark green) color makes it unique and a powerful focal point. As it is, the leftside buildings are stealing from its power. The sky seems nonexistent.', '2004-12-06 03:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048283, 126242, 22384, '<td valign="top">I want to see your focal point, your landmark, more clearly (despite the fact that it is a hazy day.) Crop in tighter, and let it own more of the frame. It seems almost and after thought.</td>', 'I want to see your focal point, your landmark, more clearly (despite the fact that it is a hazy day.) Crop in tighter, and let it own more of the frame. It seems almost and after thought.', '2004-12-06 03:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048284, 126211, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. Top notch shot. I am eager to read about your post-processing techniques. How did you get this amazing "starlit" quality? It is brilliant.</td>', 'This is stunning. Top notch shot. I am eager to read about your post-processing techniques. How did you get this amazing "starlit" quality? It is brilliant.', '2004-12-06 03:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048285, 126018, 16004, '<td valign="top">Well, worlds tallest tower...   this is a great photo though - very elegant portrayal of something you get to see quite a bit on this site.  i love the greenish tinged mist at the base of the shot, gives a very nice feel to the overall composure.  not entirely sure if the narrow width of the picture is to my liking, but overall, great stuff.  8.</td>', 'Well, worlds tallest tower...   this is a great photo though - very elegant portrayal of something you get to see quite a bit on this site.  i love the greenish tinged mist at the base of the shot, gives a very nice feel to the overall composure.  not entirely sure if the narrow width of the picture is to my liking, but overall, great stuff.  8.', '2004-12-06 03:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048287, 126240, 26679, '<td valign="top">This image is lovely, I wish you could have moved around (or probably waited for time to pass) to keep stone henge central and The Moon off centre, either way, it,s a good idea, well shot.</td>', 'This image is lovely, I wish you could have moved around (or probably waited for time to pass) to keep stone henge central and The Moon off centre, either way, it,s a good idea, well shot.', '2004-12-06 03:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048288, 126153, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I want to be able to see the bridge section in the background better. I am a novice at night shots so I don''t know how to tell you to capture that a better. The lighting on the bridge: the tailights, headlights and streetlights, do work nicely to create the  just-past-dusk feel of the arrival  of night.</td>', 'Great idea, but I want to be able to see the bridge section in the background better. I am a novice at night shots so I don''t know how to tell you to capture that a better. The lighting on the bridge: the tailights, headlights and streetlights, do work nicely to create the  just-past-dusk feel of the arrival  of night.', '2004-12-06 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048291, 126293, 22384, '<td valign="top">If this is the Supreme Court, and I believe it is, I would pull back and get more of those awesome steps while keeping the motif of the columns. Nice value range, but that shadowed image to the lower left is distracting because it contrasts too intensely with the light values in the columns.</td>', 'If this is the Supreme Court, and I believe it is, I would pull back and get more of those awesome steps while keeping the motif of the columns. Nice value range, but that shadowed image to the lower left is distracting because it contrasts too intensely with the light values in the columns.', '2004-12-06 03:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048296, 126159, 22384, '<td valign="top">There is not enough in this image to make it work for me.</td>', 'There is not enough in this image to make it work for me.', '2004-12-06 03:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048297, 125442, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of greyscale. The trees clutter your main image, obscuring it too much.</td>', 'Nice use of greyscale. The trees clutter your main image, obscuring it too much.', '2004-12-06 03:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048300, 125893, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant contrasts &amp; the blue on blue really works here</td>', 'Excellant contrasts & the blue on blue really works here', '2004-12-06 03:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048302, 126240, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Stunning. One of the best!</td>', 'I love this shot. Stunning. One of the best!', '2004-12-06 03:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048303, 125587, 16004, '<td valign="top">hey!  i know this building!  fantastic isn''t it?  personally, i found it a right bugger to get a decent shot of it whole (streets are far too narrow), but here you''ve proved that you can get interesting shots of just a few certain details.  the colours are lovely, but there is slight evidence of some excessive post editting (artefacts around the edge of the building).  it''s a good viewpoint though, and you''ve certainly captured the industrial feel of this wonderful office building.  7.</td>', 'hey!  i know this building!  fantastic isn''t it?  personally, i found it a right bugger to get a decent shot of it whole (streets are far too narrow), but here you''ve proved that you can get interesting shots of just a few certain details.  the colours are lovely, but there is slight evidence of some excessive post editting (artefacts around the edge of the building).  it''s a good viewpoint though, and you''ve certainly captured the industrial feel of this wonderful office building.  7.', '2004-12-06 03:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048316, 125587, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2004-12-06 03:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048317, 126014, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but the tower could be sharper I think</td>', 'Great composition, but the tower could be sharper I think', '2004-12-06 03:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048318, 125054, 28742, '<td valign="top">perfect!</td>', 'perfect!', '2004-12-06 03:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048327, 126291, 6458, '<td valign="top">Damn. I didn''t realize there were any Binghamtonian''s on DPC. Not sure if I''d call this a Binghamton landmark, but it''s a nice picture. Didn''t realize the Mall could look that nice :)</td>', 'Damn. I didn''t realize there were any Binghamtonian''s on DPC. Not sure if I''d call this a Binghamton landmark, but it''s a nice picture. Didn''t realize the Mall could look that nice :)', '2004-12-06 04:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
