(1048337, 126029, 24642, '<td valign="top">This one reminds me of Tin Tins rocket :-)  The colors are very cool and I like the lighting on the lighthouse.  I find the composition somewhat distracting, seems to lack balance, maybe a different viewpoint would have helped.  There is very much noise which you surely could have gotten out of the way.</td>', 'This one reminds me of Tin Tins rocket :-)  The colors are very cool and I like the lighting on the lighthouse.  I find the composition somewhat distracting, seems to lack balance, maybe a different viewpoint would have helped.  There is very much noise which you surely could have gotten out of the way.', '2004-12-06 04:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048338, 125790, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  Seems to suffer from too much color saturation.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  Seems to suffer from too much color saturation.', '2004-12-06 04:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048340, 125933, 28742, '<td valign="top">I won''t be the only one to say it - BAD angle. Good photo otherwise.</td>', 'I won''t be the only one to say it - BAD angle. Good photo otherwise.', '2004-12-06 04:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048341, 125957, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hooray! FInally a Space Needle shot. This woulda been my subject (I live in the area) but didn''t make it in time. where was this shot from?</td>', 'Hooray! FInally a Space Needle shot. This woulda been my subject (I live in the area) but didn''t make it in time. where was this shot from?', '2004-12-06 04:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048344, 125731, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nothing a little Viagra can''t fix!  ;-)  Needs to be lightened up.</td>', 'Nothing a little Viagra can''t fix!  ;-)  Needs to be lightened up.', '2004-12-06 04:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048346, 126199, 28742, '<td valign="top">If nobody else will say it, I will: You got a lotta balls.  ;-)  Nicely composed.</td>', 'If nobody else will say it, I will: You got a lotta balls.  ;-)  Nicely composed.', '2004-12-06 04:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048355, 126207, 23458, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective, love the shadows, it does look a little blown out around the clouds on the left - and the burning (If thats what you did) in the top right makes it almost look splotchy - but that''s all just nitpicking - 10.</td>', 'Excellent perspective, love the shadows, it does look a little blown out around the clouds on the left - and the burning (If thats what you did) in the top right makes it almost look splotchy - but that''s all just nitpicking - 10.', '2004-12-06 04:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048358, 125854, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous scene, well captured... but considering all those trees are the same I wouldn''t really say that any of them is a landmark - seems like a stretch to meet the challenge... Oh well, its a great shot so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt :).</td>', 'This is a gorgeous scene, well captured... but considering all those trees are the same I wouldn''t really say that any of them is a landmark - seems like a stretch to meet the challenge... Oh well, its a great shot so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt :).', '2004-12-06 04:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048359, 126029, 23458, '<td valign="top">See thats just not fair... not only do you have access to a great lighthouse, but you can see the northern lights - unfair photographic advantage... <br/> <br/>Does look a tad over-processed, but no major dramas there. 9.</td>', 'See thats just not fair... not only do you have access to a great lighthouse, but you can see the northern lights - unfair photographic advantage...  Does look a tad over-processed, but no major dramas there. 9.', '2004-12-06 04:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048375, 125969, 19474, '<td valign="top">I was sooo going to take this shot, but was unable to get into town at the right time of the day<br/>I had invissioned the shot with a slight different angle making the sails wider and shorter with more sky<br/>I think this would be improved by saturating it more and bosting contrast... was the shot taken in the middle of the day? as it seems a little flat with very even midday sun, try this again just on sunset to get more shadow/deffintion in the curves of the sails  +7</td>', 'I was sooo going to take this shot, but was unable to get into town at the right time of the dayI had invissioned the shot with a slight different angle making the sails wider and shorter with more skyI think this would be improved by saturating it more and bosting contrast... was the shot taken in the middle of the day? as it seems a little flat with very even midday sun, try this again just on sunset to get more shadow/deffintion in the curves of the sails  +7', '2004-12-06 05:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048380, 125627, 19474, '<td valign="top">this is a brilliant photo. I have been looking at it for about 6 mins and have only just realized that it is the river thames and not a rain covered courtyard with a modern sculpture on it...the more I look the more I see. I love the overall coloring and the detail in the bridge support not to mention the main subject, the composition is perfect<br/>have added it to my favs.. a well deserved 10</td>', 'this is a brilliant photo. I have been looking at it for about 6 mins and have only just realized that it is the river thames and not a rain covered courtyard with a modern sculpture on it...the more I look the more I see. I love the overall coloring and the detail in the bridge support not to mention the main subject, the composition is perfecthave added it to my favs.. a well deserved 10', '2004-12-06 05:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048393, 126126, 27812, '<td valign="top">you have captured a most beatiful picture, well composed and impressive use of white.</td>', 'you have captured a most beatiful picture, well composed and impressive use of white.', '2004-12-06 06:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048394, 126283, 27812, '<td valign="top">great job on what i think is a very difficult subject.<br/></td>', 'great job on what i think is a very difficult subject.', '2004-12-06 06:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048395, 126162, 27812, '<td valign="top">great shot weel captured. i like the colors and composition.</td>', 'great shot weel captured. i like the colors and composition.', '2004-12-06 06:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048396, 126082, 27812, '<td valign="top">fantastic b&amp;w... truely magnificent. i like the composition.<br/></td>', 'fantastic b&w... truely magnificent. i like the composition.', '2004-12-06 06:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048397, 125790, 25355, '<td valign="top">First thought was that I was looking at an Escher print...</td>', 'First thought was that I was looking at an Escher print...', '2004-12-06 06:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048398, 126298, 27812, '<td valign="top">you did well in bringing out the character of this majestic place.</td>', 'you did well in bringing out the character of this majestic place.', '2004-12-06 06:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048400, 126191, 27812, '<td valign="top">great composition, proof that everything should not be a ''rule of thirds'' slave.</td>', 'great composition, proof that everything should not be a ''rule of thirds'' slave.', '2004-12-06 06:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048401, 126252, 23394, '<td valign="top">i used to make that commute...uhhg.  nice composition/cropping.</td>', 'i used to make that commute...uhhg.  nice composition/cropping.', '2004-12-06 06:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048403, 125656, 27812, '<td valign="top">i think this is a masterpiece, something to save. great work with what so easily could be a boring subject.</td>', 'i think this is a masterpiece, something to save. great work with what so easily could be a boring subject.', '2004-12-06 06:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048405, 126049, 27812, '<td valign="top">nice picture. my personal feeling is it could benefit by being less soft, having more strong and richer colors. as someone told me in previous feedback, post editing  is as important as taking the pic.</td>', 'nice picture. my personal feeling is it could benefit by being less soft, having more strong and richer colors. as someone told me in previous feedback, post editing  is as important as taking the pic.', '2004-12-06 06:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048406, 126167, 27812, '<td valign="top">great pic. personally i would have cropped it a touch left or right for a more balanced feeling. nothing wrong with the pic, however.</td>', 'great pic. personally i would have cropped it a touch left or right for a more balanced feeling. nothing wrong with the pic, however.', '2004-12-06 06:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048408, 125957, 27812, '<td valign="top">i know a winner when i see one. your use of the foreground structure to frame your topic must be a lesson to all new guys like me. yip, i see a ribbon comming.</td>', 'i know a winner when i see one. your use of the foreground structure to frame your topic must be a lesson to all new guys like me. yip, i see a ribbon comming.', '2004-12-06 06:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048409, 125791, 27812, '<td valign="top">you have captured more than an image... you have captured the feeling. congratulations on something great.</td>', 'you have captured more than an image... you have captured the feeling. congratulations on something great.', '2004-12-06 06:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048410, 126160, 23394, '<td valign="top">i wonder who took this?  nice composition.  this is a tough one to get.  the lighting tends to wash out the details.  would love to see some of the other shots.</td>', 'i wonder who took this?  nice composition.  this is a tough one to get.  the lighting tends to wash out the details.  would love to see some of the other shots.', '2004-12-06 06:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048411, 126039, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is thing i love about dpc.  here''s something i had never seen before dpc, and now i immediately recognize it.  almost like that haystack thing that zoomdak does ;)<br/> <br/>beautiful shot, great composition.</td>', 'this is thing i love about dpc.  here''s something i had never seen before dpc, and now i immediately recognize it.  almost like that haystack thing that zoomdak does ;) beautiful shot, great composition.', '2004-12-06 06:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048413, 125933, 25355, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the photo makes me feel a bit queasy; nice image, nonetheless.</td>', 'The tilt of the photo makes me feel a bit queasy; nice image, nonetheless.', '2004-12-06 06:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048414, 126300, 25355, '<td valign="top">I knew this would appear again.</td>', 'I knew this would appear again.', '2004-12-06 06:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048415, 125540, 25355, '<td valign="top">You love taking photos of this guy, don''t you.</td>', 'You love taking photos of this guy, don''t you.', '2004-12-06 06:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048417, 126041, 28575, '<td valign="top">great shot !</td>', 'great shot !', '2004-12-06 06:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048425, 125627, 16004, '<td valign="top">cor, a few of you blokes went down to the Tate last week, didn''t you?  this is a marvellous image of Wrens finest - the lovely blues go very well for the selective desat - which itself works well and has been employed effectively.  though, it''s so convincing i can''t be 100% sure if it was desatted.  the bridge, the cathedral, the river and surrounding buildings all work together and forms a wonderful composition - would not look out of place framed and for sale on some tourist friendly stall.  excellent job - 10</td>', 'cor, a few of you blokes went down to the Tate last week, didn''t you?  this is a marvellous image of Wrens finest - the lovely blues go very well for the selective desat - which itself works well and has been employed effectively.  though, it''s so convincing i can''t be 100% sure if it was desatted.  the bridge, the cathedral, the river and surrounding buildings all work together and forms a wonderful composition - would not look out of place framed and for sale on some tourist friendly stall.  excellent job - 10', '2004-12-06 07:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048444, 125860, 24065, '<td valign="top">Ah! Can''t wait to see who else is from Alabama :)  Very good perspective.<br/> <br/>p.s.  Warrrrrrr Eagle!      :D</td>', 'Ah! Can''t wait to see who else is from Alabama :)  Very good perspective. p.s.  Warrrrrrr Eagle!      :D', '2004-12-06 07:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048445, 125862, 29945, '<td valign="top">Funny,,I just saw another users photo of this..but they said it was in New York</td>', 'Funny,,I just saw another users photo of this..but they said it was in New York', '2004-12-06 08:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048446, 126172, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beaufitul photograph -- composition is pleasing, dof is grand, colors are beautiful, etc. etc.</td>', 'Beaufitul photograph -- composition is pleasing, dof is grand, colors are beautiful, etc. etc.', '2004-12-06 08:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048449, 126114, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The composition is a bit tense, the road leading the aye to the right but then the main subject is to the left, but I like it.  The tones are good and it seems to me you have done a good job in the post processing.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The composition is a bit tense, the road leading the aye to the right but then the main subject is to the left, but I like it.  The tones are good and it seems to me you have done a good job in the post processing.', '2004-12-06 08:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048451, 126203, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very literal landmark.  The composition is decent, pov is good.  Some noise filtering would probably help.</td>', 'A very literal landmark.  The composition is decent, pov is good.  Some noise filtering would probably help.', '2004-12-06 08:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048466, 125797, 27839, '<td valign="top">I love the way the curtains are framing the tower.</td>', 'I love the way the curtains are framing the tower.', '2004-12-06 08:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048469, 125709, 14986, '<td valign="top">The shot is nice a clear, but it strikes me as pretty much just a snapshot, nothing creative.  The pyramid looking building also appears to me to be a little out of focus, but it''s kind of hard to tell from this distance.</td>', 'The shot is nice a clear, but it strikes me as pretty much just a snapshot, nothing creative.  The pyramid looking building also appears to me to be a little out of focus, but it''s kind of hard to tell from this distance.', '2004-12-06 08:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048470, 126250, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the b/w for this shot.   I think it brings out the texture of the structure.  I think I would have cloned out the two poles or whatever they are on each side.  I would like to also see the color version of this.  Still, nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the b/w for this shot.   I think it brings out the texture of the structure.  I think I would have cloned out the two poles or whatever they are on each side.  I would like to also see the color version of this.  Still, nicely done!', '2004-12-06 08:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048475, 125284, 14986, '<td valign="top">Brrrr.....although, I like snow and this is a pretty looking snowfall.   A picture of the skyline through the snow might not have been a terrible idea, but I don''t dare for all the foreground distractions....the traffic light, the street light, and particularly the tree right in front of your main building.   I think composition could have been improved by moving to a different angle.</td>', 'Brrrr.....although, I like snow and this is a pretty looking snowfall.   A picture of the skyline through the snow might not have been a terrible idea, but I don''t dare for all the foreground distractions....the traffic light, the street light, and particularly the tree right in front of your main building.   I think composition could have been improved by moving to a different angle.', '2004-12-06 08:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048481, 126029, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s leaning a bit to the right.   I would straighten it.  Otherwise an interesting shot....looks like a moon landing or something!</td>', 'Looks like it''s leaning a bit to the right.   I would straighten it.  Otherwise an interesting shot....looks like a moon landing or something!', '2004-12-06 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048483, 126051, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot, and I like the silvery tones.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot, and I like the silvery tones.', '2004-12-06 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048484, 125728, 25500, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Good color on the greens on the upper part of the gate.  The cropping feels a bit close too me, but otherwise high marks.  If you are there on a trip, enjoy the photo ops - lots of good opportunities.</td>', 'Great shot.  Good color on the greens on the upper part of the gate.  The cropping feels a bit close too me, but otherwise high marks.  If you are there on a trip, enjoy the photo ops - lots of good opportunities.', '2004-12-06 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048485, 126038, 14986, '<td valign="top">Something different, to be sure - but I dont'' find it very interesting as a photo.</td>', 'Something different, to be sure - but I dont'' find it very interesting as a photo.', '2004-12-06 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048486, 126142, 208, '<td valign="top">Oh, dear God -- There are THREE of us?!</td>', 'Oh, dear God -- There are THREE of us?!', '2004-12-06 08:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048487, 126160, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp and clear shot.  I''d score it higher if it had some creativity to the composition or angle.</td>', 'Nice crisp and clear shot.  I''d score it higher if it had some creativity to the composition or angle.', '2004-12-06 08:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048488, 126202, 208, '<td valign="top">AAAAAAHHHHHHHHH!!!!<br/>Another Big Chicken shot! NOOOOOOOOOOOO!<br/>Who''d''ve thunk there''d be two of us? What are the odds?<br/> <br/>ETA: make that THREE</td>', 'AAAAAAHHHHHHHHH!!!!Another Big Chicken shot! NOOOOOOOOOOOO!Who''d''ve thunk there''d be two of us? What are the odds? ETA: make that THREE', '2004-12-06 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048489, 126191, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the framing here, but I think it overwhelms your main subject just a bit.  I think I would have moved in just a bit closer, but then I guess you''d lose the lighting on the left side.   All in all a nice photo.</td>', 'I like the idea of the framing here, but I think it overwhelms your main subject just a bit.  I think I would have moved in just a bit closer, but then I guess you''d lose the lighting on the left side.   All in all a nice photo.', '2004-12-06 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048490, 126041, 27839, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2004-12-06 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048491, 125854, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors and composition of this shot.   I''m not seeing a strong connection to landmark, mainly because there are a number of trees here and it doesn''t really stand out.   Still, as a photo, I like it a lot.</td>', 'I really love the colors and composition of this shot.   I''m not seeing a strong connection to landmark, mainly because there are a number of trees here and it doesn''t really stand out.   Still, as a photo, I like it a lot.', '2004-12-06 08:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048494, 126301, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I think I would prefer a little less black.  I would have cropped it in just a bit more.  I like the reflections.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I think I would prefer a little less black.  I would have cropped it in just a bit more.  I like the reflections.', '2004-12-06 08:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048497, 126028, 14986, '<td valign="top">The negative space on this one just doesn''t appeal to me.  I think the technical aspects are done well...I just don''t find the subject and composition appealing.</td>', 'The negative space on this one just doesn''t appeal to me.  I think the technical aspects are done well...I just don''t find the subject and composition appealing.', '2004-12-06 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048498, 125862, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to check makeup on your lunch break!  I thought our town had bragging rights for some ..ahem...questionable art - but this is right up there!  It''s a good shot of it, but I would have liked something a bit more creative than this straight-on shot.</td>', 'Looks like a great place to check makeup on your lunch break!  I thought our town had bragging rights for some ..ahem...questionable art - but this is right up there!  It''s a good shot of it, but I would have liked something a bit more creative than this straight-on shot.', '2004-12-06 08:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048499, 126159, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and lines of this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the colors and lines of this shot.  Nicely done.', '2004-12-06 08:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048500, 126140, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and lighting of this shot.</td>', 'I really like the composition and lighting of this shot.', '2004-12-06 08:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048503, 126228, 27839, '<td valign="top">I thinks photo is a little to dark.</td>', 'I thinks photo is a little to dark.', '2004-12-06 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048504, 126294, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place. Nice shot.  I would have straightened it just a bit and cropped some of the sky out.</td>', 'Beautiful place. Nice shot.  I would have straightened it just a bit and cropped some of the sky out.', '2004-12-06 08:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048505, 126037, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks like you knew just when to be there!  NIce shot!   With the great contrasts in this photo, I''ll be it looks good in b/w too...although I like the color.</td>', 'Looks like you knew just when to be there!  NIce shot!   With the great contrasts in this photo, I''ll be it looks good in b/w too...although I like the color.', '2004-12-06 08:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048527, 126041, 24951, '<td valign="top">A beautiful night shot. Great tones and detail.10</td>', 'A beautiful night shot. Great tones and detail.10', '2004-12-06 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048528, 125791, 24951, '<td valign="top">Your background and tones add to sculpture and to the subject matter. 10<br/></td>', 'Your background and tones add to sculpture and to the subject matter. 10', '2004-12-06 09:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048532, 125627, 24951, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot well composed. Great detail. Even the thumbnail looks terrific. Really eye-catching. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot well composed. Great detail. Even the thumbnail looks terrific. Really eye-catching. 10', '2004-12-06 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048538, 126230, 8637, '<td valign="top">Incredible...all of Atlanta and three of us see the BC as our major landmark!  Wonder what the rest of the world thinks?  Great shot...I also had thought of trying this angle but it was after I had shot my other angle and did not go back to try.</td>', 'Incredible...all of Atlanta and three of us see the BC as our major landmark!  Wonder what the rest of the world thinks?  Great shot...I also had thought of trying this angle but it was after I had shot my other angle and did not go back to try.', '2004-12-06 09:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048540, 126202, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle...amazing that there are three of us that picked out the Big Chicken as our Landmark shot!  Someone somewhere will wonder what the hell''s going on in Atlanta!  Like this close up approach and super clear image with trace of the moon.  Nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice angle...amazing that there are three of us that picked out the Big Chicken as our Landmark shot!  Someone somewhere will wonder what the hell''s going on in Atlanta!  Like this close up approach and super clear image with trace of the moon.  Nice touch.', '2004-12-06 09:31:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1048561, 126203, 3724, '<td valign="top">The Westbury white horse.<br/>//wiltshirewhitehorses.org.uk/wesside.html <br/>What an amazing landmark......  prior to your beautiful picture I had not heard of  the Wiltshire White Horses.  I was delighted when my google found :  //wiltshirewhitehorses.org.uk/index.html<br/>which contains history and pictures of several of these amazing hillside creations.</td>', 'The Westbury white horse.//wiltshirewhitehorses.org.uk/wesside.html What an amazing landmark......  prior to your beautiful picture I had not heard of  the Wiltshire White Horses.  I was delighted when my google found :  //wiltshirewhitehorses.org.uk/index.htmlwhich contains history and pictures of several of these amazing hillside creations.', '2004-12-06 09:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048575, 125854, 25475, '<td valign="top">I love this but what is the landmark since I can''t see it</td>', 'I love this but what is the landmark since I can''t see it', '2004-12-06 09:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048623, 126041, 669, '<td valign="top">Good luck with the ribbon!</td>', 'Good luck with the ribbon!', '2004-12-06 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048687, 125309, 12362, '<td valign="top">I like the road coming from the bottom of the pic, but the sky is very bland, if you had a nice colorful background with clouds it would have scored an 8. I know its hard to expose both the foreground and background together so maybe try a Polarizing filter or neutral density filter. 6</td>', 'I like the road coming from the bottom of the pic, but the sky is very bland, if you had a nice colorful background with clouds it would have scored an 8. I know its hard to expose both the foreground and background together so maybe try a Polarizing filter or neutral density filter. 6', '2004-12-06 12:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048688, 126029, 7786, '<td valign="top">Good idea but too noisy. The vertical stripes i dont like either</td>', 'Good idea but too noisy. The vertical stripes i dont like either', '2004-12-06 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048690, 125933, 12362, '<td valign="top">I like it. Maybe try the shot at night so the reflections come out stronger? 6</td>', 'I like it. Maybe try the shot at night so the reflections come out stronger? 6', '2004-12-06 12:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048692, 126192, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. Maybe saturate it a bit more. Im guessing this was a helicpoter ride or Skylon?</td>', 'Nice angle. Maybe saturate it a bit more. Im guessing this was a helicpoter ride or Skylon?', '2004-12-06 12:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048693, 126152, 12362, '<td valign="top">nice patterns, nice color but doesnt keep my attention for some reason. Would also look better without the border</td>', 'nice patterns, nice color but doesnt keep my attention for some reason. Would also look better without the border', '2004-12-06 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048694, 125073, 12362, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, I think the burn tool would benefit the sky in this photo. Great potential in this.</td>', 'Very good shot, I think the burn tool would benefit the sky in this photo. Great potential in this.', '2004-12-06 12:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048696, 125893, 12362, '<td valign="top">Good shot, this would look better if the rock formation looked sharper.</td>', 'Good shot, this would look better if the rock formation looked sharper.', '2004-12-06 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048697, 126298, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice street level shot. Although got this shot I think that the buildings at the bottom are a little distracting. 6</td>', 'Nice street level shot. Although got this shot I think that the buildings at the bottom are a little distracting. 6', '2004-12-06 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048699, 125989, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w, looks like the left side of this things is a little busy. And maybe have the bottom of the photo show, the road coming to the camera might look interesting.</td>', 'Nice b&w, looks like the left side of this things is a little busy. And maybe have the bottom of the photo show, the road coming to the camera might look interesting.', '2004-12-06 12:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048701, 125540, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. No offense but not very original since you have taken this shot before. 5</td>', 'Nice picture. No offense but not very original since you have taken this shot before. 5', '2004-12-06 12:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048703, 125955, 12362, '<td valign="top">This show might look good in sepia or in black and white. <br/>But it does look a bit flat, was it straight out of the camera? Maybe bump up the contrast and saturation?</td>', 'This show might look good in sepia or in black and white. But it does look a bit flat, was it straight out of the camera? Maybe bump up the contrast and saturation?', '2004-12-06 12:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048704, 125861, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice clear, crips shot.7</td>', 'Nice clear, crips shot.7', '2004-12-06 12:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048705, 126262, 13610, '<td valign="top">Appealing composition good B&amp;W. Might cosider using another dowsampling algorythm in order to reduce jaggies.</td>', 'Appealing composition good B&W. Might cosider using another dowsampling algorythm in order to reduce jaggies.', '2004-12-06 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048708, 125336, 12362, '<td valign="top">I really like how this spanish setting is covered with snow. Tje colors really compliment the image. The only problem with this that I have is that it might be slightly weaker in the composition department. 7</td>', 'I really like how this spanish setting is covered with snow. Tje colors really compliment the image. The only problem with this that I have is that it might be slightly weaker in the composition department. 7', '2004-12-06 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048709, 124877, 3524, '<td valign="top">Beautifully rich and colorful image. <br/> <br/>I could be mistaken, but it looks like a soften filter was used. I''m a little torn as to whether I like that effect here or not.</td>', 'Beautifully rich and colorful image.  I could be mistaken, but it looks like a soften filter was used. I''m a little torn as to whether I like that effect here or not.', '2004-12-06 12:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048710, 125787, 12362, '<td valign="top">nice border, i think it works in this case. Althought you should bring out the colors a bit more thru saturation and maybe sharpness.</td>', 'nice border, i think it works in this case. Althought you should bring out the colors a bit more thru saturation and maybe sharpness.', '2004-12-06 12:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048714, 125284, 12362, '<td valign="top">Where is the PEACE TOWER?Maybe move in closer to it and get a nice shot of it covered with snow.</td>', 'Where is the PEACE TOWER?Maybe move in closer to it and get a nice shot of it covered with snow.', '2004-12-06 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048715, 124877, 12362, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and soft focus but where is the house?6</td>', 'I like the colors and soft focus but where is the house?6', '2004-12-06 12:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
