(1049597, 126227, 14986, '<td valign="top">Move the office building and I think this is awesome.  Maybe the old vs. the new works in some sense here, but I don''t like the way the office building goes right up against the cathedral.  I really like the b/w.</td>', 'Move the office building and I think this is awesome.  Maybe the old vs. the new works in some sense here, but I don''t like the way the office building goes right up against the cathedral.  I really like the b/w.', '2004-12-06 22:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
