(1049784, 125797, 19503, '<td valign="top">What an awesome view. The light is warm and inviting. The composition is great. The only thing that I can think of that could have helped this picture is the curtains, they are competing with the main subject. If the curtains were a little darker, your eyes would be more drawn towards the tower, and although the curtains are nice, the picture would have had even more impact that way.</td>', 'What an awesome view. The light is warm and inviting. The composition is great. The only thing that I can think of that could have helped this picture is the curtains, they are competing with the main subject. If the curtains were a little darker, your eyes would be more drawn towards the tower, and although the curtains are nice, the picture would have had even more impact that way.', '2004-12-07 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049785, 125439, 29486, '<td valign="top">Photo looks like it was taken in 1960. Bad color cast or something. Nothing really sticks out. It''s blue and blue seperated by brown.</td>', 'Photo looks like it was taken in 1960. Bad color cast or something. Nothing really sticks out. It''s blue and blue seperated by brown.', '2004-12-07 00:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
