(1049820, 126240, 29486, '<td valign="top">Obviously the color is delicious. Couple that with Stonehenge and the moon in perfect color.  The only thing that would have made this a 10 is the moon being higher up and maybe to the left or right. I guess you could have hung around for another hour or so...</td>', 'Obviously the color is delicious. Couple that with Stonehenge and the moon in perfect color.  The only thing that would have made this a 10 is the moon being higher up and maybe to the left or right. I guess you could have hung around for another hour or so...', '2004-12-07 01:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049822, 125661, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not too bad. The top looks a bit blown out but the structure looks great.</td>', 'Not too bad. The top looks a bit blown out but the structure looks great.', '2004-12-07 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049824, 126213, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nothing very compelling in the photo. Good effort.</td>', 'Nothing very compelling in the photo. Good effort.', '2004-12-07 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049827, 126029, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like something out of the 50''s. A spaceship on another planet. Interesting.</td>', 'Looks like something out of the 50''s. A spaceship on another planet. Interesting.', '2004-12-07 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049834, 126207, 8842, '<td valign="top">I love this composition and the dynamic light distribution.  9</td>', 'I love this composition and the dynamic light distribution.  9', '2004-12-07 01:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049860, 126255, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant contrasts between the colours that help give it DOF</td>', 'Excellant contrasts between the colours that help give it DOF', '2004-12-07 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049862, 126159, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good contrasts &amp; DOF. I like your perspective too</td>', 'Good contrasts & DOF. I like your perspective too', '2004-12-07 02:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049886, 126166, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure with well balanced colours. <br/>Noticed that your border is heavier to the right and bottom - thought I would point it out.</td>', 'Very nice exposure with well balanced colours. Noticed that your border is heavier to the right and bottom - thought I would point it out.', '2004-12-07 03:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049909, 125024, 24486, '<td valign="top">I very nearly used the Sky Tower as it was the first idea that came into my mind. It is nicely lit and the green &amp; red compliment each other. There appears to be dust or moisture spots in the sky which is a shame because I like the way you have exposed this.</td>', 'I very nearly used the Sky Tower as it was the first idea that came into my mind. It is nicely lit and the green & red compliment each other. There appears to be dust or moisture spots in the sky which is a shame because I like the way you have exposed this.', '2004-12-07 04:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049910, 126186, 6999, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure about this at all - even after five minutes of looking at it. I don''t think that it has the sense of texture, of existence that would bring it out to be a great shot. I like the composition very much, like the idea, but in the end it doesn''t quite have the sting that one would want. I like the sense of light here - but its impact has somehow been muted here, I think.</td>', 'i''m not sure about this at all - even after five minutes of looking at it. I don''t think that it has the sense of texture, of existence that would bring it out to be a great shot. I like the composition very much, like the idea, but in the end it doesn''t quite have the sting that one would want. I like the sense of light here - but its impact has somehow been muted here, I think.', '2004-12-07 04:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049912, 125627, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed, well composed. I''ve tried this shot myself, and never found a really happy composition - I think this is possibly the best available, but it somehow never quite feels a strong as one would want it - I think it''s because the balance of the bridge and the cathedral don''t quite sit as comfortably in frame as one would like; to my eye, the brdige always feels relegated somehow. This is by far the best attempt I''ve seen at it though.</td>', 'Beautifully executed, well composed. I''ve tried this shot myself, and never found a really happy composition - I think this is possibly the best available, but it somehow never quite feels a strong as one would want it - I think it''s because the balance of the bridge and the cathedral don''t quite sit as comfortably in frame as one would like; to my eye, the brdige always feels relegated somehow. This is by far the best attempt I''ve seen at it though.', '2004-12-07 04:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049915, 125860, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - certainly think the angles and incidences of the stonework make for an interesting idea. I''m not certain about your crop though - there doesn''t seem basically to be enough of that stonework in shot, or of brickwork, or of sky, and the failure to include the entire name bugs me ... placing those letters on the very strong diagonal makes them the definite subject here, yet to my eye it is those angles of stone that hold the visual interest, but your shot constantly pulls the eye away from them.</td>', 'I like the idea - certainly think the angles and incidences of the stonework make for an interesting idea. I''m not certain about your crop though - there doesn''t seem basically to be enough of that stonework in shot, or of brickwork, or of sky, and the failure to include the entire name bugs me ... placing those letters on the very strong diagonal makes them the definite subject here, yet to my eye it is those angles of stone that hold the visual interest, but your shot constantly pulls the eye away from them.', '2004-12-07 04:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049916, 126114, 24486, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far.Great lighting, DOF &amp; a sense of movement. The choice to go Black &amp; White works really well here too.</td>', 'My favourite so far.Great lighting, DOF & a sense of movement. The choice to go Black & White works really well here too.', '2004-12-07 04:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049917, 126227, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong image, certainly. The obvious comment is about the tower building - and I''m not sure your placing of it relative to the cathedral and the frame is going to go down well here. I like it though - there''s a wackiness ot it, a non-obviousness, but I think it''s pretty effective. The strength of the centred positioning of the cathedral, and the symmetry of this view that makes it such a strong subject for a central placement, amkes it almost possible for the eye completely to ignore the presence of the tower: and then it registers, and the dpc-brain goes ''what were you thinking?'' - but it is that initial look, and then that sudden, shocking presence of tthe tower, that gives this a most wonderful impact. Genuinely surprising, genuinely effective, and genuinely communicative of the modern urban world. <i>Great</i> work, indeed.</td>', 'Strong image, certainly. The obvious comment is about the tower building - and I''m not sure your placing of it relative to the cathedral and the frame is going to go down well here. I like it though - there''s a wackiness ot it, a non-obviousness, but I think it''s pretty effective. The strength of the centred positioning of the cathedral, and the symmetry of this view that makes it such a strong subject for a central placement, amkes it almost possible for the eye completely to ignore the presence of the tower: and then it registers, and the dpc-brain goes ''what were you thinking?'' - but it is that initial look, and then that sudden, shocking presence of tthe tower, that gives this a most wonderful impact. Genuinely surprising, genuinely effective, and genuinely communicative of the modern urban world. Great work, indeed.', '2004-12-07 04:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049918, 125731, 16046, '<td valign="top">Could be in the broken challenge also, good find</td>', 'Could be in the broken challenge also, good find', '2004-12-07 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049919, 126126, 6999, '<td valign="top">The darkness, the darkness ... I can see the point, i think. There''s almost a suggestion of tthe underworld, of a darkness seeping into life. What bugs me though is that the foreground elements that are visible don''t cohere with that impression - they too are dark, but there remains elements of detail there, and one''s eye just tries to find that detail in the background areas. I wonder if you have only exposed for the statue, and this lost the background - and whether you might effectively have taken the exposure a stop or two further and been able to keep some of that background detail.</td>', 'The darkness, the darkness ... I can see the point, i think. There''s almost a suggestion of tthe underworld, of a darkness seeping into life. What bugs me though is that the foreground elements that are visible don''t cohere with that impression - they too are dark, but there remains elements of detail there, and one''s eye just tries to find that detail in the background areas. I wonder if you have only exposed for the statue, and this lost the background - and whether you might effectively have taken the exposure a stop or two further and been able to keep some of that background detail.', '2004-12-07 05:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049923, 126199, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this composition (although I can''t resist imagining a Monty Python figure popping up behing the cannon).</td>', 'I like this composition (although I can''t resist imagining a Monty Python figure popping up behing the cannon).', '2004-12-07 05:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049925, 125225, 6999, '<td valign="top">It stands out as a thumbnail - when it came up i remembered noticing it - but somehow it doesn''t, not at least to the same extent, as full size. I think that may be a light thing - at that smaller size, the subject is plain and clear, and there''s a strong sense of texture in the background - at full size, that texture is resolved into a heavy aptttern of blacks greys and whites but in the large elements of the stone, rather than the fine detail that reads as texture. There''s a lot of good stuff here - i really like the faded and broken red on the hammer and sickle - and the tonality is strong, but I think perhaps a less general light would help the image - just allow some shadow to help the emblem stand out from it''s background some. Strong work, with that reservation.</td>', 'It stands out as a thumbnail - when it came up i remembered noticing it - but somehow it doesn''t, not at least to the same extent, as full size. I think that may be a light thing - at that smaller size, the subject is plain and clear, and there''s a strong sense of texture in the background - at full size, that texture is resolved into a heavy aptttern of blacks greys and whites but in the large elements of the stone, rather than the fine detail that reads as texture. There''s a lot of good stuff here - i really like the faded and broken red on the hammer and sickle - and the tonality is strong, but I think perhaps a less general light would help the image - just allow some shadow to help the emblem stand out from it''s background some. Strong work, with that reservation.', '2004-12-07 05:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049928, 125955, 6999, '<td valign="top">A strong documentary shot. I like the feel added by the over-exposure of the light on the side of the building - speaks of a bright winter''s morning very effectively. I don''t find anything magical in it however - that spark of the wow factor. I think that is as much because it''s shot from head-high (as are so very many shots), and with a quite ''ordinary'' presentation. Think of this, perhaps: if you wanted to show someone exactly what Ramsey Town Hall looked like, you would happily use this shot. If you wanted to show someone what Ramsey Town Hall <i>meant</i> to you - would this be how you choose to present it?</td>', 'A strong documentary shot. I like the feel added by the over-exposure of the light on the side of the building - speaks of a bright winter''s morning very effectively. I don''t find anything magical in it however - that spark of the wow factor. I think that is as much because it''s shot from head-high (as are so very many shots), and with a quite ''ordinary'' presentation. Think of this, perhaps: if you wanted to show someone exactly what Ramsey Town Hall looked like, you would happily use this shot. If you wanted to show someone what Ramsey Town Hall meant to you - would this be how you choose to present it?', '2004-12-07 05:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049930, 126301, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong and effective use of negative space. Good technically too - strong composition without feeling forced.</td>', 'Strong and effective use of negative space. Good technically too - strong composition without feeling forced.', '2004-12-07 05:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049932, 126147, 6999, '<td valign="top">This subject has been submitted before, yes? Whether by you or another resident I don''t know. I like this version, this approach, better, definitely. The sculpture imposes itself in frame more effectively, making a stronger and happier parallel with the buildings. The whole thing feels a little blue - like it might just be the defaul sunlight white balance. Great sesne of plasticity on the spoon.</td>', 'This subject has been submitted before, yes? Whether by you or another resident I don''t know. I like this version, this approach, better, definitely. The sculpture imposes itself in frame more effectively, making a stronger and happier parallel with the buildings. The whole thing feels a little blue - like it might just be the defaul sunlight white balance. Great sesne of plasticity on the spoon.', '2004-12-07 05:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049935, 126240, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very Spinal Tap, no?</td>', 'Very Spinal Tap, no?', '2004-12-07 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049941, 125969, 19209, '<td valign="top">nice place,nice picture!</td>', 'nice place,nice picture!', '2004-12-07 05:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049942, 125054, 19209, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2004-12-07 05:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049943, 126039, 19209, '<td valign="top">very nice, congratulation</td>', 'very nice, congratulation', '2004-12-07 05:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049945, 126294, 19209, '<td valign="top">very nice ,where is this place?</td>', 'very nice ,where is this place?', '2004-12-07 05:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049947, 126184, 19209, '<td valign="top">excellentplace, fantastic photo....i love sydney!!</td>', 'excellentplace, fantastic photo....i love sydney!!', '2004-12-07 05:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049948, 125336, 19209, '<td valign="top">wow!!!</td>', 'wow!!!', '2004-12-07 05:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049950, 126240, 19209, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-12-07 05:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049951, 126192, 19209, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-12-07 05:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049952, 125861, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice commentary on the permanence of institutions versus the insubstantial nature of individuals.</td>', 'Nice commentary on the permanence of institutions versus the insubstantial nature of individuals.', '2004-12-07 05:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049953, 126082, 6458, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of the seven sisters. I though about heading out to take a photo of them myself, but didn''t. I did try St. Peter''s church and the Pavilion, but couldn''t get a good enough shot. <br/>Anyway. enough rabbiting (ribbiting?) on about my failed attempts. Lovely composition, great tones, and a good choice for B&amp;W. I wish there was more detail in the clouds and the far cliffs... 7</td>', 'Lovely photo of the seven sisters. I though about heading out to take a photo of them myself, but didn''t. I did try St. Peter''s church and the Pavilion, but couldn''t get a good enough shot. Anyway. enough rabbiting (ribbiting?) on about my failed attempts. Lovely composition, great tones, and a good choice for B&W. I wish there was more detail in the clouds and the far cliffs... 7', '2004-12-07 05:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049954, 126082, 19209, '<td valign="top">nice, elegant picture</td>', 'nice, elegant picture', '2004-12-07 05:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049955, 126160, 6458, '<td valign="top">I think this photo could have been so much more with better BG. Maybe some clouds or something to break up the monotony of the blue. Apart from that, compositionally wise it''s a fine pic. Looking at the shadows, this was probably taken mid afternoon. Perhaps more towards sunset would help dramatize the lighting?<br/> <br/>Off-topic: In this challenge there are landmarks from each of the three cities where I''ve lived. So far, the fondest memories are of Richmond, especially from down in the Fan - lived on Floyd Ave for many years. I still dream of roaming about at 3am on the hot summer nights there. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I think this photo could have been so much more with better BG. Maybe some clouds or something to break up the monotony of the blue. Apart from that, compositionally wise it''s a fine pic. Looking at the shadows, this was probably taken mid afternoon. Perhaps more towards sunset would help dramatize the lighting? Off-topic: In this challenge there are landmarks from each of the three cities where I''ve lived. So far, the fondest memories are of Richmond, especially from down in the Fan - lived on Floyd Ave for many years. I still dream of roaming about at 3am on the hot summer nights there. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-12-07 06:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049972, 126295, 23478, '<td valign="top">NIce photo, there is a some artifacting in the sky.  It would be nice to get a clearer shot without the bushes screeneing the building.</td>', 'NIce photo, there is a some artifacting in the sky.  It would be nice to get a clearer shot without the bushes screeneing the building.', '2004-12-07 06:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049973, 126262, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the B&amp;W works good.</td>', 'Great shot, the B&W works good.', '2004-12-07 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049974, 126199, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, the cannon balls add drama to the shot.</td>', 'Great perspective, the cannon balls add drama to the shot.', '2004-12-07 07:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049975, 125893, 23478, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  The fraing with the pines in the foreground add alot.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  The fraing with the pines in the foreground add alot.', '2004-12-07 07:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049977, 126287, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  The deep blue sky makes for a wonderful contrast.</td>', 'Great detail.  The deep blue sky makes for a wonderful contrast.', '2004-12-07 07:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049978, 125862, 30360, '<td valign="top">real amazing! i vote for this...:P</td>', 'real amazing! i vote for this...:P', '2004-12-07 07:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049979, 125971, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and great photo, I just do not associate this with the challenege theme of landmarks.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and great photo, I just do not associate this with the challenege theme of landmarks.', '2004-12-07 07:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049981, 125627, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, the use of time to blur the water works very well here.  The colors are super.</td>', 'Excellent photo, the use of time to blur the water works very well here.  The colors are super.', '2004-12-07 07:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049982, 125969, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the sky helps set it off.</td>', 'Nice photo, the sky helps set it off.', '2004-12-07 07:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049983, 126172, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and great colors, just it is too far away.</td>', 'Very nice shot and great colors, just it is too far away.', '2004-12-07 07:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049994, 125627, 17291, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph. What camera/filters did you use?</td>', 'Awesome photograph. What camera/filters did you use?', '2004-12-07 07:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050016, 126167, 25355, '<td valign="top">Would liked to have seen a person or two (even if tourists).</td>', 'Would liked to have seen a person or two (even if tourists).', '2004-12-07 07:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050061, 126203, 17033, '<td valign="top">Pewsey, right? I grew up very close to the Uffington White Horse. I like the muted colours, the real feeling of weather and the scale provided by the distant fields very much. great capture overall.</td>', 'Pewsey, right? I grew up very close to the Uffington White Horse. I like the muted colours, the real feeling of weather and the scale provided by the distant fields very much. great capture overall.', '2004-12-07 09:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050062, 126214, 2610, '<td valign="top">If it did not have the child''s face in the window, I think it would be better but a good shot!</td>', 'If it did not have the child''s face in the window, I think it would be better but a good shot!', '2004-12-07 09:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050102, 126291, 16665, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-12-07 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050136, 126162, 23527, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky!</td>', 'What a beautiful sky!', '2004-12-07 10:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050149, 125551, 25981, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I saw the Columbus, Ga Springer Opera House on this website!  I have lived in the Columbus area my whole life.  I like the way your photo caught the lights.  Good luck!<br/></td>', 'I can''t believe I saw the Columbus, Ga Springer Opera House on this website!  I have lived in the Columbus area my whole life.  I like the way your photo caught the lights.  Good luck!', '2004-12-07 10:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050151, 126212, 25981, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I''ve actually seen this on a tour I took.  Beautiful inside too.</td>', 'Great photo!  I''ve actually seen this on a tour I took.  Beautiful inside too.', '2004-12-07 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050155, 125041, 25981, '<td valign="top">Quite the unique perspective, but then that''s what it''s about isn''t it?  Trying to find a unique way of showing something we''ve all seen before.</td>', 'Quite the unique perspective, but then that''s what it''s about isn''t it?  Trying to find a unique way of showing something we''ve all seen before.', '2004-12-07 11:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050184, 125439, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great foto, it just seems a bit too far and a bit to dark.</td>', 'Great foto, it just seems a bit too far and a bit to dark.', '2004-12-07 11:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050186, 126159, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the use of negative space and the dark blue sky is very effective.</td>', 'Nice shot, the use of negative space and the dark blue sky is very effective.', '2004-12-07 11:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050188, 125861, 23478, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, it may have been more effective to crop out the busy foreground with the pedestrians.</td>', 'Awesome lighting, it may have been more effective to crop out the busy foreground with the pedestrians.', '2004-12-07 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050191, 126114, 23478, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it is very different.   The effect creates a feel of the surreal, a bit sci-fi in nature.</td>', 'I like this shot, it is very different.   The effect creates a feel of the surreal, a bit sci-fi in nature.', '2004-12-07 11:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050193, 125797, 23478, '<td valign="top">Cool foto, it is just a bit obscure.  I have to look hard to figure out what the landmark is.</td>', 'Cool foto, it is just a bit obscure.  I have to look hard to figure out what the landmark is.', '2004-12-07 11:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050194, 126106, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, just a bit too far away to create drama.</td>', 'Nice photo, just a bit too far away to create drama.', '2004-12-07 11:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050198, 126294, 23478, '<td valign="top">Awesome landscape foto, the colors and the contrast are excellent.  9.</td>', 'Awesome landscape foto, the colors and the contrast are excellent.  9.', '2004-12-07 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050200, 125024, 23478, '<td valign="top">Cool foto, the colors are great.</td>', 'Cool foto, the colors are great.', '2004-12-07 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050202, 126298, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot the lines are very good.</td>', 'Nice shot the lines are very good.', '2004-12-07 11:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050204, 126143, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent foto and good use of the reflection off the water.</td>', 'Excellent foto and good use of the reflection off the water.', '2004-12-07 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050205, 125073, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-12-07 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050207, 126014, 15231, '<td valign="top">I think it would have had a stronger impact if it were centered more.</td>', 'I think it would have had a stronger impact if it were centered more.', '2004-12-07 11:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050209, 126214, 23478, '<td valign="top">I do not know if it intentional, but the face in the window ruins the "abandoned" effect.  Very nice foto.</td>', 'I do not know if it intentional, but the face in the window ruins the "abandoned" effect.  Very nice foto.', '2004-12-07 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050211, 126172, 15231, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The landmark itself is perhaps a little too small as the main subject, but a great photo.</td>', 'Very nice.  The landmark itself is perhaps a little too small as the main subject, but a great photo.', '2004-12-07 11:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050213, 125540, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great use of the afternoon sun, it creates a much more dramatic effect rather than just straight noon lighting.</td>', 'Great use of the afternoon sun, it creates a much more dramatic effect rather than just straight noon lighting.', '2004-12-07 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050214, 126039, 15231, '<td valign="top">Nice sky!  But the landmark might be too obscure (I''ve no idea what it is).  Bit of  a halo around it as well.</td>', 'Nice sky!  But the landmark might be too obscure (I''ve no idea what it is).  Bit of  a halo around it as well.', '2004-12-07 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050216, 125437, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice foto, and the contrast of white with the autunm trees is great. The picture needs to be sharpened a bit.</td>', 'Nice foto, and the contrast of white with the autunm trees is great. The picture needs to be sharpened a bit.', '2004-12-07 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050218, 126121, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot and so classic.  9.</td>', 'Great shot and so classic.  9.', '2004-12-07 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050219, 126119, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great use of the time lapse, the night shot works very well here.</td>', 'Great use of the time lapse, the night shot works very well here.', '2004-12-07 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050220, 125551, 15231, '<td valign="top">Great soft lighting.  Composition seems a bit off, I would have liked to see more of the balcony, it seems cut off abruptly on the top and right.</td>', 'Great soft lighting.  Composition seems a bit off, I would have liked to see more of the balcony, it seems cut off abruptly on the top and right.', '2004-12-07 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050221, 126041, 4226, '<td valign="top">would have been a great photo, but it lacks sharpness. the towers seem blurred and no architectural details visible. Also the bridge cables on the far left are OOF. Needs more DOF</td>', 'would have been a great photo, but it lacks sharpness. the towers seem blurred and no architectural details visible. Also the bridge cables on the far left are OOF. Needs more DOF', '2004-12-07 11:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050222, 125731, 15231, '<td valign="top">Nice "local" landmark.  But picture seems a bit dull, maybe a different time of day would be better?</td>', 'Nice "local" landmark.  But picture seems a bit dull, maybe a different time of day would be better?', '2004-12-07 11:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050224, 125284, 15231, '<td valign="top">Nice snow scene, but the landmarks are a little subtle.</td>', 'Nice snow scene, but the landmarks are a little subtle.', '2004-12-07 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050225, 126214, 18157, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Is that a ghost in the window?</td>', 'Very cool. Is that a ghost in the window?', '2004-12-07 11:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050227, 125797, 15231, '<td valign="top">Looks like Las Vegas to me.  But somehow the photos seems far better if you imagine it taken in Paris.  Nice framing.</td>', 'Looks like Las Vegas to me.  But somehow the photos seems far better if you imagine it taken in Paris.  Nice framing.', '2004-12-07 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050229, 125827, 15231, '<td valign="top">This would have been good if you''d not had the camera shake out the non-moving parts.  It''s well lit, but just comes across as blurred.</td>', 'This would have been good if you''d not had the camera shake out the non-moving parts.  It''s well lit, but just comes across as blurred.', '2004-12-07 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050234, 126295, 15231, '<td valign="top">The banding in the sky is a bit distracting.  Not very sharp either, is it overcompressed, why use only 69K out of 150K?</td>', 'The banding in the sky is a bit distracting.  Not very sharp either, is it overcompressed, why use only 69K out of 150K?', '2004-12-07 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1050236, 126293, 15231, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft for the subject,  I think it would be improved with more contrast and some sharpening.  Nice composition though.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft for the subject,  I think it would be improved with more contrast and some sharpening.  Nice composition though.', '2004-12-07 11:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050239, 124877, 15231, '<td valign="top">Having to put the sign in to identify the landmark seems a bit off.  Nice colors though.</td>', 'Having to put the sign in to identify the landmark seems a bit off.  Nice colors though.', '2004-12-07 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050244, 125309, 15231, '<td valign="top">A little too strong on the contrast methinks.</td>', 'A little too strong on the contrast methinks.', '2004-12-07 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050246, 126147, 15231, '<td valign="top">Great positioning.</td>', 'Great positioning.', '2004-12-07 11:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050248, 125439, 15231, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  It would benefit from a  minor levels adjustment.  Might have been better composed off-center.  Nice subject through, and a good vantage point.</td>', 'Too dark.  It would benefit from a  minor levels adjustment.  Might have been better composed off-center.  Nice subject through, and a good vantage point.', '2004-12-07 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050262, 125627, 17203, '<td valign="top">Stunning image! Probably a ribbon. The only thing I would do with this photo is...uh, celebrate? 10<br/>EDIT- Congrats on your POTD, Jon!</td>', 'Stunning image! Probably a ribbon. The only thing I would do with this photo is...uh, celebrate? 10EDIT- Congrats on your POTD, Jon!', '2004-12-07 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050266, 125933, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good depth of field, very pleasing colors, very ....hmmm... tilted; I think I would have scored it higher if it were level</td>', 'very good depth of field, very pleasing colors, very ....hmmm... tilted; I think I would have scored it higher if it were level', '2004-12-07 12:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050274, 125024, 29309, '<td valign="top">good photo, the 2 streetlights at the bottom are quite distracting.</td>', 'good photo, the 2 streetlights at the bottom are quite distracting.', '2004-12-07 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050275, 125728, 23478, '<td valign="top">The night time colors are excellent.  Good choice.</td>', 'The night time colors are excellent.  Good choice.', '2004-12-07 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050281, 125790, 23478, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is an excellent shot and creative angle.  The colors are great.  Where is it?</td>', 'WOW!  This is an excellent shot and creative angle.  The colors are great.  Where is it?', '2004-12-07 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050297, 126142, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation. Good photo.</td>', 'Nice color saturation. Good photo.', '2004-12-07 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050300, 126199, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. The clouds help out a lot too.</td>', 'Nice angle. The clouds help out a lot too.', '2004-12-07 13:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050312, 126214, 30387, '<td valign="top">This remindes me of the old west which is where i live and this is the best</td>', 'This remindes me of the old west which is where i live and this is the best', '2004-12-07 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050317, 126106, 27524, '<td valign="top">You used interesting way to capture bridge... i like blue sky and coloring of water. Good work.</td>', 'You used interesting way to capture bridge... i like blue sky and coloring of water. Good work.', '2004-12-07 13:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050319, 125989, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like lights and toning of your picture... place is interesting too but i feel compozition bit strange. I would leaved ships out for sure... they distract from lighthouse and doesnt add much to picture.</td>', 'I like lights and toning of your picture... place is interesting too but i feel compozition bit strange. I would leaved ships out for sure... they distract from lighthouse and doesnt add much to picture.', '2004-12-07 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050320, 125336, 27524, '<td valign="top">Colors are just wonderful.</td>', 'Colors are just wonderful.', '2004-12-07 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050321, 126051, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its good b&amp;w but i wish something would show how big it is to be landmark.</td>', 'Its good b&w but i wish something would show how big it is to be landmark.', '2004-12-07 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050345, 126186, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: very impactful and dramatic in tonees. Good, long DOF. Composition is OK, but the central alignment bothers me a bit. i think this could have been improved with a lower POV looking upwards. This would give reverence to the subject and add drama.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not a great deal to bring me back because the subject doesn''t hold me for long</td>', 'Challenge link: strong Image critique: very impactful and dramatic in tonees. Good, long DOF. Composition is OK, but the central alignment bothers me a bit. i think this could have been improved with a lower POV looking upwards. This would give reverence to the subject and add drama. Out-of-challenge appeal: not a great deal to bring me back because the subject doesn''t hold me for long', '2004-12-07 14:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050347, 126297, 14614, '<td valign="top">houses in the background don''t add to your composition (although I know they cannot be avoided sometimes -- still doesn''t enhance the photo)</td>', 'houses in the background don''t add to your composition (although I know they cannot be avoided sometimes -- still doesn''t enhance the photo)', '2004-12-07 14:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
