(1050384, 125791, 29870, '<td valign="top">I like the parrallel of the thin trees and the sculpture...good job editing and contrasting with the right amount of white light.  Where is this?</td>', 'I like the parrallel of the thin trees and the sculpture...good job editing and contrasting with the right amount of white light.  Where is this?', '2004-12-07 15:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050386, 126051, 29870, '<td valign="top">Whatever this is, it''s crazy in the moonlight.  Good exposure.</td>', 'Whatever this is, it''s crazy in the moonlight.  Good exposure.', '2004-12-07 15:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050397, 125893, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium - due to the fact that it is not the kind of feature that one refers to coloquially as a landmark, but more as an integral part of the landscape. I''m not marking it down though because it''s a pedantic, picky little point!<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a wonderful subject of course - I love it here. Blue cast is quite overpowering and composition is a bit too central for my taste.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I love this place, so I''d probably come back to this if passing</td>', 'Challenge link: medium - due to the fact that it is not the kind of feature that one refers to coloquially as a landmark, but more as an integral part of the landscape. I''m not marking it down though because it''s a pedantic, picky little point! Image critique: a wonderful subject of course - I love it here. Blue cast is quite overpowering and composition is a bit too central for my taste. Out-of-challenge appeal: I love this place, so I''d probably come back to this if passing', '2004-12-07 15:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050403, 126272, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice view, especially the sky,  but perhaps too many elements..it might have been stronger with the mountain and just  the building with the chimney. Also the  land seems to have too little contrast...too much flat grey.</td>', 'Nice view, especially the sky,  but perhaps too many elements..it might have been stronger with the mountain and just  the building with the chimney. Also the  land seems to have too little contrast...too much flat grey.', '2004-12-07 15:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050404, 125336, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great form and colour</td>', 'Great form and colour', '2004-12-07 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050411, 126082, 17033, '<td valign="top">Lovely form  along the cliff-tops leading to the lighthouse. Nice contrast between the detail of the cliffs and sea with the smoothness of the clouds. Nice tonal range overall. Well taken.</td>', 'Lovely form  along the cliff-tops leading to the lighthouse. Nice contrast between the detail of the cliffs and sea with the smoothness of the clouds. Nice tonal range overall. Well taken.', '2004-12-07 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050414, 126114, 17033, '<td valign="top">Is this infra-red? Might explain the long exposure. Great surreal effect  and very well composed too.</td>', 'Is this infra-red? Might explain the long exposure. Great surreal effect  and very well composed too.', '2004-12-07 15:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050416, 126018, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the mist is real or not but still a  stunning and simple  image.</td>', 'Not sure if the mist is real or not but still a  stunning and simple  image.', '2004-12-07 15:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050442, 126191, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like this image but might make a couple minor changes.  Show a little more at the bottom and place your main subject off center.  Showing the bottom of the columns might give your image even more depth.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like this image but might make a couple minor changes.  Show a little more at the bottom and place your main subject off center.  Showing the bottom of the columns might give your image even more depth.  Good luck!', '2004-12-07 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050464, 126300, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: beautiful morning light is its main strength but the subject is lovely. This just lacks a bit of ''pop'' for me. The central feature is awkward with its peak butting up to the ridge line, so I would have tried to avoid this by crouching very low. A lower POV may have added some extra dimension too rather than the more conventional eye-level.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yes, it''s pretty but not magnetic enough to pull me back for long</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: beautiful morning light is its main strength but the subject is lovely. This just lacks a bit of ''pop'' for me. The central feature is awkward with its peak butting up to the ridge line, so I would have tried to avoid this by crouching very low. A lower POV may have added some extra dimension too rather than the more conventional eye-level. Out-of-challenge appeal: yes, it''s pretty but not magnetic enough to pull me back for long', '2004-12-07 16:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050465, 125791, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not impressed by photographs of sculpture but you really captured emotion in this one.  Nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'I''m usually not impressed by photographs of sculpture but you really captured emotion in this one.  Nice composition and exposure.', '2004-12-07 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050482, 126041, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: while this is technically imperfect (blown highlights) it has a certain a appeal becasue of them. The exposure is really too long here resulting in the pools of white, so a Neutral Density filter would help in future. I''d like to have seen more water than sky and a bit more of bridge supports too.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: not enough to pull me back frequently, and the flaws do make it hard going on the eye</td>', 'Challenge link: strong Image critique: while this is technically imperfect (blown highlights) it has a certain a appeal becasue of them. The exposure is really too long here resulting in the pools of white, so a Neutral Density filter would help in future. I''d like to have seen more water than sky and a bit more of bridge supports too. Out-of-challenge appeal: not enough to pull me back frequently, and the flaws do make it hard going on the eye', '2004-12-07 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050486, 125374, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium - nothing peculiar enough to really make this a prominent landmark<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: great tone and drama with light and contrast. Highlights are too blown, but you almost get away with it. Nicely composed with a good choice of foreground to add interest.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yes, I like the mood of this</td>', 'Challenge link: medium - nothing peculiar enough to really make this a prominent landmark Image critique: great tone and drama with light and contrast. Highlights are too blown, but you almost get away with it. Nicely composed with a good choice of foreground to add interest. Out-of-challenge appeal: yes, I like the mood of this', '2004-12-07 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
