(1050583, 124710, 10084, '<td valign="top">Funny as this was going to be the exact view that I was going to submit myself.  I figure that most people that visited the city was going to have a shot like this in there collection of photos so I chose not too.<br/> <br/>Angle of the composition is nice as the eyes follow the span toward the Marin side of the bay. The reds stand out against the blue of the ocean and the sky. The inclusion of the sailboats gives the viewer the feeling that the ocean is a recreational area.</td>', 'Funny as this was going to be the exact view that I was going to submit myself.  I figure that most people that visited the city was going to have a shot like this in there collection of photos so I chose not too. Angle of the composition is nice as the eyes follow the span toward the Marin side of the bay. The reds stand out against the blue of the ocean and the sky. The inclusion of the sailboats gives the viewer the feeling that the ocean is a recreational area.', '2004-12-07 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
