(1050752, 126119, 19978, '<td valign="top">A lovely concept carried out beautifully. The red and white leading lines at the bottom draw the attention effortlessly to the subject at the top. The tones are great. Good job!</td>', 'A lovely concept carried out beautifully. The red and white leading lines at the bottom draw the attention effortlessly to the subject at the top. The tones are great. Good job!', '2004-12-07 20:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
