(1052091, 125627, 14603, '<td valign="top">What a load of old rubbish...I could do better with my Instamatic !!!<br/>Then again..could my opinion be influenced by the fact that I know who took this :)<br/>Seriously good work Jon...I haven`t been through all the images yet, but if this isn`t among the ribbons, there will be questions asked.</td>', 'What a load of old rubbish...I could do better with my Instamatic !!!Then again..could my opinion be influenced by the fact that I know who took this :)Seriously good work Jon...I haven`t been through all the images yet, but if this isn`t among the ribbons, there will be questions asked.', '2004-12-08 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052109, 126274, 14603, '<td valign="top">Funnily enough, this appeared on a television programme over here the other evening and my wife commented that it would have made an excellent subject for this challenge..to which I replied that it probably will appear...her answer was that my submission would stand no chance against it and she is absolutely correct.</td>', 'Funnily enough, this appeared on a television programme over here the other evening and my wife commented that it would have made an excellent subject for this challenge..to which I replied that it probably will appear...her answer was that my submission would stand no chance against it and she is absolutely correct.', '2004-12-08 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052124, 125425, 14603, '<td valign="top">A very unusual image, I especially like the fact that it is composed of shades of  one colour which focusses the attention on the lighting.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'A very unusual image, I especially like the fact that it is composed of shades of  one colour which focusses the attention on the lighting.Nice work', '2004-12-08 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052143, 126162, 14603, '<td valign="top">The beautiful "painted" sky really adds to this image.<br/>Hope you weren`t sitting on the roof of Waverley station to get this shot??<br/>Long lens from the bridges?<br/>A bonus point for pointing the camera towards Falkirk :)</td>', 'The beautiful "painted" sky really adds to this image.Hope you weren`t sitting on the roof of Waverley station to get this shot??Long lens from the bridges?A bonus point for pointing the camera towards Falkirk :)', '2004-12-08 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052166, 126207, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition has added so much to this image.<br/>Well handled.</td>', 'Good composition has added so much to this image.Well handled.', '2004-12-08 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052191, 125374, 14603, '<td valign="top">An image well  presented, with lots of impact.<br/>Good work</td>', 'An image well  presented, with lots of impact.Good work', '2004-12-08 12:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052194, 126177, 27605, '<td valign="top">Creative framing, excellent execution, imaginative entry for"Landmark"  ...good job!</td>', 'Creative framing, excellent execution, imaginative entry for"Landmark"  ...good job!', '2004-12-08 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052197, 126287, 19978, '<td valign="top">Hey, a fellow Madisonian! I photograph the WI capitol often and can appreciate how tough it is to find a unique and compelling angle or perspective. I love the way you''ve composed this. The leading lines of the two "wings" lead naturally to the center columned area, and the main subject, the dome, rises majestically above, beautifully off-center. Excellent job technically as well, focus and color are perfect and don''t get in the way of the overall impact. Well done!</td>', 'Hey, a fellow Madisonian! I photograph the WI capitol often and can appreciate how tough it is to find a unique and compelling angle or perspective. I love the way you''ve composed this. The leading lines of the two "wings" lead naturally to the center columned area, and the main subject, the dome, rises majestically above, beautifully off-center. Excellent job technically as well, focus and color are perfect and don''t get in the way of the overall impact. Well done!', '2004-12-08 12:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052200, 125791, 27605, '<td valign="top">I for one like the overprocessed look in this one.  I consider it a strong entry.</td>', 'I for one like the overprocessed look in this one.  I consider it a strong entry.', '2004-12-08 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052204, 126152, 27605, '<td valign="top">Captivating... I wonder where this is?  Nice job.</td>', 'Captivating... I wonder where this is?  Nice job.', '2004-12-08 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052206, 125797, 27605, '<td valign="top">Outstanding point of view for a commonly photographed icon!</td>', 'Outstanding point of view for a commonly photographed icon!', '2004-12-08 12:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052216, 126207, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very impressed by the way the columns lead the eye up, up and away!  Good job!</td>', 'Very impressed by the way the columns lead the eye up, up and away!  Good job!', '2004-12-08 12:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052253, 126029, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent suject! I would have gone for either a perfectly centered or more off-center composition, but that''s minor. The vertical stripes however are a killer, especially at the Mac native gamma of 1.8. This is also one of those images that just looks totally different at the 2.2 gamma point (looks better that way to my taste), so don''t be surprised if you get two very different sets of comments. 6</td>', 'Excellent suject! I would have gone for either a perfectly centered or more off-center composition, but that''s minor. The vertical stripes however are a killer, especially at the Mac native gamma of 1.8. This is also one of those images that just looks totally different at the 2.2 gamma point (looks better that way to my taste), so don''t be surprised if you get two very different sets of comments. 6', '2004-12-08 13:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052256, 125797, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the slanted window angles somehow don''t work for me - 6</td>', 'Great idea, but the slanted window angles somehow don''t work for me - 6', '2004-12-08 13:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052262, 125933, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very interesting ''twist'' on the classic tall building shot. I would have gone for a more square crop, skipping the bottom inch or so (cropping everything below the tip of the closest pollard). 6</td>', 'Very interesting ''twist'' on the classic tall building shot. I would have gone for a more square crop, skipping the bottom inch or so (cropping everything below the tip of the closest pollard). 6', '2004-12-08 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052304, 126272, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a good rich sky (perhaps a little too burned in places), there''s plenty of space and the landmark is very prominent, good contrast, clear and crisp<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: this is pleasing, so I will probably revisit</td>', 'Challenge link: strong Image critique: a good rich sky (perhaps a little too burned in places), there''s plenty of space and the landmark is very prominent, good contrast, clear and crisp Out-of-challenge appeal: this is pleasing, so I will probably revisit', '2004-12-08 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052310, 125309, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium - for me this is more of an area feature than a landmark<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: it''s a pleasant scene, nicely shot. Contrast is a bit harsh, but I generally like that kind of treatment. background is alittle faded.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>:</td>', 'Challenge link: medium - for me this is more of an area feature than a landmark Image critique: it''s a pleasant scene, nicely shot. Contrast is a bit harsh, but I generally like that kind of treatment. background is alittle faded. Out-of-challenge appeal:', '2004-12-08 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052337, 126172, 28599, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the palace a little closer in the shot, otherwise, well done</td>', 'I would have liked to see the palace a little closer in the shot, otherwise, well done', '2004-12-08 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052340, 126291, 30388, '<td valign="top">Your picture is very beautiful and it brings out the beauty of mother nature. I love the colors and the way the picture fits together.</td>', 'Your picture is very beautiful and it brings out the beauty of mother nature. I love the colors and the way the picture fits together.', '2004-12-08 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052351, 126298, 3524, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the composition in this image. The foreground building roof diving into the left third of the image, and then the roof point at the very bottom shooting the angle straight up into the main building, and off into the ornate negative space of the blue sky. The blue and orange-yellow make a nice, battling contrast of color. I think the only thing I miss is a focal point that works with the strong lines.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'I enjoy the composition in this image. The foreground building roof diving into the left third of the image, and then the roof point at the very bottom shooting the angle straight up into the main building, and off into the ornate negative space of the blue sky. The blue and orange-yellow make a nice, battling contrast of color. I think the only thing I miss is a focal point that works with the strong lines. Nice shot.', '2004-12-08 13:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052362, 126037, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried five different approaches to commenting on this, and I can''t find the words. It does nothing for me, but I''m at a bit of a loss to explain why.</td>', 'I''ve tried five different approaches to commenting on this, and I can''t find the words. It does nothing for me, but I''m at a bit of a loss to explain why.', '2004-12-08 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052363, 126119, 28599, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot. Good lighting</td>', 'Nice Shot. Good lighting', '2004-12-08 14:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052390, 126040, 27562, '<td valign="top">I know you probably were limited in your vantage point, but its too bad the path in the lower left corner had to be in the frame.  Good Work.</td>', 'I know you probably were limited in your vantage point, but its too bad the path in the lower left corner had to be in the frame.  Good Work.', '2004-12-08 14:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052416, 126250, 208, '<td valign="top">I like this, but like to have more contrast between the top of the rocks and the sky. The off-center feel (though it isn''t off center) is cool, too.</td>', 'I like this, but like to have more contrast between the top of the rocks and the sky. The off-center feel (though it isn''t off center) is cool, too.', '2004-12-08 14:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052420, 125059, 27605, '<td valign="top">You''ve likely heard it before, but the small size hinders this shot.  The "porthole" border is daring, like it.</td>', 'You''ve likely heard it before, but the small size hinders this shot.  The "porthole" border is daring, like it.', '2004-12-08 14:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052424, 125121, 208, '<td valign="top">The Blue Hens of Delaware? Needs more light on the front (facing the camera) side. Either that or lots more light directly on its back so it pops from the background better.</td>', 'The Blue Hens of Delaware? Needs more light on the front (facing the camera) side. Either that or lots more light directly on its back so it pops from the background better.', '2004-12-08 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052426, 125731, 27605, '<td valign="top">You made it work, but I think this would be much better shot in full daylight.  (I do understand that perhaps you couldn''t get there at that time of day, but still thought I''d offer the feedback).</td>', 'You made it work, but I think this would be much better shot in full daylight.  (I do understand that perhaps you couldn''t get there at that time of day, but still thought I''d offer the feedback).', '2004-12-08 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052432, 125854, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the color range, but the left sky looks strange. Nice composition with the one tree standing apart (or so it seems).</td>', 'I like the color range, but the left sky looks strange. Nice composition with the one tree standing apart (or so it seems).', '2004-12-08 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052448, 125437, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The bare tree gets lost in the evergreen behind it, though. Quick, travel back in time and get this shot with that tree in full foliage. I like this overall; the white church looks good.</td>', 'Nice composition. The bare tree gets lost in the evergreen behind it, though. Quick, travel back in time and get this shot with that tree in full foliage. I like this overall; the white church looks good.', '2004-12-08 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052498, 125041, 8860, '<td valign="top">A magnificent structure full of character. This will have people finding their way from miles around.<br/>: )</td>', 'A magnificent structure full of character. This will have people finding their way from miles around.: )', '2004-12-08 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052560, 126301, 208, '<td valign="top">I really like all the black space and where everything is in the frame.</td>', 'I really like all the black space and where everything is in the frame.', '2004-12-08 15:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052565, 126140, 208, '<td valign="top">I like how the top branch follows the roof of the building. It helps frame the shot.</td>', 'I like how the top branch follows the roof of the building. It helps frame the shot.', '2004-12-08 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052569, 125059, 6999, '<td valign="top">Shows evidence of a lack of care, I feel.</td>', 'Shows evidence of a lack of care, I feel.', '2004-12-08 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052570, 125442, 208, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of framing with both trees. The cold effect is beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice use of framing with both trees. The cold effect is beautiful.', '2004-12-08 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052578, 125030, 208, '<td valign="top">Interesting color effect; not sure it''s effective for this particular photo, though. It tends to distract from your main subject. (And damn that woman in the white pants!)</td>', 'Interesting color effect; not sure it''s effective for this particular photo, though. It tends to distract from your main subject. (And damn that woman in the white pants!)', '2004-12-08 15:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052580, 126295, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast (not the right word) between the castle and the cactus.</td>', 'I like the contrast (not the right word) between the castle and the cactus.', '2004-12-08 15:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052581, 126039, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt and angle.</td>', 'I like the tilt and angle.', '2004-12-08 15:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052584, 125540, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now James - had a feeling that this was going to be your subject. It''s beautifully done, as far as it goes: perfect light for the image, great capture of the fill-in cold daylight on the reverse side of the face. Good detail, good exposure, all that technical stuff ... but I don''t see what there is more than a simple documentary image of the sculpture. It''s an extraordinary thing in itself - but your photograph is just a record of that thing, not an image that communicates anything more about it to me - unlike your previous shot of it, which had a ost of other implications to my mind and eye. Obviously, I''ve no idea what your options were - I don''t know the place ... but this, to me, is too straightforward. 6</td>', 'Now James - had a feeling that this was going to be your subject. It''s beautifully done, as far as it goes: perfect light for the image, great capture of the fill-in cold daylight on the reverse side of the face. Good detail, good exposure, all that technical stuff ... but I don''t see what there is more than a simple documentary image of the sculpture. It''s an extraordinary thing in itself - but your photograph is just a record of that thing, not an image that communicates anything more about it to me - unlike your previous shot of it, which had a ost of other implications to my mind and eye. Obviously, I''ve no idea what your options were - I don''t know the place ... but this, to me, is too straightforward. 6', '2004-12-08 15:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052596, 126140, 6999, '<td valign="top">I do like the sense of light through the frosted-looking windows: very well captured. Besides that, I''m not quite sure what your point is with this image.</td>', 'I do like the sense of light through the frosted-looking windows: very well captured. Besides that, I''m not quite sure what your point is with this image.', '2004-12-08 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052597, 126214, 208, '<td valign="top">The face in the window is a great touch.</td>', 'The face in the window is a great touch.', '2004-12-08 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052638, 126300, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems disorganised - I get no sense of the real subject of the shot - the Haystack? The haze? The light? Lacking clarity and I can''t see that the noise helps anything - it''s too orthodix a scene to be a dirty image.</td>', 'Seems disorganised - I get no sense of the real subject of the shot - the Haystack? The haze? The light? Lacking clarity and I can''t see that the noise helps anything - it''s too orthodix a scene to be a dirty image.', '2004-12-08 16:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052646, 126051, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite a neat shot. Not sure about the negative space - at least, the amount of it -what for? Technically good, though, and the light is dealt with very efficiently.</td>', 'Quite a neat shot. Not sure about the negative space - at least, the amount of it -what for? Technically good, though, and the light is dealt with very efficiently.', '2004-12-08 16:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052739, 126152, 28599, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast</td>', 'Nice color contrast', '2004-12-08 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052753, 126008, 23312, '<td valign="top">I really like this - not only are you showing a landmark, but you are capturing an actual use of the landmark - good composition.  The sky seems a little odd to me - a little unreal like maybe a bit too much post-processing?  At least for my taste, but overall very nice.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this - not only are you showing a landmark, but you are capturing an actual use of the landmark - good composition.  The sky seems a little odd to me - a little unreal like maybe a bit too much post-processing?  At least for my taste, but overall very nice.  Good luck!', '2004-12-08 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052757, 125540, 23312, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  Nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'I love the colors.  Nice composition and exposure.', '2004-12-08 17:44:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1052761, 125709, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the old and the new - adds a lot of interest to the photo.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the old and the new - adds a lot of interest to the photo.', '2004-12-08 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052776, 126301, 20779, '<td valign="top">This truly does shine out like a jewel; very aptly titiled. Prefectly done for the challenge. 10.</td>', 'This truly does shine out like a jewel; very aptly titiled. Prefectly done for the challenge. 10.', '2004-12-08 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052778, 126294, 29404, '<td valign="top">butifull</td>', 'butifull', '2004-12-08 17:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052780, 125951, 20779, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, ethereal lighting - one of my favorites in the challenge. Sharp, clean and crisp to match the tones.</td>', 'Gorgeous, ethereal lighting - one of my favorites in the challenge. Sharp, clean and crisp to match the tones.', '2004-12-08 17:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052782, 126294, 20779, '<td valign="top">The range of light and tones you captured in this are so fascinating. Very magical piece. 10.</td>', 'The range of light and tones you captured in this are so fascinating. Very magical piece. 10.', '2004-12-08 17:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052784, 126240, 20779, '<td valign="top">I had already voted on this prior to the validation I now see.  Just stunning, and thankfully, not overly - edited. 9.</td>', 'I had already voted on this prior to the validation I now see.  Just stunning, and thankfully, not overly - edited. 9.', '2004-12-08 17:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052786, 126172, 29404, '<td valign="top">butifull</td>', 'butifull', '2004-12-08 17:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052790, 126207, 20779, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic DOF and perspective used here. This is an awe-inspiring photo. Couldn''t improve a thing. I also think that the border is a perfect match and well done.</td>', 'What a fantastic DOF and perspective used here. This is an awe-inspiring photo. Couldn''t improve a thing. I also think that the border is a perfect match and well done.', '2004-12-08 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052791, 124710, 29404, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-12-08 17:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052792, 126182, 29404, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-12-08 17:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052793, 126162, 25742, '<td valign="top">some really strange colours in the sky here. long exposure?</td>', 'some really strange colours in the sky here. long exposure?', '2004-12-08 17:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052794, 125854, 29404, '<td valign="top">butifull</td>', 'butifull', '2004-12-08 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052795, 126192, 29404, '<td valign="top">great shoy</td>', 'great shoy', '2004-12-08 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052796, 125861, 20779, '<td valign="top">The lighting, leading lines and movement all just make this an image I have a hard time tearing myself away from. It could have been a boring, ordinary image, but you instead created something with life and a light that just draws and keeps you in.</td>', 'The lighting, leading lines and movement all just make this an image I have a hard time tearing myself away from. It could have been a boring, ordinary image, but you instead created something with life and a light that just draws and keeps you in.', '2004-12-08 17:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052798, 126291, 29404, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-12-08 17:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052799, 126227, 20779, '<td valign="top">A simply stunning piece of architectual photography. Very interesting juxtaposition of eras, also!</td>', 'A simply stunning piece of architectual photography. Very interesting juxtaposition of eras, also!', '2004-12-08 17:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052802, 125862, 29404, '<td valign="top">very nice<br/></td>', 'very nice', '2004-12-08 17:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052804, 125853, 29404, '<td valign="top">very cool<br/></td>', 'very cool', '2004-12-08 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052806, 126121, 29404, '<td valign="top">best shot so far</td>', 'best shot so far', '2004-12-08 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052807, 126291, 20779, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I just keep coming back wanting to gaze at this. It is actually a fairly ordinary scene we might see, but maybe because you managed to capture it HOW I see this sometimes, it just stirs something in me. Very captivating. I love the haze and distant viewing.</td>', 'For some reason, I just keep coming back wanting to gaze at this. It is actually a fairly ordinary scene we might see, but maybe because you managed to capture it HOW I see this sometimes, it just stirs something in me. Very captivating. I love the haze and distant viewing.', '2004-12-08 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052811, 126283, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong - a striking image<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: the centred view is very powerful emphasising the structure very nicely. The tungsten cast is a bit overpowering but it arguably adds something of a sci-fi feel to the shot in the process. Love those reflections and it''s a pretty good exposure with only a few hot spots.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yup - I like it</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong - a striking image Image critique: the centred view is very powerful emphasising the structure very nicely. The tungsten cast is a bit overpowering but it arguably adds something of a sci-fi feel to the shot in the process. Love those reflections and it''s a pretty good exposure with only a few hot spots. Out-of-challenge appeal: yup - I like it', '2004-12-08 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052812, 126283, 29404, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-12-08 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052813, 125787, 6999, '<td valign="top">something unbalances this - I think it''s the off-setting of the trees, and the centring of the silhouetted statue. Placing the light there is effective, but it''s almost as if the eye expects the statue to be to the right of frame, and it isn''t. Nice approach, though, all the same.</td>', 'something unbalances this - I think it''s the off-setting of the trees, and the centring of the silhouetted statue. Placing the light there is effective, but it''s almost as if the eye expects the statue to be to the right of frame, and it isn''t. Nice approach, though, all the same.', '2004-12-08 18:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052815, 125630, 29404, '<td valign="top">nice...is that''s ur''s?</td>', 'nice...is that''s ur''s?', '2004-12-08 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052816, 126159, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: dynamic comp, clean, graphical, smart. Stylish shot overall.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: nice - will revisit</td>', 'Challenge link: strong Image critique: dynamic comp, clean, graphical, smart. Stylish shot overall. Out-of-challenge appeal: nice - will revisit', '2004-12-08 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052817, 125619, 29404, '<td valign="top">butifull shot</td>', 'butifull shot', '2004-12-08 18:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052818, 126152, 29404, '<td valign="top">very very nice</td>', 'very very nice', '2004-12-08 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052819, 126082, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition - a perfect example of leading lines, really. Strong sense of scale, good sky. An enjoyable image.</td>', 'Wonderful composition - a perfect example of leading lines, really. Strong sense of scale, good sky. An enjoyable image.', '2004-12-08 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052820, 126298, 20779, '<td valign="top">This image has great movement, clarity and vibrancy brought into a old, established reality. I love the clip of reflections we see in the foregorund building, and the stunning details of the landmark itself. Perfect use of negative space in the sky, giving it a great overall balance and keeping it from being a "postcard".</td>', 'This image has great movement, clarity and vibrancy brought into a old, established reality. I love the clip of reflections we see in the foregorund building, and the stunning details of the landmark itself. Perfect use of negative space in the sky, giving it a great overall balance and keeping it from being a "postcard".', '2004-12-08 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052821, 125627, 749, '<td valign="top">Woah, as the photographer of ''Saint Pauls'', I think I recognise this location ;) Interesting choice of colours, esp the B&amp;W cathedral, and the long(ish) exposure helps soften that water nicely. Good to see such good photos of London in this challenge :)<br/> <br/>ROFL, thanks for the comment ;)</td>', 'Woah, as the photographer of ''Saint Pauls'', I think I recognise this location ;) Interesting choice of colours, esp the B&W cathedral, and the long(ish) exposure helps soften that water nicely. Good to see such good photos of London in this challenge :) ROFL, thanks for the comment ;)', '2004-12-08 18:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052822, 125853, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and stunning. Terrific reflections.</td>', 'Simple, clean and stunning. Terrific reflections.', '2004-12-08 18:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052825, 125630, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s perhaps just a bit too much wide-angle distortion here - it doesn''t quite suit the type of image this is - this clean, documentary style of shot - so the building just seem strange. Neatly done otherwise, though.</td>', 'There''s perhaps just a bit too much wide-angle distortion here - it doesn''t quite suit the type of image this is - this clean, documentary style of shot - so the building just seem strange. Neatly done otherwise, though.', '2004-12-08 18:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052826, 125374, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of tones and lighting. The reflection just makes this image. A shame that the one lamp is blown out, but the image is still stunning.</td>', 'Beautiful range of tones and lighting. The reflection just makes this image. A shame that the one lamp is blown out, but the image is still stunning.', '2004-12-08 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052827, 125874, 20779, '<td valign="top">A beacon of light and beauty. One of my favorites.</td>', 'A beacon of light and beauty. One of my favorites.', '2004-12-08 18:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052830, 125336, 20779, '<td valign="top">The colors, lines and textures just fascinate me with this image. Superb!</td>', 'The colors, lines and textures just fascinate me with this image. Superb!', '2004-12-08 18:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052831, 126272, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of the most moving pieces in the challenge, and just perfectly rendered. Classic and masterfully done.</td>', 'One of the most moving pieces in the challenge, and just perfectly rendered. Classic and masterfully done.', '2004-12-08 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052837, 126226, 20779, '<td valign="top">I can''t get over the serene, ethereal lighting and velvety softness rendered overall without sacrificing any clarity. Perfect composition within the frame, also.</td>', 'I can''t get over the serene, ethereal lighting and velvety softness rendered overall without sacrificing any clarity. Perfect composition within the frame, also.', '2004-12-08 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1052902, 125059, 24183, '<td valign="top">PHOTO IS TOO SMALL IF YOU NEED HELP TO MAKE IT BIGGER AND STAY BELOW 150K PLEASE PM ME</td>', 'PHOTO IS TOO SMALL IF YOU NEED HELP TO MAKE IT BIGGER AND STAY BELOW 150K PLEASE PM ME', '2004-12-08 18:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
