(1053399, 126199, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The stack of cannon balls on the left provides interesting perspective and lines that lead the eye naturally toward the center and other subjects. This is a photo that the eye simply wants to wander around for awhile. Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The stack of cannon balls on the left provides interesting perspective and lines that lead the eye naturally toward the center and other subjects. This is a photo that the eye simply wants to wander around for awhile. Very well done.', '2004-12-08 22:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053408, 125972, 3724, '<td valign="top">//www.savvycenter.com/explorer/roadside/pioneerplaza.htm<br/>Wonderful black and white detail (a perfect choice) of the amazing herd of bronze sculptures on a drive headed north.  This is just great.  Beautiful landmark foto......</td>', '//www.savvycenter.com/explorer/roadside/pioneerplaza.htmWonderful black and white detail (a perfect choice) of the amazing herd of bronze sculptures on a drive headed north.  This is just great.  Beautiful landmark foto......', '2004-12-08 22:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053409, 126115, 3724, '<td valign="top">STRONGMANISM........   in York, PA.    very funny......  great  landmark and foto.</td>', 'STRONGMANISM........   in York, PA.    very funny......  great  landmark and foto.', '2004-12-08 22:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053424, 125957, 10124, '<td valign="top">hey, that''s a great and unique perspective from a much over-photographed location.</td>', 'hey, that''s a great and unique perspective from a much over-photographed location.', '2004-12-08 22:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053464, 126146, 29269, '<td valign="top">I like this one, especially since I suspect that no desaturation was needed for this shot, and yet the color of the bridge is outstanding. I''m not sure how much of a busy street this is, but I would have preferred if you''d taken this shot from the middle of the road. That way you might have avoided that puddle on the right that is just a distraction.</td>', 'I like this one, especially since I suspect that no desaturation was needed for this shot, and yet the color of the bridge is outstanding. I''m not sure how much of a busy street this is, but I would have preferred if you''d taken this shot from the middle of the road. That way you might have avoided that puddle on the right that is just a distraction.', '2004-12-08 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053513, 126294, 24486, '<td valign="top">Wow you definetly picked the right time of the day to capture this image</td>', 'Wow you definetly picked the right time of the day to capture this image', '2004-12-08 23:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053522, 126295, 29486, '<td valign="top">All the trees do nothing to accentuate the castle</td>', 'All the trees do nothing to accentuate the castle', '2004-12-09 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053523, 124877, 29486, '<td valign="top">Over saturated a bit. It would actually be fine if there was a bit more focus or elegance to the image.  In otherwords, there is no river running through it or sun rays cascading through.  So it turns into a bright orange image.  The sign doesn''t help it at all.</td>', 'Over saturated a bit. It would actually be fine if there was a bit more focus or elegance to the image.  In otherwords, there is no river running through it or sun rays cascading through.  So it turns into a bright orange image.  The sign doesn''t help it at all.', '2004-12-09 00:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053525, 125874, 29486, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like to see the tower a little higher in the picture, just below the top. Too much space above it. The tower is nicely lit and since it is the subject, I would like to see it much clearer. Its a bit soft.</td>', 'I think I''d like to see the tower a little higher in the picture, just below the top. Too much space above it. The tower is nicely lit and since it is the subject, I would like to see it much clearer. Its a bit soft.', '2004-12-09 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053526, 126039, 29486, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, I like the way the wing gets larger into the side. The only thing really missing is a better background. Getting those colors to radiant might have really made this special.</td>', 'I like the angle, I like the way the wing gets larger into the side. The only thing really missing is a better background. Getting those colors to radiant might have really made this special.', '2004-12-09 00:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053527, 125946, 29486, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more Wook-Koo and less of the plant. The Wook-Koo should be tack sharp too.</td>', 'I would like to see more Wook-Koo and less of the plant. The Wook-Koo should be tack sharp too.', '2004-12-09 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053528, 125955, 29486, '<td valign="top">Tough shot. The front is in good light but the side is blown out. Lack of color contrast makes this just a snap shot.</td>', 'Tough shot. The front is in good light but the side is blown out. Lack of color contrast makes this just a snap shot.', '2004-12-09 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
