(1053557, 125656, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like your color is off. I''m guessing the monument is more white. Look at the flag and it''s yellow, not white.</td>', 'Looks like your color is off. I''m guessing the monument is more white. Look at the flag and it''s yellow, not white.', '2004-12-09 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053558, 125971, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good angle.</td>', 'Good angle.', '2004-12-09 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053559, 126051, 23458, '<td valign="top">This works well in black and white... though I do think Angrimur''s shot of this subject in colour worked slightly better. If in fact you are Angrimur please disregard this comment :P. The moon definately adds another element, though there may be too much empty space at the top. 6</td>', 'This works well in black and white... though I do think Angrimur''s shot of this subject in colour worked slightly better. If in fact you are Angrimur please disregard this comment :P. The moon definately adds another element, though there may be too much empty space at the top. 6', '2004-12-09 00:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053560, 125827, 29486, '<td valign="top">Having a slightly quicker shutter to eliminate the movement would have been nice. Look at the top center of the waterfall, it''s blurry. Cropping out the right side would be good too. Then you might have thought you were in the jungle.</td>', 'Having a slightly quicker shutter to eliminate the movement would have been nice. Look at the top center of the waterfall, it''s blurry. Cropping out the right side would be good too. Then you might have thought you were in the jungle.', '2004-12-09 00:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053565, 126203, 255, '<td valign="top">this is very cool. awsesome landmark and great editing too.</td>', 'this is very cool. awsesome landmark and great editing too.', '2004-12-09 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053567, 125957, 24841, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Just cool!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Just cool!', '2004-12-09 00:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053568, 126082, 24841, '<td valign="top">This photo really draws you in, makes you want to be there, makes you want to see it in color too :)  Just lovely.</td>', 'This photo really draws you in, makes you want to be there, makes you want to see it in color too :)  Just lovely.', '2004-12-09 00:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053571, 126272, 24841, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot...wonderfully balanced photo, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very emotional shot...wonderfully balanced photo, one of my favorites.', '2004-12-09 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053572, 126172, 24841, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic!</td>', 'Very dramatic!', '2004-12-09 00:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053574, 126114, 24841, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The clarity is unreal, looks like something out of a science fiction movie.  Love it!</td>', 'Very nice. The clarity is unreal, looks like something out of a science fiction movie.  Love it!', '2004-12-09 00:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053576, 125054, 24841, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon, great colors.</td>', 'Nice compositon, great colors.', '2004-12-09 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053581, 124710, 24841, '<td valign="top">Been across this many times, definate landmark here in Cali. It was actually my first thought for the challenge, but I went the other direction into the mountains.  Glad you decided on this, you did a great job!</td>', 'Been across this many times, definate landmark here in Cali. It was actually my first thought for the challenge, but I went the other direction into the mountains.  Glad you decided on this, you did a great job!', '2004-12-09 00:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053583, 125790, 24841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, one of my favorites. 10!</td>', 'Beautiful, one of my favorites. 10!', '2004-12-09 00:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053585, 126126, 10084, '<td valign="top">The white of the subject with the surrounding darkness really brings your eyes toward the subject. Love the warm vibrant colors of the flowers. "8"</td>', 'The white of the subject with the surrounding darkness really brings your eyes toward the subject. Love the warm vibrant colors of the flowers. "8"', '2004-12-09 00:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053589, 124877, 24841, '<td valign="top">Thought I was sick of the autumn leaves, until I saw this picture, very very nice.  The white sign against the beautiful environment is lovely.  Great shot.</td>', 'Thought I was sick of the autumn leaves, until I saw this picture, very very nice.  The white sign against the beautiful environment is lovely.  Great shot.', '2004-12-09 00:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053591, 125284, 24841, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda like a Christmas card. Makes me shiver to look at it.  Very nice!</td>', 'Looks kinda like a Christmas card. Makes me shiver to look at it.  Very nice!', '2004-12-09 00:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053593, 126261, 24841, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I especially like the sprinkling of lights in the building.  The lighting is perfect, really creates a mood.</td>', 'Very nice, I especially like the sprinkling of lights in the building.  The lighting is perfect, really creates a mood.', '2004-12-09 00:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053595, 126283, 24841, '<td valign="top">Love this shot at night much better than the daytime shots.  You got a very nice light surrounding the Bean andn the reflection is perfect.  Good job.</td>', 'Love this shot at night much better than the daytime shots.  You got a very nice light surrounding the Bean andn the reflection is perfect.  Good job.', '2004-12-09 00:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053597, 126270, 29486, '<td valign="top">It looks like the sky was gratioutously (sp?) thrown in to add some pizazz to the image.</td>', 'It looks like the sky was gratioutously (sp?) thrown in to add some pizazz to the image.', '2004-12-09 00:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053600, 125731, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like you just had to shoot. Hope you didn''t get too wet. A for effort.</td>', 'Looks like you just had to shoot. Hope you didn''t get too wet. A for effort.', '2004-12-09 00:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053601, 126207, 24841, '<td valign="top">I do not know what Hallgrimskirkja means, but will look forward to finding out at the end of the challenge.  This is a very emotional picture the B&amp;W is a perfect choice, really draws you in.  Very Nice one of my favorites.<br/></td>', 'I do not know what Hallgrimskirkja means, but will look forward to finding out at the end of the challenge.  This is a very emotional picture the B&W is a perfect choice, really draws you in.  Very Nice one of my favorites.', '2004-12-09 00:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053603, 125853, 29486, '<td valign="top">Cool. I assume you''re looking up to give a nice angle. Good color and lines.</td>', 'Cool. I assume you''re looking up to give a nice angle. Good color and lines.', '2004-12-09 00:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053605, 126270, 24841, '<td valign="top">The colors are outstanding.  Love it!</td>', 'The colors are outstanding.  Love it!', '2004-12-09 00:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053606, 126227, 29486, '<td valign="top">Would be an awesome photo if not for the big building behind it but not much you can do about that.</td>', 'Would be an awesome photo if not for the big building behind it but not much you can do about that.', '2004-12-09 00:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053609, 125225, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not enough interest</td>', 'Not enough interest', '2004-12-09 00:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053611, 125073, 29486, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool. The composition is good and everything looks pretty decent but I''m not sure what is up with the speckles. Almost like you boosted the saturation which had an effect on the tower.</td>', 'Kind of cool. The composition is good and everything looks pretty decent but I''m not sure what is up with the speckles. Almost like you boosted the saturation which had an effect on the tower.', '2004-12-09 00:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053612, 125587, 29486, '<td valign="top">The angle makes me feel a bit dizzy. Interesting photo.</td>', 'The angle makes me feel a bit dizzy. Interesting photo.', '2004-12-09 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053615, 126172, 29486, '<td valign="top">Great angle and framing. Since the topic is landmarks though I want the landmark to be more than just a spec in the photo. A little more zing to the color would have been good too.</td>', 'Great angle and framing. Since the topic is landmarks though I want the landmark to be more than just a spec in the photo. A little more zing to the color would have been good too.', '2004-12-09 00:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053620, 126140, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good variation of lines.</td>', 'Good variation of lines.', '2004-12-09 01:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053622, 125793, 29486, '<td valign="top">The trees make this look awful.  You should have found a better angle.</td>', 'The trees make this look awful.  You should have found a better angle.', '2004-12-09 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053623, 125728, 29486, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the glow and the composition.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the glow and the composition.', '2004-12-09 01:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053625, 125951, 29486, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast. A little more building and less black might have been even better.</td>', 'Very nice contrast. A little more building and less black might have been even better.', '2004-12-09 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053628, 125630, 29486, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. I want to say you used a wide angle lens because it looks a little buldged in the middle but the lines look pretty straight. Weird. I think it would have been a bit better if you stepped forward 2-3 steps and got rid of the foreground item.</td>', 'An interesting shot. I want to say you used a wide angle lens because it looks a little buldged in the middle but the lines look pretty straight. Weird. I think it would have been a bit better if you stepped forward 2-3 steps and got rid of the foreground item.', '2004-12-09 01:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053630, 125024, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of a landmark with some color. The stuff below is obviously distracting and doesn''t help things but you can''t much help that yourself.</td>', 'Nice choice of a landmark with some color. The stuff below is obviously distracting and doesn''t help things but you can''t much help that yourself.', '2004-12-09 01:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053631, 125442, 29486, '<td valign="top">I knock down other photos with trees in the front of the photo but for yours it seems like it works for some reason. Maybe because the top is exposed or because it seems clearer. Good job.</td>', 'I knock down other photos with trees in the front of the photo but for yours it seems like it works for some reason. Maybe because the top is exposed or because it seems clearer. Good job.', '2004-12-09 01:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053633, 126147, 29486, '<td valign="top">I wish this had much better DOF. That would have really made it shine.</td>', 'I wish this had much better DOF. That would have really made it shine.', '2004-12-09 01:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053637, 126252, 29486, '<td valign="top">A very dreary looking picture.</td>', 'A very dreary looking picture.', '2004-12-09 01:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053638, 126212, 29486, '<td valign="top">The angle is a bit harsh because of the text you have to read. It''s a little crooked too.</td>', 'The angle is a bit harsh because of the text you have to read. It''s a little crooked too.', '2004-12-09 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053639, 125059, 29486, '<td valign="top">Just not interesting. Too small too.</td>', 'Just not interesting. Too small too.', '2004-12-09 01:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053641, 125787, 29486, '<td valign="top">Good attempt but it just seems a bit dull</td>', 'Good attempt but it just seems a bit dull', '2004-12-09 01:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053644, 126049, 29486, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.', '2004-12-09 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053646, 126302, 29486, '<td valign="top">Funny. Good photo.</td>', 'Funny. Good photo.', '2004-12-09 01:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053649, 125893, 29486, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is nice but not special. My wife however loved it so I''ll bump it up a point. It just seems to me a little bleak because it''s in the shade.</td>', 'I think the photo is nice but not special. My wife however loved it so I''ll bump it up a point. It just seems to me a little bleak because it''s in the shade.', '2004-12-09 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053652, 125619, 29486, '<td valign="top">A fellow San Diegan. I hope the whole softness was kind of the point. I personally like things sharp though. Overall the image looks a bit muted in color.</td>', 'A fellow San Diegan. I hope the whole softness was kind of the point. I personally like things sharp though. Overall the image looks a bit muted in color.', '2004-12-09 01:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053653, 126152, 29486, '<td valign="top">Delicious.</td>', 'Delicious.', '2004-12-09 01:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053664, 126245, 29486, '<td valign="top">Is this the leaning tower of pisa?  The left side is perfectly straight but clearly the right isn''t. It''s either your angle or lens distortion. Still an interesting picture.</td>', 'Is this the leaning tower of pisa?  The left side is perfectly straight but clearly the right isn''t. It''s either your angle or lens distortion. Still an interesting picture.', '2004-12-09 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053666, 126057, 29486, '<td valign="top">Unflattering to the wall. It''s at an angle. The guy with his back to you doesn''t help it at all either.</td>', 'Unflattering to the wall. It''s at an angle. The guy with his back to you doesn''t help it at all either.', '2004-12-09 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053668, 126065, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not very much of anything. The shadows are harsh.</td>', 'Not very much of anything. The shadows are harsh.', '2004-12-09 01:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053670, 125989, 29486, '<td valign="top">A little too cluttered for my taste</td>', 'A little too cluttered for my taste', '2004-12-09 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053673, 126159, 29486, '<td valign="top">It feels like too much of this image is missing.</td>', 'It feels like too much of this image is missing.', '2004-12-09 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053675, 125967, 29486, '<td valign="top">No vibrancy and a basic dull subject.</td>', 'No vibrancy and a basic dull subject.', '2004-12-09 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053676, 126230, 29486, '<td valign="top">Given that yours is the third one of these, I know there is a beak and you left it out. Therefore you have left out the key element that it''s a chicken! Shame...</td>', 'Given that yours is the third one of these, I know there is a beak and you left it out. Therefore you have left out the key element that it''s a chicken! Shame...', '2004-12-09 01:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053677, 125860, 29486, '<td valign="top">It''s a picture of letters on a building. Not interesting.</td>', 'It''s a picture of letters on a building. Not interesting.', '2004-12-09 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053678, 125309, 29486, '<td valign="top">Just looks kinda plain</td>', 'Just looks kinda plain', '2004-12-09 01:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053679, 126272, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too much texture makes everything look like one in this image.</td>', 'Too much texture makes everything look like one in this image.', '2004-12-09 01:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053681, 125336, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice color. Helps make it more interesting.</td>', 'Nice color. Helps make it more interesting.', '2004-12-09 01:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053683, 125933, 29486, '<td valign="top">The angle is making me sick. Don''t like it at all.</td>', 'The angle is making me sick. Don''t like it at all.', '2004-12-09 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053687, 126291, 29486, '<td valign="top">The sunrise(set?) is ok but the valley looks bleak. Not because of anything you did, it just looks...industrial and not pretty.</td>', 'The sunrise(set?) is ok but the valley looks bleak. Not because of anything you did, it just looks...industrial and not pretty.', '2004-12-09 01:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053689, 125054, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and color</td>', 'Nice angle and color', '2004-12-09 01:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053690, 126177, 29486, '<td valign="top">At least you made it look good.</td>', 'At least you made it look good.', '2004-12-09 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053692, 126299, 29486, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-12-09 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053694, 126153, 29486, '<td valign="top">The bridge is leaning a bit. Nothing much jumps out of the image.</td>', 'The bridge is leaning a bit. Nothing much jumps out of the image.', '2004-12-09 01:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053695, 125791, 29486, '<td valign="top">The blown out sky helps the image I think due to the content. Nice.</td>', 'The blown out sky helps the image I think due to the content. Nice.', '2004-12-09 01:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053698, 125437, 29486, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus might have helped</td>', 'Sharper focus might have helped', '2004-12-09 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053700, 126185, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast to bring out whatever detail it looks like it has</td>', 'Not enough contrast to bring out whatever detail it looks like it has', '2004-12-09 01:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053701, 126146, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like an average snapshot. OK but nothing special.</td>', 'Looks like an average snapshot. OK but nothing special.', '2004-12-09 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053704, 126250, 29486, '<td valign="top">It''s too hard to see your subject</td>', 'It''s too hard to see your subject', '2004-12-09 01:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053758, 126300, 22479, '<td valign="top">An old familiar landmark here at DPC? :-)</td>', 'An old familiar landmark here at DPC? :-)', '2004-12-09 02:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053762, 126289, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah! I just returned today from SF. I wish I had gone one week earlier. It was overcast and rainy the whole time! Great  angle and perspective in addition to everything else there is to like about this shot. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Ah! I just returned today from SF. I wish I had gone one week earlier. It was overcast and rainy the whole time! Great  angle and perspective in addition to everything else there is to like about this shot. I hope it does well.', '2004-12-09 02:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053765, 126261, 22479, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky makes for a dramatic reflection! I think the framing works to your advantage in this particular shot. Well done.</td>', 'Dramatic sky makes for a dramatic reflection! I think the framing works to your advantage in this particular shot. Well done.', '2004-12-09 02:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053771, 125041, 30457, '<td valign="top">i think this is agreat photo but the area under the chin should have been burned in. other than that great pic.<br/></td>', 'i think this is agreat photo but the area under the chin should have been burned in. other than that great pic.', '2004-12-09 02:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053772, 126203, 22479, '<td valign="top">GREAT composition and framing. The plains in the distance and the dramatic sky are wonderful touches to this spectacular photo.</td>', 'GREAT composition and framing. The plains in the distance and the dramatic sky are wonderful touches to this spectacular photo.', '2004-12-09 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053776, 126029, 22479, '<td valign="top">There''s a horizontal (to the sensor''s orientation) banding pattern here reminescent of Canon 20D''s. I won''t hold it against this photo. Wonderful exposure, colors, and the stars are so sharp and prominent.</td>', 'There''s a horizontal (to the sensor''s orientation) banding pattern here reminescent of Canon 20D''s. I won''t hold it against this photo. Wonderful exposure, colors, and the stars are so sharp and prominent.', '2004-12-09 02:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053778, 126018, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great work bringing out the details of the tower against a relatively bright lit sky. Love the hazy transition to the bottom of the photo. Adds a distinctive artistic touch.</td>', 'Wow. Great work bringing out the details of the tower against a relatively bright lit sky. Love the hazy transition to the bottom of the photo. Adds a distinctive artistic touch.', '2004-12-09 02:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053780, 126230, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the way you framed this shot. Nice.</td>', 'Love the way you framed this shot. Nice.', '2004-12-09 02:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053782, 126191, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing and exposure!</td>', 'Excellent framing and exposure!', '2004-12-09 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053783, 125969, 22479, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail in this shot. Well composed.</td>', 'Amazing detail in this shot. Well composed.', '2004-12-09 02:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053791, 125630, 22479, '<td valign="top">VERY nice wide angle. I think you got the exposure picture perfect. So clear and sharp. Wonderful framing and composition. I cannot offer any suggestions for improvement.</td>', 'VERY nice wide angle. I think you got the exposure picture perfect. So clear and sharp. Wonderful framing and composition. I cannot offer any suggestions for improvement.', '2004-12-09 02:53:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1053794, 126142, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah another angle of this famous landmark. Technically without faults. Artistically framed very well and with excellent color rendition.</td>', 'Ah another angle of this famous landmark. Technically without faults. Artistically framed very well and with excellent color rendition.', '2004-12-09 02:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053799, 126008, 22479, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a very distinctive entry. I have absolutely no issues with your artistic presentation. Technically there is only one issue to point out as a distractor. In your effort to expand the dynamic range, you have, perhaps unavoidably, introduced haloing artifacts around the monument. My only suggestion would be to manually mask the area and expend more time and effort to minimize this type of effect. If it was your intention to introduce this effect, I''m sorry to say that I don''t think it adds anything to this excellent photograph. Good luck!</td>', 'Overall this is a very distinctive entry. I have absolutely no issues with your artistic presentation. Technically there is only one issue to point out as a distractor. In your effort to expand the dynamic range, you have, perhaps unavoidably, introduced haloing artifacts around the monument. My only suggestion would be to manually mask the area and expend more time and effort to minimize this type of effect. If it was your intention to introduce this effect, I''m sorry to say that I don''t think it adds anything to this excellent photograph. Good luck!', '2004-12-09 03:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053800, 125540, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite a distinctive entry. Well composed and technically without any significant faults. Well done!</td>', 'Quite a distinctive entry. Well composed and technically without any significant faults. Well done!', '2004-12-09 03:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053807, 125059, 22479, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way you drew a circle around your subject. You don''t have to do that to draw focus to your centerpoint. I''m afraid that in conjunction with an undersized entry, I cannot score this very highly. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t like the way you drew a circle around your subject. You don''t have to do that to draw focus to your centerpoint. I''m afraid that in conjunction with an undersized entry, I cannot score this very highly. Sorry.', '2004-12-09 03:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053809, 126095, 22479, '<td valign="top">Framed well and well composed. Technically adequate but I must point out one issue: this is advanced editing and you really could have cleaned up the dust spot in the upper edge of your photo with a quick clone stamp. If you don''t have access to an image editor to perform this maneuver, my apologies.</td>', 'Framed well and well composed. Technically adequate but I must point out one issue: this is advanced editing and you really could have cleaned up the dust spot in the upper edge of your photo with a quick clone stamp. If you don''t have access to an image editor to perform this maneuver, my apologies.', '2004-12-09 03:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053811, 126221, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the star effect! I overall like your exposure time (exposed to the focus of your shot). I find the extreme aspect ratio to be the only distractor here and a minor one at that.</td>', 'Love the star effect! I overall like your exposure time (exposed to the focus of your shot). I find the extreme aspect ratio to be the only distractor here and a minor one at that.', '2004-12-09 03:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053812, 125790, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and detailed. Like the fact that you did not use NI or other noise reduction on this photo. Such interesting shades and hues on the masonry. Excellent saturation on the potted plants.</td>', 'Very sharp and detailed. Like the fact that you did not use NI or other noise reduction on this photo. Such interesting shades and hues on the masonry. Excellent saturation on the potted plants.', '2004-12-09 03:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053816, 126121, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great framing and perspective! Didn''t realize the western wall was of such massive proportions.</td>', 'Great framing and perspective! Didn''t realize the western wall was of such massive proportions.', '2004-12-09 03:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053817, 126300, 27593, '<td valign="top">hi Zoomdak, good job</td>', 'hi Zoomdak, good job', '2004-12-09 03:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053820, 125073, 22479, '<td valign="top">First the positive: great sky and color saturation. I lke the framing and composition very much.<br/> <br/>The negative: I think you may have been over zealous with your noise reduction as there is somewhat of a posterized loss of fine detail.</td>', 'First the positive: great sky and color saturation. I lke the framing and composition very much. The negative: I think you may have been over zealous with your noise reduction as there is somewhat of a posterized loss of fine detail.', '2004-12-09 03:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053822, 126038, 27593, '<td valign="top">Bravo, I love this, clap clap clap.</td>', 'Bravo, I love this, clap clap clap.', '2004-12-09 03:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053824, 126039, 22479, '<td valign="top">There is a distracting loss of contrast and a haloing effect introduced by what I suspect to be overly prominent use of the Highlights and Shadows filter or alternative to that effect. Otherwise technically sound.<br/> <br/>With that aside, now for the good: I love the way you framed and composed this shot. The lone figure standing next to the larger subject adds so much more interest to this photograph. Well done.</td>', 'There is a distracting loss of contrast and a haloing effect introduced by what I suspect to be overly prominent use of the Highlights and Shadows filter or alternative to that effect. Otherwise technically sound. With that aside, now for the good: I love the way you framed and composed this shot. The lone figure standing next to the larger subject adds so much more interest to this photograph. Well done.', '2004-12-09 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1053829, 125862, 22479, '<td valign="top">Deja vu...I saw another bean earlier. I like this one better. A more pleasing composition and the reflection is quite interesting. Who''s that lone figure standing in the distance in the reflection? I wonder... :)</td>', 'Deja vu...I saw another bean earlier. I like this one better. A more pleasing composition and the reflection is quite interesting. Who''s that lone figure standing in the distance in the reflection? I wonder... :)', '2004-12-09 03:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
