(1053838, 126172, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite a wonderful sky and expanse of water. Adds a lot of interest but unfortuantely from this vantage, the castle is rather small and lacks much detail.</td>', 'Quite a wonderful sky and expanse of water. Adds a lot of interest but unfortuantely from this vantage, the castle is rather small and lacks much detail.', '2004-12-09 03:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
