(1053861, 125893, 22479, '<td valign="top">Blue cast and underexposed trees. Recommendation: apply a warming filter (or adjust color balance) and lighten up the shadows to really bring out the details in the trees. <br/> <br/>Artistically excellently composed with the trees and Half Dome balancing each other harmoniously. Just a couple of technical details which overall distracts from the appeal of this photograph.</td>', 'Blue cast and underexposed trees. Recommendation: apply a warming filter (or adjust color balance) and lighten up the shadows to really bring out the details in the trees.  Artistically excellently composed with the trees and Half Dome balancing each other harmoniously. Just a couple of technical details which overall distracts from the appeal of this photograph.', '2004-12-09 03:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
