(1053904, 126184, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I really like the hues in the sky and in the reflections. Crisp and sharp, and I really like the angle and perspective here. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Fantastic. I really like the hues in the sky and in the reflections. Crisp and sharp, and I really like the angle and perspective here. I hope it does well.', '2004-12-09 04:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
