(1053986, 126240, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot with great mood and color. The composition might be improved if the moon were a bit higher or if you cropped it a bit tighter, but it still came out great like this. Really nice job.</td>', 'Really cool shot with great mood and color. The composition might be improved if the moon were a bit higher or if you cropped it a bit tighter, but it still came out great like this. Really nice job.', '2004-12-09 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054005, 125041, 27605, '<td valign="top">Bold and daring idea, but in my opinion still a bit out of place.</td>', 'Bold and daring idea, but in my opinion still a bit out of place.', '2004-12-09 07:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054012, 126106, 19952, '<td valign="top">The composition on this shot is really outstanding and the colors look great together. Plus, you did a great job finding a creative vantage point to display the landmark.</td>', 'The composition on this shot is really outstanding and the colors look great together. Plus, you did a great job finding a creative vantage point to display the landmark.', '2004-12-09 07:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054013, 125952, 27605, '<td valign="top">Some elements of this photo work better for me than others... like the dof, boats, clouds, curve of river.  Problem with the ground &amp; railing, sign, use of big gun as landmark.</td>', 'Some elements of this photo work better for me than others... like the dof, boats, clouds, curve of river.  Problem with the ground & railing, sign, use of big gun as landmark.', '2004-12-09 07:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054016, 125309, 27605, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the people really lends perspective!  The apparent post processing is over the top for my taste, however.</td>', 'The inclusion of the people really lends perspective!  The apparent post processing is over the top for my taste, however.', '2004-12-09 07:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054020, 125627, 29462, '<td valign="top">Love it....</td>', 'Love it....', '2004-12-09 07:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054056, 125693, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice night shot with a wonderful reflection.</td>', 'Very nice night shot with a wonderful reflection.', '2004-12-09 08:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054060, 126298, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot! Colors and lighting is good but the detail of the building seems flat. Other than that good focus. The only distraction to me is the vertical aspect of the building is not parallel with the picture. I would of tried to crop so that the building would have been parallel. Good Shot!</td>', 'Nice Shot! Colors and lighting is good but the detail of the building seems flat. Other than that good focus. The only distraction to me is the vertical aspect of the building is not parallel with the picture. I would of tried to crop so that the building would have been parallel. Good Shot!', '2004-12-09 08:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054063, 125952, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and color. Something about the composition seems to be off to me. I think its the cannon seems to be tilted towards the camera and facing downward too much. Other than that good shot!</td>', 'Nice lighting and color. Something about the composition seems to be off to me. I think its the cannon seems to be tilted towards the camera and facing downward too much. Other than that good shot!', '2004-12-09 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054070, 125073, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting. Something about the tower seems to over sharpened in my opinion. Good composition and mood. Good Shot!</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting. Something about the tower seems to over sharpened in my opinion. Good composition and mood. Good Shot!', '2004-12-09 08:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054074, 125146, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph that to me appears to be well composed. The sharp vertical lines with the curved smoother lines on top make for an interesting view. Good Shot!</td>', 'Very nice photograph that to me appears to be well composed. The sharp vertical lines with the curved smoother lines on top make for an interesting view. Good Shot!', '2004-12-09 08:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054076, 126228, 27605, '<td valign="top">Slight  tilt to the right, also focus seems a bit soft (difficult in low light shots though).</td>', 'Slight  tilt to the right, also focus seems a bit soft (difficult in low light shots though).', '2004-12-09 08:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054078, 126188, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, but I think that the bright light draws the eye away from the scene.</td>', 'Nice effect, but I think that the bright light draws the eye away from the scene.', '2004-12-09 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054082, 125284, 27605, '<td valign="top">The wall in the foreground divides the photo, also the red tractor top distracts.  Pretty place... maybe a closer shot would have worked better.</td>', 'The wall in the foreground divides the photo, also the red tractor top distracts.  Pretty place... maybe a closer shot would have worked better.', '2004-12-09 08:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054083, 126181, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a unique perspective but the focal point [imo] is off. The base of your subject is out of focus making it hard to appreciate the details while the middle top [which is plan] seems to be in focus. I think this photograph would have been be better represented with the base of the monument in focus since it has more detail and letting the focus fade toward the top.</td>', 'Good attempt at a unique perspective but the focal point [imo] is off. The base of your subject is out of focus making it hard to appreciate the details while the middle top [which is plan] seems to be in focus. I think this photograph would have been be better represented with the base of the monument in focus since it has more detail and letting the focus fade toward the top.', '2004-12-09 08:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054096, 125587, 25024, '<td valign="top">Superb angle, composition and DOF - it has a surreal quality about it - it shouls do well.</td>', 'Superb angle, composition and DOF - it has a surreal quality about it - it shouls do well.', '2004-12-09 08:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054099, 126291, 25024, '<td valign="top">You''ve made a good job of a difficult exposure.</td>', 'You''ve made a good job of a difficult exposure.', '2004-12-09 08:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054100, 124710, 27562, '<td valign="top">With one of the most beautiful landmarks in America, how can you go wrong.  Great work.</td>', 'With one of the most beautiful landmarks in America, how can you go wrong.  Great work.', '2004-12-09 08:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054101, 126297, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, but the background is distracting particularly the left, I think a shallower DOF would have improved it, good luck</td>', 'Good lighting, but the background is distracting particularly the left, I think a shallower DOF would have improved it, good luck', '2004-12-09 09:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054105, 125946, 27562, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I just wish the wooden fence wasn''t in the frame.  Good work.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I just wish the wooden fence wasn''t in the frame.  Good work.', '2004-12-09 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054106, 126038, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, a good take on the theme. I like the long shadow and relief on the snow but as a whole it lacks punch - good luck</td>', 'Nice idea, a good take on the theme. I like the long shadow and relief on the snow but as a whole it lacks punch - good luck', '2004-12-09 09:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054155, 125933, 24189, '<td valign="top">Like the angle. Put''s a different twist on it. That is definitely a Dallas Landmark, the green-lined building.</td>', 'Like the angle. Put''s a different twist on it. That is definitely a Dallas Landmark, the green-lined building.', '2004-12-09 09:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
