(1054362, 126018, 22970, '<td valign="top">Not the worlds tallest building, its the worlds tallest tower @ 1815 feet. But that does not take away from your photograph. I like the way it seems to be foggy at the bottom and clear at top. I think you did a good job taking the photograph with good lighting, focus, and I like the toned down color. Good Job!</td>', 'Not the worlds tallest building, its the worlds tallest tower @ 1815 feet. But that does not take away from your photograph. I like the way it seems to be foggy at the bottom and clear at top. I think you did a good job taking the photograph with good lighting, focus, and I like the toned down color. Good Job!', '2004-12-09 12:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
