(1054795, 126143, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice job handling the exposure on this.  nice composition, as well.</td>', 'nice job handling the exposure on this.  nice composition, as well.', '2004-12-09 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054798, 125627, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent exposure.  the lights give atmosphere without washing anything out.  good work.</td>', 'excellent exposure.  the lights give atmosphere without washing anything out.  good work.', '2004-12-09 17:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054800, 126240, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t get it...what is stonehenge?</td>', 'i don''t get it...what is stonehenge?', '2004-12-09 17:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054808, 126172, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is an interesting image, i would not consider it a shot of a landmark except for it being entered in the landmark challenge.  the subject is too distant and not showing enough detail to compete with the birds in the foreground.  the image is fine, it''s just the challenge aspect that will hurt your score (and don''t get me wrong--i''m not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge, i''m just saying it''s not that strong of a challenge entry).</td>', 'while this is an interesting image, i would not consider it a shot of a landmark except for it being entered in the landmark challenge.  the subject is too distant and not showing enough detail to compete with the birds in the foreground.  the image is fine, it''s just the challenge aspect that will hurt your score (and don''t get me wrong--i''m not saying it doesn''t meet the challenge, i''m just saying it''s not that strong of a challenge entry).', '2004-12-09 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054826, 126038, 23394, '<td valign="top">can''t wait to see the other comments and the voting break down on this one...<br/> <br/>sometimes, at this time of day, you have to look not just where the light is coming from, but also where it''s going.  the strength of the shadows and the glare off the snow do not really leave a richness of texture that might have been found from a slightly different angle or if you had shot this 15 minutes later (assuming this is sunrise).  also, the image might have been more interesting if, instead of silhouetting the leaf, you had captured the leaf''s colors.</td>', 'can''t wait to see the other comments and the voting break down on this one... sometimes, at this time of day, you have to look not just where the light is coming from, but also where it''s going.  the strength of the shadows and the glare off the snow do not really leave a richness of texture that might have been found from a slightly different angle or if you had shot this 15 minutes later (assuming this is sunrise).  also, the image might have been more interesting if, instead of silhouetting the leaf, you had captured the leaf''s colors.', '2004-12-09 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054876, 126014, 23394, '<td valign="top">clever shot.  the lighting is a little strong, though.</td>', 'clever shot.  the lighting is a little strong, though.', '2004-12-09 18:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054878, 126242, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i can make out the lighthouse in the distance, it is too distant and too hazy to consider it the subject of the image.</td>', 'while i can make out the lighthouse in the distance, it is too distant and too hazy to consider it the subject of the image.', '2004-12-09 18:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054883, 126146, 23394, '<td valign="top">this view is rather imposing.  i can''t tell if you pushed the saturization or not, but if this is the way it looked when you shot it, the image would be stronger if you had backed up about 50 steps.  the red just eats the frame.<br/> <br/>i didn''t know this bridge was red, either.  i could sworn it was a steel-gray.  just goes to show, you can''t believe what you see...</td>', 'this view is rather imposing.  i can''t tell if you pushed the saturization or not, but if this is the way it looked when you shot it, the image would be stronger if you had backed up about 50 steps.  the red just eats the frame. i didn''t know this bridge was red, either.  i could sworn it was a steel-gray.  just goes to show, you can''t believe what you see...', '2004-12-09 18:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054908, 126029, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: flawed beauty. It has charm, great lighting and of course a wonderful peripheral interest in the Borealis. You''ved positioned the subject very well and you''ve got a good POV to create a dramtic composition. The sriations are an irritation and you''ve pushed the saturation to hard, making the red in the light very harsh. An unnecessary tweak in my view.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I do like this despite some flaws, so I''d probably come back to gaze at the eerie beauty it transmits.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong. Image critique: flawed beauty. It has charm, great lighting and of course a wonderful peripheral interest in the Borealis. You''ved positioned the subject very well and you''ve got a good POV to create a dramtic composition. The sriations are an irritation and you''ve pushed the saturation to hard, making the red in the light very harsh. An unnecessary tweak in my view. Out-of-challenge appeal: I do like this despite some flaws, so I''d probably come back to gaze at the eerie beauty it transmits.', '2004-12-09 18:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054911, 126106, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong - nice take on the brief.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: this has a great POV, lovely DOF and a cunning position for your subject. The low viewpoint demonstrates how useful the landmark is to someone who''s using it as a geographical reference point. Slow shutter has given you good depth at the cost of a little movement.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: very smart image so I''d revisit.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong - nice take on the brief. Image critique: this has a great POV, lovely DOF and a cunning position for your subject. The low viewpoint demonstrates how useful the landmark is to someone who''s using it as a geographical reference point. Slow shutter has given you good depth at the cost of a little movement. Out-of-challenge appeal: very smart image so I''d revisit.', '2004-12-09 18:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054915, 125957, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: great use of compositional triptych. Subdued colour gives it style. There''s a little haloing visible where you''ve been editing but your viewpoint is special.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yes - I''d return to view this.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong. Image critique: great use of compositional triptych. Subdued colour gives it style. There''s a little haloing visible where you''ve been editing but your viewpoint is special. Out-of-challenge appeal: yes - I''d return to view this.', '2004-12-09 18:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054923, 125861, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: weak, appalling, totally missed the point. Rubbishy rubbish. Poor.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: poor, poor, poor. So very, very poor.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: none whatsoever. Nil. Zeeeero.<br/> <br/> <br/>... OK - if I''m really pushed to comment on it -<br/>you''ve got a lovely scene here of the object (whatever it is) and a dynamic POV. The additional interest of the people is a nice touch, making for some lead-in lines as well as the bridgy thingy they''re wobbling on.<br/> <br/>The castle (is this where the Queen of America lives?) looks mighty pretty all lit up and stuff, and I think you''ve done it justice. Highlights are just a little blown, but I don''t think I''ve seen the White House look so good.</td>', 'Challenge link: weak, appalling, totally missed the point. Rubbishy rubbish. Poor. Image critique: poor, poor, poor. So very, very poor. Out-of-challenge appeal: none whatsoever. Nil. Zeeeero.  ... OK - if I''m really pushed to comment on it -you''ve got a lovely scene here of the object (whatever it is) and a dynamic POV. The additional interest of the people is a nice touch, making for some lead-in lines as well as the bridgy thingy they''re wobbling on. The castle (is this where the Queen of America lives?) looks mighty pretty all lit up and stuff, and I think you''ve done it justice. Highlights are just a little blown, but I don''t think I''ve seen the White House look so good.', '2004-12-09 18:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054927, 126184, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong indeed.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: very dynamic comp. Nice to see the other elements of the city in the background and you''ve chosen a lovely time of day.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: lovely image from an unusual viewpoint (well I haven''t seen it from here anyway!) so I''d come back.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong indeed. Image critique: very dynamic comp. Nice to see the other elements of the city in the background and you''ve chosen a lovely time of day. Out-of-challenge appeal: lovely image from an unusual viewpoint (well I haven''t seen it from here anyway!) so I''d come back.', '2004-12-09 18:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054929, 126203, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong - nice take on the brief.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: strong comp and a great landmark. I''m not sure where this one his (Yorkshire?) - and I may have walked around this. The image is good but I get the feeling taht it might be an OK shot with some salvage through some editing, mainly due to some subdued contrast towards the back of the hill. <br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: lovely scene. Reminds me of Yorkshire so I''d revisit.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong - nice take on the brief. Image critique: strong comp and a great landmark. I''m not sure where this one his (Yorkshire?) - and I may have walked around this. The image is good but I get the feeling taht it might be an OK shot with some salvage through some editing, mainly due to some subdued contrast towards the back of the hill.  Out-of-challenge appeal: lovely scene. Reminds me of Yorkshire so I''d revisit.', '2004-12-09 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054960, 125709, 2158, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the two buildings.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the two buildings.', '2004-12-09 19:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054979, 125425, 27574, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Beautiful!!!!!</td>', 'Absolutely Beautiful!!!!!', '2004-12-09 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054985, 126245, 2223, '<td valign="top">Stunning! 10</td>', 'Stunning! 10', '2004-12-09 19:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054992, 125336, 27574, '<td valign="top">Wonerful photo, love the colors.  In my opinion it would have had much more impact with a different crop...also the wihite area at the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'Wonerful photo, love the colors.  In my opinion it would have had much more impact with a different crop...also the wihite area at the bottom is distracting.', '2004-12-09 19:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054995, 125972, 27574, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture really got my attention...I wasn''t quite sure what I was looking at when I first saw it.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, this picture really got my attention...I wasn''t quite sure what I was looking at when I first saw it.  Beautiful.', '2004-12-09 19:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1054997, 126302, 27574, '<td valign="top">Really great shot...very sharp, great color....love the shadows on the building...very impressive</td>', 'Really great shot...very sharp, great color....love the shadows on the building...very impressive', '2004-12-09 19:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055000, 125630, 6667, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice  As a matter of personal taste though, I would have sacraficed the monument infront to get more close up to the house to avoid the wide angle curve.  The house itself is eye catching. Your eye bypasses the monument in the foreground.  BOL  Very clean, crisp and colorful. 6</td>', 'Wow. Nice  As a matter of personal taste though, I would have sacraficed the monument infront to get more close up to the house to avoid the wide angle curve.  The house itself is eye catching. Your eye bypasses the monument in the foreground.  BOL  Very clean, crisp and colorful. 6', '2004-12-09 19:36:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1055002, 125854, 2223, '<td valign="top">I hope you tell us what it is that is buried by the first tree on the right.</td>', 'I hope you tell us what it is that is buried by the first tree on the right.', '2004-12-09 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055003, 126214, 27574, '<td valign="top">I love this and I know it is going to score very high...I hope you will write a tutorial on how to get this look.</td>', 'I love this and I know it is going to score very high...I hope you will write a tutorial on how to get this look.', '2004-12-09 19:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055005, 126114, 2223, '<td valign="top">Stunning! 10</td>', 'Stunning! 10', '2004-12-09 19:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055011, 126114, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ominous to say the least.  Should be a contender for a ribbon with its rich grey and black tones.  Road leads your eye.  The very BOL. 8  My only comment would be the spec (of light I assume that is in the tree line left of the cooling tower) keeps catching my eye. Other than that this scene sends shiver down my spine!</td>', 'Ominous to say the least.  Should be a contender for a ribbon with its rich grey and black tones.  Road leads your eye.  The very BOL. 8  My only comment would be the spec (of light I assume that is in the tree line left of the cooling tower) keeps catching my eye. Other than that this scene sends shiver down my spine!', '2004-12-09 19:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055029, 126255, 6667, '<td valign="top">You just went to the head of the line with this one!!!  Cool, clean, and crisp. BOL  8  Which mission?  I have a similar shot of Santa Barbara which has a soft spot in my heart.</td>', 'You just went to the head of the line with this one!!!  Cool, clean, and crisp. BOL  8  Which mission?  I have a similar shot of Santa Barbara which has a soft spot in my heart.', '2004-12-09 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055032, 125693, 6667, '<td valign="top">Simply wow!</td>', 'Simply wow!', '2004-12-09 19:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055037, 126240, 2223, '<td valign="top">Freakin amazing !!!! I love stonehenge and this is just awesome! 10</td>', 'Freakin amazing !!!! I love stonehenge and this is just awesome! 10', '2004-12-09 19:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055043, 126299, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Certainly different!  BOL6</td>', 'Ok.  Certainly different!  BOL6', '2004-12-09 19:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055048, 126142, 6667, '<td valign="top">Thhis must be one heck of a popular place.  Your shot is the best of them so far. . . although it is sliding to the left slightly. BOL  6</td>', 'Thhis must be one heck of a popular place.  Your shot is the best of them so far. . . although it is sliding to the left slightly. BOL  6', '2004-12-09 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055053, 125121, 6667, '<td valign="top">Certainly would meet the "Yellow" challenge also! Bol</td>', 'Certainly would meet the "Yellow" challenge also! Bol', '2004-12-09 20:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055056, 126302, 6667, '<td valign="top">Damn that hurts!  very nicely done. BOL</td>', 'Damn that hurts!  very nicely done. BOL', '2004-12-09 20:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055058, 126106, 2223, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiiful!! I live close to here and travel this bridge often. 10</td>', 'Wow, beautiiful!! I live close to here and travel this bridge often. 10', '2004-12-09 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055060, 126159, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective.  BOL</td>', 'Very interesting perspective.  BOL', '2004-12-09 20:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055065, 125731, 6667, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt you have the most unique landmark ever!!!  You should get a ribbon jsut ofr finding this!</td>', 'Without a doubt you have the most unique landmark ever!!!  You should get a ribbon jsut ofr finding this!', '2004-12-09 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055066, 125933, 6667, '<td valign="top">Like the shot. . . not the slant!  BOL</td>', 'Like the shot. . . not the slant!  BOL', '2004-12-09 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055117, 125933, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice with the reflections, color, and lighting. I love the crop. Great Shot!</td>', 'Very nice with the reflections, color, and lighting. I love the crop. Great Shot!', '2004-12-09 21:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055121, 125540, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ah Yes.  I think I recognize this!  Nicely done.  Up close.  Only suggestion. . .polorizer might have deepened the clouds and the bright spots on the cheek of the face.  BOL  7  Here  Ok. One more comment.  The shrub  on the right should have been softened in color to make it less prominent.</td>', 'Ah Yes.  I think I recognize this!  Nicely done.  Up close.  Only suggestion. . .polorizer might have deepened the clouds and the bright spots on the cheek of the face.  BOL  7  Here  Ok. One more comment.  The shrub  on the right should have been softened in color to make it less prominent.', '2004-12-09 21:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055122, 126041, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! I love the mystic feel. Good lighting and perspective.</td>', 'Great Shot! I love the mystic feel. Good lighting and perspective.', '2004-12-09 21:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055126, 126192, 22970, '<td valign="top">I give your photograph a great shot rating because you took a great shot of a landmark I think we all know but did it in a perspective that I have not seen before. Great Job!</td>', 'I give your photograph a great shot rating because you took a great shot of a landmark I think we all know but did it in a perspective that I have not seen before. Great Job!', '2004-12-09 21:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055128, 126240, 22970, '<td valign="top">What can I say, this is amazing! I love the mood you have set in this photograph. Great Shot!</td>', 'What can I say, this is amazing! I love the mood you have set in this photograph. Great Shot!', '2004-12-09 21:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055143, 126240, 19978, '<td valign="top">Wow, great site and capture. Catching a moon rising over anything is a nice accomplishment. Catching the moon rising over Stonehenge is nearly mythic. The stones are beautifully silhouetted, the clouds look surreal. But the moon looks oddly out of place somehow. I''m not sure what I''m trying to say. I like it though and gave you a 7.</td>', 'Wow, great site and capture. Catching a moon rising over anything is a nice accomplishment. Catching the moon rising over Stonehenge is nearly mythic. The stones are beautifully silhouetted, the clouds look surreal. But the moon looks oddly out of place somehow. I''m not sure what I''m trying to say. I like it though and gave you a 7.', '2004-12-09 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055193, 126228, 24991, '<td valign="top">Nice shot man.</td>', 'Nice shot man.', '2004-12-09 21:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055264, 126255, 17296, '<td valign="top">The building is beautiful and the statue is beautiful, but I can''t decide which to look at. I think they draw focus from each other.</td>', 'The building is beautiful and the statue is beautiful, but I can''t decide which to look at. I think they draw focus from each other.', '2004-12-09 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055267, 125933, 17296, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the tilt. I don''t think it needed it. I think it takes away from the repeated vertical lines. Just my opinion... :)</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the tilt. I don''t think it needed it. I think it takes away from the repeated vertical lines. Just my opinion... :)', '2004-12-09 22:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055268, 126172, 17296, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic, but the focus isn''t really the castle. It''s a nice picture of ducks on a lake.</td>', 'Beautiful pic, but the focus isn''t really the castle. It''s a nice picture of ducks on a lake.', '2004-12-09 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055269, 126037, 17296, '<td valign="top">Maybe more contrast...</td>', 'Maybe more contrast...', '2004-12-09 22:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055275, 126159, 17296, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space</td>', 'great use of negative space', '2004-12-09 22:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055276, 126082, 17296, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-12-09 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055281, 125284, 17296, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the tower, pretty snow though.</td>', 'I can''t see the tower, pretty snow though.', '2004-12-09 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055282, 126250, 17296, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-12-09 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055286, 125861, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like the blurry woman...</td>', 'I like the blurry woman...', '2004-12-09 22:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055289, 125425, 17296, '<td valign="top">I wish the color popped more on this photo</td>', 'I wish the color popped more on this photo', '2004-12-09 22:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055292, 126014, 17296, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on miniatures, no pun intended...</td>', 'I''m not big on miniatures, no pun intended...', '2004-12-09 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055300, 126084, 17296, '<td valign="top">off topic</td>', 'off topic', '2004-12-09 22:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055314, 126214, 17296, '<td valign="top">the face in the window is eerie</td>', 'the face in the window is eerie', '2004-12-09 22:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055317, 125827, 17296, '<td valign="top">blurry, not bad for the moving elements, bad for the stationary ones...</td>', 'blurry, not bad for the moving elements, bad for the stationary ones...', '2004-12-09 22:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055325, 126245, 17296, '<td valign="top">strange angle</td>', 'strange angle', '2004-12-09 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055327, 126008, 17296, '<td valign="top">i don''t like that it''s cut off on the top...</td>', 'i don''t like that it''s cut off on the top...', '2004-12-09 22:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055373, 126041, 25464, '<td valign="top">This looks overprocessed at a first glance, but on second glance it suits the subject. 7.</td>', 'This looks overprocessed at a first glance, but on second glance it suits the subject. 7.', '2004-12-09 23:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055378, 125957, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfully composed shot.  I think I might have liked it better on a bright clear day.  I am not sure, but I am thinking this is seattle - if so, that bright day may be a long wait :)  Very interesting shot. 7.</td>', 'This is a wonderfully composed shot.  I think I might have liked it better on a bright clear day.  I am not sure, but I am thinking this is seattle - if so, that bright day may be a long wait :)  Very interesting shot. 7.', '2004-12-09 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055381, 125861, 25464, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, slight motion blur, and border are all VERY well done. Bumping up. 9.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, slight motion blur, and border are all VERY well done. Bumping up. 9.', '2004-12-09 23:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055390, 126051, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject, and the lighting and focus are great, but this one looks like it needs to be landscape to me.  I think I would have like to see the subject set up just as you have it (moon placement, but the sculpture in the left portion of a landscape frame with a leading horizon to the right.  Of course, I have no idea what may have been situated around this or if that is possible, it is just what my mind wants to see when I look at this shot.  Hope its helpful. 7.</td>', 'I like your choice of subject, and the lighting and focus are great, but this one looks like it needs to be landscape to me.  I think I would have like to see the subject set up just as you have it (moon placement, but the sculpture in the left portion of a landscape frame with a leading horizon to the right.  Of course, I have no idea what may have been situated around this or if that is possible, it is just what my mind wants to see when I look at this shot.  Hope its helpful. 7.', '2004-12-09 23:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055391, 126245, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great color, focus, and processing, but no real interest for me.  Just very well taken. 6.</td>', 'Great color, focus, and processing, but no real interest for me.  Just very well taken. 6.', '2004-12-09 23:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055394, 126106, 25464, '<td valign="top">The set up of this shot, in my opinion, makes the grass and reflection the prime subject, and not the bridge.   The water looks great.  I bet this would be a great shot of just the water and the grass.  Color is very nice. 5.</td>', 'The set up of this shot, in my opinion, makes the grass and reflection the prime subject, and not the bridge.   The water looks great.  I bet this would be a great shot of just the water and the grass.  Color is very nice. 5.', '2004-12-09 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055399, 126207, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and nice focus.  I think this might have had more impact in color. 6.</td>', 'Interesting composition and nice focus.  I think this might have had more impact in color. 6.', '2004-12-09 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055403, 126255, 25464, '<td valign="top">I bet you are getting lots of comments about leveling this one.  I like it.  The colors are magnificent.  I wonder if it couldn''t have been even more interesting without the black scupture in the front.  I think the top part of this building with a bit of red from the roof alone in the beautiful blue sky would have been great as well.  Good shot. 6.</td>', 'I bet you are getting lots of comments about leveling this one.  I like it.  The colors are magnificent.  I wonder if it couldn''t have been even more interesting without the black scupture in the front.  I think the top part of this building with a bit of red from the roof alone in the beautiful blue sky would have been great as well.  Good shot. 6.', '2004-12-09 23:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055406, 126270, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the partial building sky approach, but cropping across the windows is bothering me a bit.  Great color and very nice building. 6.</td>', 'I like the partial building sky approach, but cropping across the windows is bothering me a bit.  Great color and very nice building. 6.', '2004-12-09 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055496, 126227, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great angle/prespective on this one, and love the smokey sky around. Too bad the building on the right interfears with the whole mood of the shot. B&amp;W works well on this shot also. Still good work.</td>', 'Great angle/prespective on this one, and love the smokey sky around. Too bad the building on the right interfears with the whole mood of the shot. B&W works well on this shot also. Still good work.', '2004-12-10 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055497, 126283, 27847, '<td valign="top">That''s one interesting landmark, looks like a nut, upside down smile ... Like this night shot it makes this metalic bean look like a UFO at night. Only think I dislike abou the shot are the 4 lights below the bean (especially the 2nd from the left), very distracting maybe a low angle might have helped. Still cool shot.</td>', 'That''s one interesting landmark, looks like a nut, upside down smile ... Like this night shot it makes this metalic bean look like a UFO at night. Only think I dislike abou the shot are the 4 lights below the bean (especially the 2nd from the left), very distracting maybe a low angle might have helped. Still cool shot.', '2004-12-10 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055521, 125024, 18450, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a familiar sight!! Love the colours and composition of this image.</td>', 'Now that''s a familiar sight!! Love the colours and composition of this image.', '2004-12-10 02:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055526, 126214, 22479, '<td valign="top">Spooky...the woman sitting in the abandoned brothel is very unnerving. I think it adds a great deal of interest to this shot. Very creatively and artistically executed!<br/> <br/>Edit: I like this a lot, bumping up. :)</td>', 'Spooky...the woman sitting in the abandoned brothel is very unnerving. I think it adds a great deal of interest to this shot. Very creatively and artistically executed! Edit: I like this a lot, bumping up. :)', '2004-12-10 02:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055604, 125946, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful piece - the weathered cracks in the wood only add to the expressiveness of the statue. Whilst I''m absolutely with your decision no to centre the subject, I do find your choice of how to go about that a bit odd: that array of greenery seems indistinct, and disorganised.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful piece - the weathered cracks in the wood only add to the expressiveness of the statue. Whilst I''m absolutely with your decision no to centre the subject, I do find your choice of how to go about that a bit odd: that array of greenery seems indistinct, and disorganised.', '2004-12-10 04:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055605, 126211, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some odd perspective distortion has crept in here, presumably from your angle of shooting (else the US naval observatory has been built on the slant, which seems unlikely). Like the ceanliness of the long exposure - not easy to achieve and must have taken care. I think I''d have wanted to calm the brightness of the snow in post-processing - I think that loses some of the impact of the ''night'' element of this shot: there isn''t enough dark in this to speak of that.</td>', 'Some odd perspective distortion has crept in here, presumably from your angle of shooting (else the US naval observatory has been built on the slant, which seems unlikely). Like the ceanliness of the long exposure - not easy to achieve and must have taken care. I think I''d have wanted to calm the brightness of the snow in post-processing - I think that loses some of the impact of the ''night'' element of this shot: there isn''t enough dark in this to speak of that.', '2004-12-10 04:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055606, 126142, 6999, '<td valign="top">Technically fine - focus, exposure and the like. Subject and your approach to it: well, i think it could have been handled with more impact - you seem, to me, simply to have included all of the building, and as little else as possible without cutting off the cars; and that tells me nothing about this place other than exactly what it looks like - and I want to know where it''s set, what landscape it''s part of, how it relates to it''s environment.</td>', 'Technically fine - focus, exposure and the like. Subject and your approach to it: well, i think it could have been handled with more impact - you seem, to me, simply to have included all of the building, and as little else as possible without cutting off the cars; and that tells me nothing about this place other than exactly what it looks like - and I want to know where it''s set, what landscape it''s part of, how it relates to it''s environment.', '2004-12-10 04:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055607, 126153, 6999, '<td valign="top">OK shot, with some suggestion of the monumental size of the bridge. My guess is that your ISO has been pushed for this - it''s quite noisy in many areas. Like the loom of the supports against the darkening sky, and the sense of the night''s blare of oncoming headlights, but I find it lacks any great impact: perhaps in that it seems more about the road than the bridge, and it''s cluttered and not unusual in that area.</td>', 'OK shot, with some suggestion of the monumental size of the bridge. My guess is that your ISO has been pushed for this - it''s quite noisy in many areas. Like the loom of the supports against the darkening sky, and the sense of the night''s blare of oncoming headlights, but I find it lacks any great impact: perhaps in that it seems more about the road than the bridge, and it''s cluttered and not unusual in that area.', '2004-12-10 04:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055658, 125073, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and composition and I really like the muted colors. Very nice job.</td>', 'Excellent subject and composition and I really like the muted colors. Very nice job.', '2004-12-10 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055659, 126162, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent subject for this challenge and I really like the bright colors. The only thing you might want to consider is finding an angle that highlights the monument without the ferris wheel right behind it because it seems to detract from the main subject. But regardless, this is an excellent photo. Very nice job.</td>', 'This is an excellent subject for this challenge and I really like the bright colors. The only thing you might want to consider is finding an angle that highlights the monument without the ferris wheel right behind it because it seems to detract from the main subject. But regardless, this is an excellent photo. Very nice job.', '2004-12-10 07:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1055661, 125024, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and a good subject for this challenge. There appear o be some large spots on the right side of the photo, as if there are water spots on the lens or some muted lens flare. But regardless, the shot came out really well - good job.</td>', 'Very nice colors and a good subject for this challenge. There appear o be some large spots on the right side of the photo, as if there are water spots on the lens or some muted lens flare. But regardless, the shot came out really well - good job.', '2004-12-10 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
