(1056329, 125969, 22970, '<td valign="top">I love the lines and curves. Lighting is great along with focus. It is amazing how you can see the tiles, at first it made me think it was out of focus but with a second look i could see it was individual tiles I was seeing. I also like the crop. Title tells me the landmark and your crop leaves the mind open to imagination. Great Job!</td>', 'I love the lines and curves. Lighting is great along with focus. It is amazing how you can see the tiles, at first it made me think it was out of focus but with a second look i could see it was individual tiles I was seeing. I also like the crop. Title tells me the landmark and your crop leaves the mind open to imagination. Great Job!', '2004-12-10 15:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056337, 126207, 22970, '<td valign="top">You shot is a good example of how perspective can make or break a photograph. Their is nothing extra ordinary about your photograph but with your perspective it made a very good photograph. I love the lines, shadows, and lighting. Good Shot!</td>', 'You shot is a good example of how perspective can make or break a photograph. Their is nothing extra ordinary about your photograph but with your perspective it made a very good photograph. I love the lines, shadows, and lighting. Good Shot!', '2004-12-10 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
