(1056345, 125059, 22970, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but your photograph is just to small to judge. And the border makes it even smaller. Next time take advantage of the 640 x size option available.</td>', 'I''m sorry but your photograph is just to small to judge. And the border makes it even smaller. Next time take advantage of the 640 x size option available.', '2004-12-10 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056364, 126214, 27847, '<td valign="top">Intresting shot, and I see someone has a good sense of humor here. Must be the wife and/or girlfriend (EDIT - make that daughter) there enjoying the view (EDIT - In the cold) . Good shot. ;-)</td>', 'Intresting shot, and I see someone has a good sense of humor here. Must be the wife and/or girlfriend (EDIT - make that daughter) there enjoying the view (EDIT - In the cold) . Good shot. ;-)', '2004-12-10 16:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056385, 125862, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: very strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: powerful subject, great weather, crisp, good POV (you cast a good shadow!) and the reflected city is wonderful. The quality of the shot is lovely and the sculpture reminds me of the film ''Flight of the Navigator'' with the chromium space craft.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yup - very satisfying.</td>', 'Challenge link: very strong. Image critique: powerful subject, great weather, crisp, good POV (you cast a good shadow!) and the reflected city is wonderful. The quality of the shot is lovely and the sculpture reminds me of the film ''Flight of the Navigator'' with the chromium space craft. Out-of-challenge appeal: yup - very satisfying.', '2004-12-10 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056387, 126240, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong - you deserve much credit for the capture alone.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a powerful image and a dramatic subject. I think the processing has been pushed too far, rendering Stonehenge a bit too indistinct. Moon looks good - perhaps a little too central - but its''s large and eerie.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: I''ve reviewed this and I like it more each time, although the quite harsh processing is my only niggle.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong - you deserve much credit for the capture alone. Image critique: a powerful image and a dramatic subject. I think the processing has been pushed too far, rendering Stonehenge a bit too indistinct. Moon looks good - perhaps a little too central - but its''s large and eerie. Out-of-challenge appeal: I''ve reviewed this and I like it more each time, although the quite harsh processing is my only niggle.', '2004-12-10 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056427, 126039, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a classic landmark, but it looks like it has been cut out from a different background.. there is visible fringing around the silhouette</td>', 'This is a classic landmark, but it looks like it has been cut out from a different background.. there is visible fringing around the silhouette', '2004-12-10 17:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
