(1056435, 125861, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good composition. I always think that night shots tend to work better with a bit of color left in the sky... but this is very good and should do well. good luck</td>', 'Nice. Good composition. I always think that night shots tend to work better with a bit of color left in the sky... but this is very good and should do well. good luck', '2004-12-10 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
