(1056531, 125041, 22970, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the ''landmark'' challenge. I don''t think it fits well in this challenge and focus is soft. Not a bad picture but does have several distractions. One is the background to the left and above the nose. I think it would of been better if you could of achieved a deeper dof. Good use of B&amp;W. Wish you the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting take on the ''landmark'' challenge. I don''t think it fits well in this challenge and focus is soft. Not a bad picture but does have several distractions. One is the background to the left and above the nose. I think it would of been better if you could of achieved a deeper dof. Good use of B&W. Wish you the best in this challenge.', '2004-12-10 19:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056532, 125731, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but your photograph has to many distractions. The rain droplets or light flairs are very distracting. Looks like it was take through a car window on a rainy day. The title is OK but a better suitable title would be "This lane Closed". Wish you the best.</td>', 'I like the subject but your photograph has to many distractions. The rain droplets or light flairs are very distracting. Looks like it was take through a car window on a rainy day. The title is OK but a better suitable title would be "This lane Closed". Wish you the best.', '2004-12-10 19:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056537, 126142, 22970, '<td valign="top">I live only 100 miles for Atlanta and did not even know this KFC even existed. Nice colors, good focus, and a beautiful blue sky for the red chicken to blend with. I think this shot is an average shot but think it would of scored higher from a different perspective. As I look at your picture it seems that its going to flip over on its beak. Maybe [if you could have] standing more to the left would of given your picture dimension. As it sits the room slants downward to the left as the chicken slants to the right as it goes up. I know thats the lens [everyone has to deal with that] but moving to the left i think would of helped. [5]</td>', 'I live only 100 miles for Atlanta and did not even know this KFC even existed. Nice colors, good focus, and a beautiful blue sky for the red chicken to blend with. I think this shot is an average shot but think it would of scored higher from a different perspective. As I look at your picture it seems that its going to flip over on its beak. Maybe [if you could have] standing more to the left would of given your picture dimension. As it sits the room slants downward to the left as the chicken slants to the right as it goes up. I know thats the lens [everyone has to deal with that] but moving to the left i think would of helped. [5]', '2004-12-10 19:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056544, 126212, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph seems to be slightly off center [bottom more to the left than the top]. I know we all talk about thirds but in this picture if feel as if ''STANLEY'' would of been vertically in the middle given the picture an even flow outward would of been more apealing to the eye [imo]. However with that said I think you did a good job. I like the lighting, colors, shadows. As is [7]</td>', 'Your photograph seems to be slightly off center [bottom more to the left than the top]. I know we all talk about thirds but in this picture if feel as if ''STANLEY'' would of been vertically in the middle given the picture an even flow outward would of been more apealing to the eye [imo]. However with that said I think you did a good job. I like the lighting, colors, shadows. As is [7]', '2004-12-10 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056554, 126143, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting landmark. I really like the church and tree line reflection in the water.  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting landmark. I really like the church and tree line reflection in the water.  Good luck!', '2004-12-10 19:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056561, 125967, 22970, '<td valign="top">I know some of us are limited to the landmarks around our area and maybe this was the best you had access too. Even with that said i think you have a picture that could of been a good shot. Your perspective is to far away in my opinion. I don''t know if you could of go closer but that would of helped. The guide wires could of been a plus for you if you could of got close enough. As I look at your picture I think, and this is just my opinion, if you could of got close to one of the guide wires and took a picture from the guide wire up to wards the top of the towers with the towers being in focus not the guide wire, i think it would have been more interesting. The sky has clouds that could of been a good impact with some levels and curves. Sorry for such a long comment but I like pictures of structures and I believe this one had a chance to be good. Maybe retake another day and see what comes out. Good luck in the challenge, I wish you well.</td>', 'I know some of us are limited to the landmarks around our area and maybe this was the best you had access too. Even with that said i think you have a picture that could of been a good shot. Your perspective is to far away in my opinion. I don''t know if you could of go closer but that would of helped. The guide wires could of been a plus for you if you could of got close enough. As I look at your picture I think, and this is just my opinion, if you could of got close to one of the guide wires and took a picture from the guide wire up to wards the top of the towers with the towers being in focus not the guide wire, i think it would have been more interesting. The sky has clouds that could of been a good impact with some levels and curves. Sorry for such a long comment but I like pictures of structures and I believe this one had a chance to be good. Maybe retake another day and see what comes out. Good luck in the challenge, I wish you well.', '2004-12-10 19:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056563, 125861, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and use of motion blur.  I hope to see you in the top 10.</td>', 'Nice perspective and use of motion blur.  I hope to see you in the top 10.', '2004-12-10 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056574, 126106, 22970, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot at all. The problem I have with this photograph is the landmark in relation to your camera. The water, wiregrass, hills, and sky over powers the bridge. If the lights would not of been on the bridge would of been hard to see. With that said good color and lighting. Picture seems to have a bit of camera shake. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Not a bad shot at all. The problem I have with this photograph is the landmark in relation to your camera. The water, wiregrass, hills, and sky over powers the bridge. If the lights would not of been on the bridge would of been hard to see. With that said good color and lighting. Picture seems to have a bit of camera shake. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2004-12-10 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056582, 124877, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think you went with a little to much blur effect with this shot. If the sky would not of been so prominent then it may have been a good idea. The blur or mystical feel takes away from the fallen leaves and just don''t go well with the sharper sign to me. If this photo would of been leading the eye into the woods with out the sky i think it would of worked. I wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'I think you went with a little to much blur effect with this shot. If the sky would not of been so prominent then it may have been a good idea. The blur or mystical feel takes away from the fallen leaves and just don''t go well with the sharper sign to me. If this photo would of been leading the eye into the woods with out the sky i think it would of worked. I wish you the best in the challenge.', '2004-12-10 20:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056716, 126301, 27842, '<td valign="top">A liitle too much negative space.  I think a tighter crop would have made this better.  Sharp and well exposed though.</td>', 'A liitle too much negative space.  I think a tighter crop would have made this better.  Sharp and well exposed though.', '2004-12-10 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056719, 126095, 29472, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting as well as the crop job.</td>', 'I like the lighting as well as the crop job.', '2004-12-10 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056720, 125957, 27842, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That has a real other worldly feel.  The greenish tone really works well here. 9</td>', 'Wow!  That has a real other worldly feel.  The greenish tone really works well here. 9', '2004-12-10 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056721, 125969, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice detail</td>', 'Nice detail', '2004-12-10 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1056722, 125728, 27847, '<td valign="top">Excellent night photo here, very interesting gate. They don''t build them like that anymore. Only think tha should have been done (I think) is a little more cropping on the bottom, the speeding car lights at the bottom are very distracting. Instead of the photo drawing me towards the gate it''s looking down at the pretty lights. Other then that excellent work.</td>', 'Excellent night photo here, very interesting gate. They don''t build them like that anymore. Only think tha should have been done (I think) is a little more cropping on the bottom, the speeding car lights at the bottom are very distracting. Instead of the photo drawing me towards the gate it''s looking down at the pretty lights. Other then that excellent work.', '2004-12-10 22:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
