(1056741, 125893, 27842, '<td valign="top">Has a bluish cast and looks like there may be some chromatic aberation around the trees on the left.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Has a bluish cast and looks like there may be some chromatic aberation around the trees on the left.  Nice composition.', '2004-12-10 23:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
