(1057416, 125972, 6519, '<td valign="top">This leaves me wondering how many more there are on the left hand side (i.e. the crop is a little too tight for my liking) and I would have preferred it in color. Still a great shot for the challenge!</td>', 'This leaves me wondering how many more there are on the left hand side (i.e. the crop is a little too tight for my liking) and I would have preferred it in color. Still a great shot for the challenge!', '2004-12-11 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057419, 126272, 6519, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to word this any better, but I am finding the sky/clouds a bit too overwhelming, taking away from the importance and impact that should belong to the buildings. Good choice of location for the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how to word this any better, but I am finding the sky/clouds a bit too overwhelming, taking away from the importance and impact that should belong to the buildings. Good choice of location for the challenge.', '2004-12-11 16:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057420, 125787, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... nice silhouette, but since I don''t know the statue, I would have preferred to actually see it properly. I like the stark trees, but perhaps a more off-center composition would have looked better.</td>', 'Hmmm.... nice silhouette, but since I don''t know the statue, I would have preferred to actually see it properly. I like the stark trees, but perhaps a more off-center composition would have looked better.', '2004-12-11 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057422, 126166, 6519, '<td valign="top">I assume some local council/city paid lots of money for this piece of "art"...... great choice for the challenge, though, and a nice clear photo.</td>', 'I assume some local council/city paid lots of money for this piece of "art"...... great choice for the challenge, though, and a nice clear photo.', '2004-12-11 16:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057428, 126106, 6519, '<td valign="top">The bridge looks like a great choice for this challenge - so why did you hide it almost completely? Just about every other element in this photo has more impact than the bridge :-(</td>', 'The bridge looks like a great choice for this challenge - so why did you hide it almost completely? Just about every other element in this photo has more impact than the bridge :-(', '2004-12-11 16:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057433, 126162, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great landmark, and you picked a perfect time of day for taking that photo.</td>', 'Great landmark, and you picked a perfect time of day for taking that photo.', '2004-12-11 16:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057436, 126172, 6519, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, moody photo. In a way, I''d like to see the palace much much closer, but then you''d lose some of that atmosphere. hmmmm....</td>', 'Very interesting, moody photo. In a way, I''d like to see the palace much much closer, but then you''d lose some of that atmosphere. hmmmm....', '2004-12-11 16:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057439, 125957, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fascinating angle/composition, I''m trying to figure out where you took that photo from.</td>', 'Fascinating angle/composition, I''m trying to figure out where you took that photo from.', '2004-12-11 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057440, 126297, 6519, '<td valign="top">Perfect time of day for this shot! Could you have tried for a slightly more shallow DOF?</td>', 'Perfect time of day for this shot! Could you have tried for a slightly more shallow DOF?', '2004-12-11 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057443, 125797, 6519, '<td valign="top">interesting variation and good exposure . I would like it better if the window was open (but perhaps that wasn''t possible).</td>', 'interesting variation and good exposure . I would like it better if the window was open (but perhaps that wasn''t possible).', '2004-12-11 16:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057449, 125791, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am usually not fond of high key images, but in this case it works well..... adds to the starkness and misery of your subject.</td>', 'I am usually not fond of high key images, but in this case it works well..... adds to the starkness and misery of your subject.', '2004-12-11 16:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057457, 126228, 6519, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this place during daylight or at dusk and in color - this photo isn''t showing me enough detail. Lovely choice of subject for the challenge, though!</td>', 'I would like to see this place during daylight or at dusk and in color - this photo isn''t showing me enough detail. Lovely choice of subject for the challenge, though!', '2004-12-11 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057460, 126041, 6519, '<td valign="top">Big wow factor here! The lights are a bit blown out in my opinion, but still a magical photo.</td>', 'Big wow factor here! The lights are a bit blown out in my opinion, but still a magical photo.', '2004-12-11 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057463, 126226, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice choice and nice photo, but I think I would have looked even better while there was still a little bit of light in the sky to show some more details of the surroundings.</td>', 'Nice choice and nice photo, but I think I would have looked even better while there was still a little bit of light in the sky to show some more details of the surroundings.', '2004-12-11 17:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057465, 126008, 6519, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject, and I really like the added human factor. My only gripe is that the top is chopped off.... leaves me curious about how tall it is and what else I''m "missing".</td>', 'Great choice of subject, and I really like the added human factor. My only gripe is that the top is chopped off.... leaves me curious about how tall it is and what else I''m "missing".', '2004-12-11 17:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057467, 125989, 6519, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking place, great choice of subject. If only it was in color.</td>', 'Interesting looking place, great choice of subject. If only it was in color.', '2004-12-11 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057519, 126291, 30545, '<td valign="top">spectacular!</td>', 'spectacular!', '2004-12-11 18:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057520, 126018, 30545, '<td valign="top">very unusual and interesting rendition of common subject. Nice.</td>', 'very unusual and interesting rendition of common subject. Nice.', '2004-12-11 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057521, 126115, 30545, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2004-12-11 18:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057526, 125336, 30545, '<td valign="top">painterly and wonderful!</td>', 'painterly and wonderful!', '2004-12-11 18:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057527, 126214, 30545, '<td valign="top">chilling. Dramatic use of b/w - face is eerie, overall photo is very effective.<br/></td>', 'chilling. Dramatic use of b/w - face is eerie, overall photo is very effective.', '2004-12-11 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057528, 126214, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is that a ghost in the window?  Like the B&amp;W approach for this.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is that a ghost in the window?  Like the B&W approach for this.  Nice shot.', '2004-12-11 18:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057534, 126255, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great tones and clarity!  Nice photo.</td>', 'Great tones and clarity!  Nice photo.', '2004-12-11 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057564, 125854, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not exactly the "typical" landmark so it will get voted down by some, but still a superb entry.  You found the perfect lighting and the composed a wondeful composition to take advantage of it.  Everything works!  I hope the narrow minded voters see the talent it took to produce this classic.</td>', 'Not exactly the "typical" landmark so it will get voted down by some, but still a superb entry.  You found the perfect lighting and the composed a wondeful composition to take advantage of it.  Everything works!  I hope the narrow minded voters see the talent it took to produce this classic.', '2004-12-11 18:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057567, 124710, 19608, '<td valign="top">You are a brave person - the GG bridge has been photgraphed sooo many times.  But this is a good one, classic composition and good focus throughout.  Although your exposre is right on, thjis scene may actually look better when taken a bit underexposed.</td>', 'You are a brave person - the GG bridge has been photgraphed sooo many times.  But this is a good one, classic composition and good focus throughout.  Although your exposre is right on, thjis scene may actually look better when taken a bit underexposed.', '2004-12-11 18:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057570, 126211, 19608, '<td valign="top">That sky is truly awesome!  Exposure is right on - probably a bit difficult to do.  Too bad the building seems to be tilted a bit.</td>', 'That sky is truly awesome!  Exposure is right on - probably a bit difficult to do.  Too bad the building seems to be tilted a bit.', '2004-12-11 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057574, 126300, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice late light works well with the mistiness of the scene.  Peaceful and elegant.</td>', 'Nice late light works well with the mistiness of the scene.  Peaceful and elegant.', '2004-12-11 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057575, 126255, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great composition and perfect exposure.  The white building really pops against the blue (polarized?) sky.  The near sihlouette of the status/cross adds great drama and tension.</td>', 'Great composition and perfect exposure.  The white building really pops against the blue (polarized?) sky.  The near sihlouette of the status/cross adds great drama and tension.', '2004-12-11 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057576, 126240, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>While there is some distortion, this image remains a fascinating composition with this ancient work. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:While there is some distortion, this image remains a fascinating composition with this ancient work. Bumping up.', '2004-12-11 18:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057578, 126121, 19608, '<td valign="top">Certainly a world landmark - without question.  Very well exposed and composed.</td>', 'Certainly a world landmark - without question.  Very well exposed and composed.', '2004-12-11 18:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057580, 126162, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a sky!  Great colors make the landmark really sing.</td>', 'What a sky!  Great colors make the landmark really sing.', '2004-12-11 18:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057582, 126152, 24065, '<td valign="top">I haven''t traveled enough to recognize this landmark, but I do love it.  I think it''s my favorite in the challenge.  BOL  10</td>', 'I haven''t traveled enough to recognize this landmark, but I do love it.  I think it''s my favorite in the challenge.  BOL  10', '2004-12-11 18:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057583, 125874, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Very impressive and lovely. The view lends interest. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:Very impressive and lovely. The view lends interest. Bumping up.', '2004-12-11 18:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057584, 125059, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition through the circle.  It works well.  The sky is very overpowering and would be better on a clear blue-sky day.  I''m sure about a gizzilian voters have already suggested to use more of the allowed file size.</td>', 'Nice composition through the circle.  It works well.  The sky is very overpowering and would be better on a clear blue-sky day.  I''m sure about a gizzilian voters have already suggested to use more of the allowed file size.', '2004-12-11 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057585, 126240, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful, and I am so jealous!  10</td>', 'This is just beautiful, and I am so jealous!  10', '2004-12-11 18:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057589, 125656, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and perfect exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition and perfect exposure.', '2004-12-11 18:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057590, 126211, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Time exposures do add trails to the stars/ There are so many that they look like snow.  It seems that the sky should be a little darker to add more realism, but the image has enough merit as is.  Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments:Time exposures do add trails to the stars/ There are so many that they look like snow.  It seems that the sky should be a little darker to add more realism, but the image has enough merit as is.  Bumping up.', '2004-12-11 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057591, 126152, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - and a very interesting composition.</td>', 'Great colors - and a very interesting composition.', '2004-12-11 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057592, 125024, 19608, '<td valign="top">Pretty awesome!  Taken at just the right time of early night - with plenty of dark blue left in the sky.</td>', 'Pretty awesome!  Taken at just the right time of early night - with plenty of dark blue left in the sky.', '2004-12-11 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057594, 125336, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - the snow in the shadow really picked up a blue cast that echoes the sky nicely.  The golden of the building is a great contrast to the blues.  Too bad the building seems a bit tipped to one side.</td>', 'Great colors - the snow in the shadow really picked up a blue cast that echoes the sky nicely.  The golden of the building is a great contrast to the blues.  Too bad the building seems a bit tipped to one side.', '2004-12-11 18:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057595, 125054, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors in an excellent composition.  It all works well and clearly highlights a landmark.</td>', 'Great colors in an excellent composition.  It all works well and clearly highlights a landmark.', '2004-12-11 18:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057596, 126121, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Quite a site!</td>', 'returning for comments:Quite a site!', '2004-12-11 18:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057598, 126014, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and great choice of background.  Unfortunately your model isn''t the best rendition.</td>', 'Nice lighting and great choice of background.  Unfortunately your model isn''t the best rendition.', '2004-12-11 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057599, 126250, 30049, '<td valign="top">too bad the poles (?) had to be there...</td>', 'too bad the poles (?) had to be there...', '2004-12-11 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057601, 126029, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great Northen lights and excellent lighting on the lighthouse.  The red at the top of the building is a bit bothersome - but that''s a minor distraction when compared to this wonderful image in its entirety.</td>', 'Great Northen lights and excellent lighting on the lighthouse.  The red at the top of the building is a bit bothersome - but that''s a minor distraction when compared to this wonderful image in its entirety.', '2004-12-11 19:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057604, 125893, 30049, '<td valign="top">the blue cast on the rock face adds to the feeling that its a tad bit chilly there. :-)</td>', 'the blue cast on the rock face adds to the feeling that its a tad bit chilly there. :-)', '2004-12-11 19:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057606, 126240, 30049, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  Great photo...need to put that one on the wall.</td>', 'Breathtaking!  Great photo...need to put that one on the wall.', '2004-12-11 19:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057609, 126252, 30049, '<td valign="top">The building (which I take is the landmark) seems washed out and pixelated.  Appears that the focal point was the bridge sign?</td>', 'The building (which I take is the landmark) seems washed out and pixelated.  Appears that the focal point was the bridge sign?', '2004-12-11 19:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057615, 125439, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hard to miss that landmark.  Is the sky meant to have a green cast to it?</td>', 'Hard to miss that landmark.  Is the sky meant to have a green cast to it?', '2004-12-11 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057622, 125933, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle...who moved the floor?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting angle...who moved the floor?  Nice shot.', '2004-12-11 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057625, 126114, 30049, '<td valign="top">Time delay with no traffic, or blur?  Like it.</td>', 'Time delay with no traffic, or blur?  Like it.', '2004-12-11 19:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057639, 125853, 3697, '<td valign="top">I like the colored reflection, but what strikes me the most is the perspective you took this shot from. Great work.</td>', 'I like the colored reflection, but what strikes me the most is the perspective you took this shot from. Great work.', '2004-12-11 19:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057648, 126039, 24976, '<td valign="top">a bit on the dark side, maybe my monitor isnt calibrated the same as yours...</td>', 'a bit on the dark side, maybe my monitor isnt calibrated the same as yours...', '2004-12-11 19:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057651, 126041, 24976, '<td valign="top">perfect! 10</td>', 'perfect! 10', '2004-12-11 19:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057688, 125627, 16301, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, great exposure and colors too...</td>', 'I really like the composition, great exposure and colors too...', '2004-12-11 20:58:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1057712, 126300, 26151, '<td valign="top">I thought this might have been the Oregon coast. I did the PCH drive last year and it was spectacular. I recommend it to anyone.  Beautiful picture. The white waves really help, giving it a nice contrast.</td>', 'I thought this might have been the Oregon coast. I did the PCH drive last year and it was spectacular. I recommend it to anyone.  Beautiful picture. The white waves really help, giving it a nice contrast.', '2004-12-11 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057715, 126214, 26151, '<td valign="top">Ghost town is right. I think I see a ghost in there.</td>', 'Ghost town is right. I think I see a ghost in there.', '2004-12-11 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057716, 125540, 26151, '<td valign="top">Deja vu</td>', 'Deja vu', '2004-12-11 22:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057765, 126040, 13487, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  A good friend of mine got married in there... ironic.  Are you from stl?</td>', 'Good capture.  A good friend of mine got married in there... ironic.  Are you from stl?', '2004-12-11 23:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057776, 125374, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice BW.  I think I would have opted to move in a bit closer on the top of the reflection, and add a bit more sky above the building.  It seems a little cramped this way.  Also, a star effect on that light and reflection might have improved it a tad, but very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice BW.  I think I would have opted to move in a bit closer on the top of the reflection, and add a bit more sky above the building.  It seems a little cramped this way.  Also, a star effect on that light and reflection might have improved it a tad, but very nice shot.', '2004-12-11 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057779, 125789, 25464, '<td valign="top">Considering the angle of this structure, I think it would have bee better if it were placed in the frame more to the left rather than centered.  Otherwise, nice light, and nice silhouette.</td>', 'Considering the angle of this structure, I think it would have bee better if it were placed in the frame more to the left rather than centered.  Otherwise, nice light, and nice silhouette.', '2004-12-11 23:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057780, 126166, 25464, '<td valign="top">Quite strange, and nice shot.  No real wow for me, but definitely different.</td>', 'Quite strange, and nice shot.  No real wow for me, but definitely different.', '2004-12-11 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057782, 125728, 25464, '<td valign="top">The colors and light blur are interesting.  Definitely an interesting structure considering the bits of modern architecture showing in the background.  It might have been improved a bit by showing more of the surroundings to contrast the subject.  Great exposure and focus.</td>', 'The colors and light blur are interesting.  Definitely an interesting structure considering the bits of modern architecture showing in the background.  It might have been improved a bit by showing more of the surroundings to contrast the subject.  Great exposure and focus.', '2004-12-11 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057785, 126293, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the image and good title.  This could be any municipal building anywhere, but I guess they all would be considered landmarks.  Good.</td>', 'Nice detail in the image and good title.  This could be any municipal building anywhere, but I guess they all would be considered landmarks.  Good.', '2004-12-11 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057801, 125861, 29477, '<td valign="top">great night time shot...one of my highest rated photo''s in this competiiton.</td>', 'great night time shot...one of my highest rated photo''s in this competiiton.', '2004-12-11 23:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057802, 126240, 29477, '<td valign="top">This looks almost too good to be true...wonderful shot!  One of my favourites in this competition.</td>', 'This looks almost too good to be true...wonderful shot!  One of my favourites in this competition.', '2004-12-11 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057822, 126230, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think for the simplicity of this shot to work you really need a bright clear day with bold sky in the background.</td>', 'I think for the simplicity of this shot to work you really need a bright clear day with bold sky in the background.', '2004-12-12 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057823, 126295, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the building chosen as the subject, but I think your foreground choice is too overwhelming.  The foreground seems to be cluttering the shot rather than enhancing it to my eye.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the building chosen as the subject, but I think your foreground choice is too overwhelming.  The foreground seems to be cluttering the shot rather than enhancing it to my eye.  Good luck.', '2004-12-12 00:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057825, 126252, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this shot was zoomed in too closely.   The cropping of the top of the structure on the left is distracting.</td>', 'I think this shot was zoomed in too closely.   The cropping of the top of the structure on the left is distracting.', '2004-12-12 00:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057826, 126038, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is different, but too far a stretch for the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'This is different, but too far a stretch for the challenge in my opinion.', '2004-12-12 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057827, 125059, 22010, '<td valign="top">Too small. Distracting border.</td>', 'Too small. Distracting border.', '2004-12-12 00:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057828, 126207, 22010, '<td valign="top">My top pick for this challenge. The composition is great. Very cool perspective. Good color tones.</td>', 'My top pick for this challenge. The composition is great. Very cool perspective. Good color tones.', '2004-12-12 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057829, 126242, 25464, '<td valign="top">If the lighthouse in the background is meant to be the landmark, I feel it has been minimized rather than maximized by this shot.  I find nothing very striking about the coastline as well.  Keep trying.</td>', 'If the lighthouse in the background is meant to be the landmark, I feel it has been minimized rather than maximized by this shot.  I find nothing very striking about the coastline as well.  Keep trying.', '2004-12-12 00:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057831, 126287, 22010, '<td valign="top">The only flaw with this picture is the presence of branches. They''re somewhat distracting. Colors are great!</td>', 'The only flaw with this picture is the presence of branches. They''re somewhat distracting. Colors are great!', '2004-12-12 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057832, 125627, 22010, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail, nice colors. Very nice.</td>', 'Amazing detail, nice colors. Very nice.', '2004-12-12 00:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057833, 125041, 25464, '<td valign="top">While this is a somewhat creative approach, I just can''t make the stretch.  It has no asthetic appeal in my opinion.</td>', 'While this is a somewhat creative approach, I just can''t make the stretch.  It has no asthetic appeal in my opinion.', '2004-12-12 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057836, 125619, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I could say this meets the challenge, but I am not one to give out terrible marks for not meeting my opinion of what the challenge is meant to be.  I think the composition has some merit, I like the leading space in front of the train, but It seems a little too tight on the top.  I also think the soft focus seems inappropriate for this shot.  The colors are nice.  Good luck.</td>', 'I am not sure I could say this meets the challenge, but I am not one to give out terrible marks for not meeting my opinion of what the challenge is meant to be.  I think the composition has some merit, I like the leading space in front of the train, but It seems a little too tight on the top.  I also think the soft focus seems inappropriate for this shot.  The colors are nice.  Good luck.', '2004-12-12 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057841, 125439, 25464, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen a much closer shot of this.  The sky and water hold no real interest on this day, but the intricacy of the building itself could have.  I also think the dead centered composition detracts from the appeal of this image.  Good luck.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen a much closer shot of this.  The sky and water hold no real interest on this day, but the intricacy of the building itself could have.  I also think the dead centered composition detracts from the appeal of this image.  Good luck.', '2004-12-12 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057843, 126028, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative space and color. 5.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative space and color. 5.', '2004-12-12 00:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057845, 125121, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good composition.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good composition.', '2004-12-12 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057847, 125797, 25464, '<td valign="top">The windo approach is just not working for me here.  The curtains are cropped oddly, and the main interest in the tower is blocked by the window framing. and the trees.  It does look like a lovely place to live or visit.</td>', 'The windo approach is just not working for me here.  The curtains are cropped oddly, and the main interest in the tower is blocked by the window framing. and the trees.  It does look like a lovely place to live or visit.', '2004-12-12 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1057849, 126302, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a somewhat disturbing landmark.  Pretty well taken shot, but It doesn''t appeal to me personally.  I am curious what the story is behind this one.</td>', 'This is a somewhat disturbing landmark.  Pretty well taken shot, but It doesn''t appeal to me personally.  I am curious what the story is behind this one.', '2004-12-12 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
