(1058024, 126084, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: no clear landmark as the main feature here so not very strong on theme,<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: it''s a busy shot with no real focal point. This is more like a holiday snapshot than a deliberate attempt to win a challenge. Some peripheral detail interferes so i''d have cropped itjust right of the red boat and just below the the start of the opposite bank of the river. Colour is good and image is clean.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: it''s a nice snapshot of life here, but not much to bring me back for repeat viewings.</td>', 'Challenge link: no clear landmark as the main feature here so not very strong on theme, Image critique: it''s a busy shot with no real focal point. This is more like a holiday snapshot than a deliberate attempt to win a challenge. Some peripheral detail interferes so i''d have cropped itjust right of the red boat and just below the the start of the opposite bank of the river. Colour is good and image is clean. Out-of-challenge appeal: it''s a nice snapshot of life here, but not much to bring me back for repeat viewings.', '2004-12-12 05:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
