(1058136, 126041, 15497, '<td valign="top">This would have won the blue if it wasn''t for the "softness vs. oversharpening" Not sure what it is really, but there is something that isn''t right. It''s still a excellent composition. Good luck, bumping up to 7 due to composition.</td>', 'This would have won the blue if it wasn''t for the "softness vs. oversharpening" Not sure what it is really, but there is something that isn''t right. It''s still a excellent composition. Good luck, bumping up to 7 due to composition.', '2004-12-12 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058144, 126115, 25464, '<td valign="top">I realize this is a landmark challenge, so the idea of taking pictures of sculptures has to be relaxed some for this challenge; however, I feel like this is a flat representation of someone elses art.  I think it needed a more dramatic angle or more dramatic lighting to make it stand out.  Good luck.</td>', 'I realize this is a landmark challenge, so the idea of taking pictures of sculptures has to be relaxed some for this challenge; however, I feel like this is a flat representation of someone elses art.  I think it needed a more dramatic angle or more dramatic lighting to make it stand out.  Good luck.', '2004-12-12 10:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058146, 125933, 25464, '<td valign="top">Well, this one is definitely different.  The angle makes the composition interesting. It has very nice focus.  I really like the use of the reflection which makes the green edge lights really pop.</td>', 'Well, this one is definitely different.  The angle makes the composition interesting. It has very nice focus.  I really like the use of the reflection which makes the green edge lights really pop.', '2004-12-12 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
