(1058340, 125041, 19608, '<td valign="top">You get a point for humor.  Good focus on the landmark but I think a bit more DoF would also help.  For example, the eye lashes would be cool if they were nice and sharp.  It would also work better as a verical with quite a bit cropped off bioth the roight and left sides.  Nice tonal range - good strong blacks and close to a very bright white.</td>', 'You get a point for humor.  Good focus on the landmark but I think a bit more DoF would also help.  For example, the eye lashes would be cool if they were nice and sharp.  It would also work better as a verical with quite a bit cropped off bioth the roight and left sides.  Nice tonal range - good strong blacks and close to a very bright white.', '2004-12-12 14:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
