(1058383, 126082, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments:<br/>A great b/w study with the ideal sky to lend it character. The eyes follow the formation with ease as the tonal values give joy. very nice capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments:A great b/w study with the ideal sky to lend it character. The eyes follow the formation with ease as the tonal values give joy. very nice capture. Bumping up.', '2004-12-12 14:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
