(1058587, 125627, 19978, '<td valign="top">I have returned to this image several times and still can''t stop staring. Stunning result. The tones of the sky alone are breathtaking. I bow before your talent.</td>', 'I have returned to this image several times and still can''t stop staring. Stunning result. The tones of the sky alone are breathtaking. I bow before your talent.', '2004-12-12 20:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058588, 125731, 19978, '<td valign="top">This has the appearance of a snap taken hastily out the window of your car as you were on your way home one night. The subject is uninteresting, the tones are dark and depressing, and the drops on your lens are distracting.</td>', 'This has the appearance of a snap taken hastily out the window of your car as you were on your way home one night. The subject is uninteresting, the tones are dark and depressing, and the drops on your lens are distracting.', '2004-12-12 20:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058595, 125619, 7151, '<td valign="top">Soladad Lagoon, Torrey Pines Reserve, early morning?  :)  OK, I at least know its San Diego.  Interesting take on the theme, and I like the mood.</td>', 'Soladad Lagoon, Torrey Pines Reserve, early morning?  :)  OK, I at least know its San Diego.  Interesting take on the theme, and I like the mood.', '2004-12-12 20:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058605, 125862, 11738, '<td valign="top">Man... I bet some graffiti artists hav wet dreams about tagging this baby.  Would love to see this thing up close.</td>', 'Man... I bet some graffiti artists hav wet dreams about tagging this baby.  Would love to see this thing up close.', '2004-12-12 20:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058606, 125790, 11738, '<td valign="top">Does is really lean like that or is it just distortion?</td>', 'Does is really lean like that or is it just distortion?', '2004-12-12 20:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058609, 126245, 11738, '<td valign="top">man, this could have used ome serious perspective correction.</td>', 'man, this could have used ome serious perspective correction.', '2004-12-12 20:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058611, 126191, 11738, '<td valign="top">Peace Tower doesn&lt;t seem quite fociussed.  Toobad too, since it''s a pretty interesting image.</td>', 'Peace Tower doesn<t seem quite fociussed.  Toobad too, since it''s a pretty interesting image.', '2004-12-12 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058621, 126152, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before on DPC. I think the stained glass is well exposed, but the interior is somewhat subdued. Quite a difficult shot to take, I imagine. Overall I think you handled it well.....hmm...perhaps a fill flash on aperture priority with the same shutter speed would have improved the interior lighting?<br/> <br/>EDIT: Revisiting for another look. On second thought, I think the exposure is just fine the way it is. Would I prefer a brighter interior? Yes but it does not detract any from this outstanding photograph. Bumping up. 8<br/> <br/>EDIT: My pick for top three. Bumping again to 9.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before on DPC. I think the stained glass is well exposed, but the interior is somewhat subdued. Quite a difficult shot to take, I imagine. Overall I think you handled it well.....hmm...perhaps a fill flash on aperture priority with the same shutter speed would have improved the interior lighting? EDIT: Revisiting for another look. On second thought, I think the exposure is just fine the way it is. Would I prefer a brighter interior? Yes but it does not detract any from this outstanding photograph. Bumping up. 8 EDIT: My pick for top three. Bumping again to 9.', '2004-12-12 20:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058623, 125946, 11738, '<td valign="top">Looks like Paul Sr. from Orange County Choppers.</td>', 'Looks like Paul Sr. from Orange County Choppers.', '2004-12-12 20:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058669, 126262, 1031, '<td valign="top">Too bad it wasn''t wearing the big ape today! Good control of perspective.</td>', 'Too bad it wasn''t wearing the big ape today! Good control of perspective.', '2004-12-12 21:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058671, 126065, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on a local landmark.</td>', 'Nice lighting on a local landmark.', '2004-12-12 21:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058672, 126184, 1031, '<td valign="top">Plenty of landmarks in this one ... nice lighting.</td>', 'Plenty of landmarks in this one ... nice lighting.', '2004-12-12 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058673, 126287, 1031, '<td valign="top">Really like the lighting you got ... worth setting the alarm clock.</td>', 'Really like the lighting you got ... worth setting the alarm clock.', '2004-12-12 21:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058677, 126018, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, showing it rising out of the mist above the other buildings. Reminds me of the cover of an old Sci-Fi magazine ... as much as I like this hazy look, I''d also be tempted to try colorizing it rather garishly : )</td>', 'I like the composition, showing it rising out of the mist above the other buildings. Reminds me of the cover of an old Sci-Fi magazine ... as much as I like this hazy look, I''d also be tempted to try colorizing it rather garishly : )', '2004-12-12 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058678, 126114, 1031, '<td valign="top">From your title I infer an infra-red shot ... looks great. Hope you had to drive a long way to shoot this : )</td>', 'From your title I infer an infra-red shot ... looks great. Hope you had to drive a long way to shoot this : )', '2004-12-12 21:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058680, 124710, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Classic" view, well-done. I might try making the sky a little more saturated if it didn''t throw off everything else. Nice with the sailboats and no tankers : )</td>', '"Classic" view, well-done. I might try making the sky a little more saturated if it didn''t throw off everything else. Nice with the sailboats and no tankers : )', '2004-12-12 21:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
