(1058724, 126230, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great angle of capture--I hope this is doing well; it''s my pick for second place!</td>', 'Great angle of capture--I hope this is doing well; it''s my pick for second place!', '2004-12-12 22:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058726, 125969, 12253, '<td valign="top">This works wonderfully as a geometric abstract.  Excellent composition.  It might be a real killer to with sunset/sunrise light on the dome, but it works very well as is.  One of my picks for a ribbon in this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'This works wonderfully as a geometric abstract.  Excellent composition.  It might be a real killer to with sunset/sunrise light on the dome, but it works very well as is.  One of my picks for a ribbon in this challenge.  Good luck.', '2004-12-12 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058729, 126014, 12253, '<td valign="top">It''s a good studio capture, but no substitute for the real thing.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'It''s a good studio capture, but no substitute for the real thing.  Nice lighting.', '2004-12-12 22:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058734, 126038, 7485, '<td valign="top">While I agree with your title, to pull off a challenge interpretation like this you need a really stunning photo. This one has nice texture and lighting, but very little ''wow'' factor - 4</td>', 'While I agree with your title, to pull off a challenge interpretation like this you need a really stunning photo. This one has nice texture and lighting, but very little ''wow'' factor - 4', '2004-12-12 22:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058741, 125969, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the shape and simplicity, just whish the sky were a deeper blue (or maybe just go B&amp;W and pump up the contrast on the sky?)</td>', 'Love the shape and simplicity, just whish the sky were a deeper blue (or maybe just go B&W and pump up the contrast on the sky?)', '2004-12-12 22:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058744, 126028, 27104, '<td valign="top">excellent shot</td>', 'excellent shot', '2004-12-12 22:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058745, 125861, 27104, '<td valign="top">crisp and clean</td>', 'crisp and clean', '2004-12-12 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058748, 126029, 20324, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition, simple but effective, graphic like. (9)</td>', 'Nice colors and composition, simple but effective, graphic like. (9)', '2004-12-12 22:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058749, 126065, 27104, '<td valign="top">nice landscape</td>', 'nice landscape', '2004-12-12 22:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058751, 125041, 7485, '<td valign="top">To pull off a challenge interpretation like this, you need to produce a striking, technically perfect image. This one comes close, but has too many minor flaws: the weird light-gray shape sticking up and left from the nose, the almost centered composition (either make it centered or more off-center), and I would personally have preferred the DOF to include the whole face.</td>', 'To pull off a challenge interpretation like this, you need to produce a striking, technically perfect image. This one comes close, but has too many minor flaws: the weird light-gray shape sticking up and left from the nose, the almost centered composition (either make it centered or more off-center), and I would personally have preferred the DOF to include the whole face.', '2004-12-12 22:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058752, 125854, 27104, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2004-12-12 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058755, 126207, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Makes me both homesick (I grew up around the corner from Hallgrímskirkja) and longing for a wide-angle lens!</td>', 'Beautifully done. Makes me both homesick (I grew up around the corner from Hallgrímskirkja) and longing for a wide-angle lens!', '2004-12-12 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058793, 125425, 15811, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot -- great perspective and there''s just blue everywhere!  This is the kind of shot I strive to take (great angle and composition) -- great work!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot -- great perspective and there''s just blue everywhere!  This is the kind of shot I strive to take (great angle and composition) -- great work!', '2004-12-12 23:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058797, 126186, 15811, '<td valign="top">That''s just great -- I love night-time shots -- not sure exactly why, but they always appeal to me.  Seems to me you got a nice angle here and made something that''s usually plain look very interesting...nice work!</td>', 'That''s just great -- I love night-time shots -- not sure exactly why, but they always appeal to me.  Seems to me you got a nice angle here and made something that''s usually plain look very interesting...nice work!', '2004-12-12 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058798, 125587, 15811, '<td valign="top">Great subject choice here and great angle.  I''m not too sure that it''s a landmark, but I''ll take your word for it -- absolutely love the shot!</td>', 'Great subject choice here and great angle.  I''m not too sure that it''s a landmark, but I''ll take your word for it -- absolutely love the shot!', '2004-12-12 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058799, 125791, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shot really captures the mood of your subject.  Great detail and choice of border to accentuate the bleakness portrayed.  VERY good shot. Bumping up. 10.</td>', 'This shot really captures the mood of your subject.  Great detail and choice of border to accentuate the bleakness portrayed.  VERY good shot. Bumping up. 10.', '2004-12-12 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058801, 126114, 15811, '<td valign="top">awesome idea -- the long exposure makes that smoke look almost like liquid pouring out of those stacks.  great idea.</td>', 'awesome idea -- the long exposure makes that smoke look almost like liquid pouring out of those stacks.  great idea.', '2004-12-12 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058802, 126203, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shot is great.  It looks a bit grainy to me, but that may be intentional.  Composition is great, but I do wonder what it would look like with a bit more sky.  The patchwork fields in the mist are great as well. 9.</td>', 'This shot is great.  It looks a bit grainy to me, but that may be intentional.  Composition is great, but I do wonder what it would look like with a bit more sky.  The patchwork fields in the mist are great as well. 9.', '2004-12-12 23:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058805, 126283, 15811, '<td valign="top">haha where''d you go?  good idea, I like this shot a lot.  Something about nighttime shots that really do it for me.</td>', 'haha where''d you go?  good idea, I like this shot a lot.  Something about nighttime shots that really do it for me.', '2004-12-12 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058807, 125336, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...returning for comments -- i love this photo a lot.  The contrast in colors works really well here.  bumping up one notch - 10 :-D</td>', 'hrmm...returning for comments -- i love this photo a lot.  The contrast in colors works really well here.  bumping up one notch - 10 :-D', '2004-12-12 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058808, 125627, 15811, '<td valign="top">returning for comments -- I love this shot.  Great composition and great angle chosen here.  The lighting and colors works so well -- bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments -- I love this shot.  Great composition and great angle chosen here.  The lighting and colors works so well -- bumping up.', '2004-12-12 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058821, 126240, 255, '<td valign="top">wow, very eerie and cool--one of my favorites.</td>', 'wow, very eerie and cool--one of my favorites.', '2004-12-12 23:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058826, 126082, 20115, '<td valign="top">I love beachy head--this must have been extraordinary in color as well.</td>', 'I love beachy head--this must have been extraordinary in color as well.', '2004-12-12 23:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058827, 126106, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ah, someone from my neck of the woods! Beautiful photo, although your landmark is a minor player in this one.</td>', 'Ah, someone from my neck of the woods! Beautiful photo, although your landmark is a minor player in this one.', '2004-12-12 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058828, 125587, 1031, '<td valign="top">Rather reminds me of the inside of a video game -- nice effect.</td>', 'Rather reminds me of the inside of a video game -- nice effect.', '2004-12-12 23:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058830, 125790, 20115, '<td valign="top">I love this, it might be a little over saturated in a few places, but I still think it is great.  Where is it?</td>', 'I love this, it might be a little over saturated in a few places, but I still think it is great.  Where is it?', '2004-12-12 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058832, 125540, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good shot, beautiful light (you''ve certainly had enough practice with this one, huh?) ;-)</td>', 'Good shot, beautiful light (you''ve certainly had enough practice with this one, huh?) ;-)', '2004-12-12 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058833, 125619, 17103, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot in every way, and the soft focus is beautiful....9</td>', 'A lovely shot in every way, and the soft focus is beautiful....9', '2004-12-12 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058836, 126207, 17103, '<td valign="top">Magnificent architecture, very Gothic looking, and your point of view and composition does this structure justice; also beautiful black and white tonal range - 9</td>', 'Magnificent architecture, very Gothic looking, and your point of view and composition does this structure justice; also beautiful black and white tonal range - 9', '2004-12-12 23:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058837, 126065, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good, original interpretation of Landmark, and the perfect time of day to shoot it. Very good. With advanced editing allowed, I wish you had cloned out the shadow of the power line.</td>', 'A good, original interpretation of Landmark, and the perfect time of day to shoot it. Very good. With advanced editing allowed, I wish you had cloned out the shadow of the power line.', '2004-12-12 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058841, 126214, 17103, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, and although the sand looks a bit overexposed, this still rates an 8 from me.</td>', 'A lovely shot, and although the sand looks a bit overexposed, this still rates an 8 from me.', '2004-12-12 23:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058844, 126029, 17203, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, clever title. With a little less processing (the background and awkward red halo on the light are annoying), this might be a ribbon.</td>', 'A beautiful photo, clever title. With a little less processing (the background and awkward red halo on the light are annoying), this might be a ribbon.', '2004-12-12 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1058851, 126300, 17203, '<td valign="top">The colors are pretty, but the clarity doesn''t measure up to your past efforts. Time to hire a new model, Thomas. ;-)</td>', 'The colors are pretty, but the clarity doesn''t measure up to your past efforts. Time to hire a new model, Thomas. ;-)', '2004-12-12 23:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
