(1059204, 125627, 14603, '<td valign="top">I should have tried to put you off the 20D !!!!<br/> <br/>Congratulations Jon..so pleased you have a long overdue Blue.</td>', 'I should have tried to put you off the 20D !!!! Congratulations Jon..so pleased you have a long overdue Blue.', '2004-12-13 04:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1059211, 126302, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very surprised that this didn`t finish much higher.</td>', 'Very surprised that this didn`t finish much higher.', '2004-12-13 04:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1059216, 125587, 29462, '<td valign="top">Virtually no post production very slight levels a little more yellow, cropped rotated, neat imaged. If you visit this building at night your see how powerfully flood lit it is and the metal halide lights created the blue on the duct/pipe work and the yellow in the windows is pretty accurate of the warm interior lighting, I think this is a rare example of an architect actually planning the night view as much as day, but as one of the comments its not easy to capture the whole building. Thanks for all the comments they really help.</td>', 'Virtually no post production very slight levels a little more yellow, cropped rotated, neat imaged. If you visit this building at night your see how powerfully flood lit it is and the metal halide lights created the blue on the duct/pipe work and the yellow in the windows is pretty accurate of the warm interior lighting, I think this is a rare example of an architect actually planning the night view as much as day, but as one of the comments its not easy to capture the whole building. Thanks for all the comments they really help.', '2004-12-13 04:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1059219, 125627, 23456, '<td valign="top">A worthy winner congratulations !!!! Sorry I didn''t vote you higher at the time. This is a standout !</td>', 'A worthy winner congratulations !!!! Sorry I didn''t vote you higher at the time. This is a standout !', '2004-12-13 05:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
