(1059271, 125627, 7263, '<td valign="top">Whooo John, you beat me to the first blue ribbon - well done great shot.<br/> <br/>Like the kind of gritty feel this has, usualy this is shot all perfect and clean but the bridge has a gritty rusty element here which you do not usualy see. Nice work.</td>', 'Whooo John, you beat me to the first blue ribbon - well done great shot. Like the kind of gritty feel this has, usualy this is shot all perfect and clean but the bridge has a gritty rusty element here which you do not usualy see. Nice work.', '2004-12-13 06:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1059280, 125442, 16301, '<td valign="top">Man I was 100% sure most people would dislike the branches and find them cluttering/distracting, thats why I told you I love them ;) I think they add a really nice touch to the photo and makes it more interesting to look at. It should have done way better IMO!</td>', 'Man I was 100% sure most people would dislike the branches and find them cluttering/distracting, thats why I told you I love them ;) I think they add a really nice touch to the photo and makes it more interesting to look at. It should have done way better IMO!', '2004-12-13 06:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
