(1060595, 126172, 14603, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments.<br/>I realise that I made a mistake by showing too much of the landmark location for most voters tastes..but to be honest, I felt that without it, the pic lost it`s impact.<br/>Thamer..I try never to use the 640 pixels in the portrait mode as I hate having to scroll an image to see it all and thought that might be off putting for voters also...and at the end of the day, it didn`t really make a big difference to the image.<br/>Skip...don`t worry about it,you voiced the same concern as most commenters, which I totally accept as valid criticism...and btw the same holds good should you receive a comment from me...I don`t have the best track record :)<br/>Sweetlips..thanks for the kind words.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-13 17:48:34.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments.I realise that I made a mistake by showing too much of the landmark location for most voters tastes..but to be honest, I felt that without it, the pic lost it`s impact.Thamer..I try never to use the 640 pixels in the portrait mode as I hate having to scroll an image to see it all and thought that might be off putting for voters also...and at the end of the day, it didn`t really make a big difference to the image.Skip...don`t worry about it,you voiced the same concern as most commenters, which I totally accept as valid criticism...and btw the same holds good should you receive a comment from me...I don`t have the best track record :)Sweetlips..thanks for the kind words.', '2004-12-13 17:47:33.000000', '2004-12-13 17:48:34.000000', 0),
(1060615, 125627, 8367, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture, Jon. Congratulations!</td>', 'An excellent capture, Jon. Congratulations!', '2004-12-13 18:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
