(1061032, 126152, 4493, '<td valign="top">Yes this was shot in Downtown Dallas at Thanksgiving Square. I wanted to get a reshoot of this with my 12mm lens and dSLR. My other shot was with my Fuji 602 and it couldn''t get as wide as I wanted.<br/> <br/>-danny<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BrenB:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on a nice finish and a great shot.  Is this in Dallas, Danny?  I know you were going out shooting there.  I would love to know where this is.  Seeing your shot makes me want to see it in person. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Yes this was shot in Downtown Dallas at Thanksgiving Square. I wanted to get a reshoot of this with my 12mm lens and dSLR. My other shot was with my Fuji 602 and it couldn''t get as wide as I wanted. -danny Originally posted by BrenB: Congratulations on a nice finish and a great shot.  Is this in Dallas, Danny?  I know you were going out shooting there.  I would love to know where this is.  Seeing your shot makes me want to see it in person. ', '2004-12-13 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
