(1061196, 126240, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way 2 go Eddy!! I''m blown away now that I read your description. Tricked or not - this is a GOOD photo! Congrats.</td>', 'Way 2 go Eddy!! I''m blown away now that I read your description. Tricked or not - this is a GOOD photo! Congrats.', '2004-12-14 02:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1061206, 125587, 28742, '<td valign="top">Maybe 5th or 9th, but 59th?? Dang! This was one of 4 or 5 photos I gave a 10 to. I thought it had great impact, lines and the color is great! It looks like a setting in a video game actually. Great work.</td>', 'Maybe 5th or 9th, but 59th?? Dang! This was one of 4 or 5 photos I gave a 10 to. I thought it had great impact, lines and the color is great! It looks like a setting in a video game actually. Great work.', '2004-12-14 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1061219, 125630, 21245, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much to everyone for their kind and constructive criticisms!  This was my first attempt at this kind of photography.  I''d never tried to shoot a building before, so I was in waters untested.  I''m thrilled to see my first attempt was so well received, it is very encouraging!</td>', 'Thank you so much to everyone for their kind and constructive criticisms!  This was my first attempt at this kind of photography.  I''d never tried to shoot a building before, so I was in waters untested.  I''m thrilled to see my first attempt was so well received, it is very encouraging!', '2004-12-14 02:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1061342, 126039, 7151, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This was my highest rated photo for the challenge.  The lines and perspective are excellent, not to mention the colors and the great use of shadow.  Sorry to see it out of the top 10, let alone under 6.<br/> <br/>(Funny, I never noticed the oversharpening "halo", even on reviewing it.  Now that I see all the comments, OK, its there, but doesn''t seem that obvious to me.  Hardly a major flaw, and easily fixed.)</td>', 'Wow.  This was my highest rated photo for the challenge.  The lines and perspective are excellent, not to mention the colors and the great use of shadow.  Sorry to see it out of the top 10, let alone under 6. (Funny, I never noticed the oversharpening "halo", even on reviewing it.  Now that I see all the comments, OK, its there, but doesn''t seem that obvious to me.  Hardly a major flaw, and easily fixed.)', '2004-12-14 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1061375, 125619, 7151, '<td valign="top">Now you''ve got me stumped.  I''m going to have to find that viewpoint tomorrow at lunch - I work in Carsbad.  I''m always trying to find a good, uncluttered view of the Coaster.  (I entered a shot of it for a challenge last summer where it crosses the Buena Vista lagoon, but it wasn''t much of a picture.)  I really love the way you finished up this shot.  The softness and subdued color really work well with the normally bland brush.</td>', 'Now you''ve got me stumped.  I''m going to have to find that viewpoint tomorrow at lunch - I work in Carsbad.  I''m always trying to find a good, uncluttered view of the Coaster.  (I entered a shot of it for a challenge last summer where it crosses the Buena Vista lagoon, but it wasn''t much of a picture.)  I really love the way you finished up this shot.  The softness and subdued color really work well with the normally bland brush.', '2004-12-14 04:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
