(1062849, 126038, 29477, '<td valign="top">I actually thought that this was a creative interpretation for this challange.  The setting sun casting the loooooong shadow spoke volumes to me along with your title.  I gave it a 6.  I found people focused to much on a "recognizable" landmark rather than how a photographer interpreted the challange.  Anything can be a defining landmark to someone (or something) as your picture clearly demonstrates.  Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-14 23:58:44.</i></td>', 'I actually thought that this was a creative interpretation for this challange.  The setting sun casting the loooooong shadow spoke volumes to me along with your title.  I gave it a 6.  I found people focused to much on a "recognizable" landmark rather than how a photographer interpreted the challange.  Anything can be a defining landmark to someone (or something) as your picture clearly demonstrates.  Good job!', '2004-12-14 23:57:25.000000', '2004-12-14 23:58:44.000000', 0),
