(1065457, 125627, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well deserved blue ribbon for technically superior post processing. Of course, you have to have a great image to start with and you have captured that. This image is well composed with good perspective and combines two well known landmarks into one composition, perfect for this particular challenge.<br/> <br/>One of my top three picks for this challenge; an obvious choice.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-16 08:18:11.</i></td>', 'Well deserved blue ribbon for technically superior post processing. Of course, you have to have a great image to start with and you have captured that. This image is well composed with good perspective and combines two well known landmarks into one composition, perfect for this particular challenge. One of my top three picks for this challenge; an obvious choice.', '2004-12-16 08:11:53.000000', '2004-12-16 08:18:11.000000', 0),
(1065461, 126240, 5792, '<td valign="top">A well deserved ribbon winner. Very, very creative. Congratulations for both your unique idea and for your ability to fashion that into an outstanding technical achievement.<br/> <br/>This is a great example of modern photography.</td>', 'A well deserved ribbon winner. Very, very creative. Congratulations for both your unique idea and for your ability to fashion that into an outstanding technical achievement. This is a great example of modern photography.', '2004-12-16 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
