(1066379, 125627, 6999, '<td valign="top">... and lurking in the haze just to the right of the Cathedral, is the vague outline of one of the towers of the Barbican Centre: so make that three iconic bits of british architecture. That last, of course, doesn''t get quite the plaudits of the others.</td>', '... and lurking in the haze just to the right of the Cathedral, is the vague outline of one of the towers of the Barbican Centre: so make that three iconic bits of british architecture. That last, of course, doesn''t get quite the plaudits of the others.', '2004-12-16 19:52:01.000000', NULL, 0),
